{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:36:56.582757Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_11.state_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You finally collected all of the items which Myra asked for. Go talk to Zoltan in Edron and tell him that Myra nominated you for an award.", "translated": "Finalmente reuniste todos los artículos que Myra pidió. Ve a hablar con Zoltan en Edron y dile que Myra te nominó para un premio."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:36:56.583390Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_11.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >124 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Your current task is to bring 20 pieces of red cloth to Myra in Port Hope. These are said to make an excellent material for a cape.", "translated": "Tu tarea actual es llevarle 20 piezas de tela roja a Myra en Port Hope. Se dice que son un material excelente para una capa."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:36:56.583899Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_11.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Your current task is to bring 40 pieces of ape fur to Myra in Port Hope.", "translated": "Tu tarea actual es llevarle 40 piezas de piel de simio a Myra en Port Hope."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:36:56.585064Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_11.state_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Your current task is to bring 10 spools of spider silk yarn to Myra in Port Hope. Only very large spiders produce silk which is strong enough to be yarned by mermaids.", "translated": "Tu tarea actual es llevarle 10 carretes de hilo de seda de araña a Myra en Port Hope. Sólo las arañas muy grandes producen seda que es lo suficientemente fuerte como para ser tejida por sirenas."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:36:56.585796Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_11.state_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Your current task is to bring 60 lizard scales to Myra in Port Hope. Lizard scales are great for all sort of magical potions.", "translated": "Tu tarea actual es llevarle 60 escamas de lagarto a Myra en Port Hope. Las escamas de lagarto son excelentes para todo tipo de pociones mágicas."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:36:56.586345Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_11.state_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Your current task is to bring 40 red dragon scales to Myra in Port Hope.", "translated": "Tu tarea actual es llevarle 40 escamas de dragón rojo a Myra en Port Hope."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:36:56.587142Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_11.state_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Your current task is to bring 15 ounces of magic sulphur to Myra in Port Hope. Djinns are said to be good at extracting magic sulphur.", "translated": "Tu tarea actual es llevar 15 onzas de azufre mágico a Myra en Port Hope. Se dice que los Djinns son buenos para extraer azufre mágico."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:36:56.588025Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_11.state_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >196 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Your current task is to bring 30 ounces of vampire dusts to Myra in Port Hope. You might need to ask a priest for a special blessed stake to turn vampires into dust.", "translated": "Tu tarea actual es llevarle 30 onzas de polvo de vampiro a Myra en Port Hope. Es posible que tengas que pedirle a un sacerdote una estaca bendecida especial para convertir a los vampiros en polvo."}
