{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:37:11.986750Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_13.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Your current task is to bring 100 hardened bones to Trisha in Carlin. They can sometimes be extracted from creatures that consist only of - you guessed it, bones. You need an obsidian knife though.", "translated": "Tu tarea actual es llevarle 100 huesos endurecidos a Trisha en Carlin. A veces se pueden extraer de criaturas que consisten únicamente en, como habrás adivinado, huesos. Pero necesitas un cuchillo de obsidiana."}
