{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:38:17.504335Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_8.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >143 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Your current task is to retrieve the helmet of Ramsay the Reckless from Banuta. These pesky apes steal everything they can get their dirty hands on.", "translated": "Tu tarea actual es recuperar el casco de Ramsay the Reckless de Banuta. Estos molestos simios roban todo lo que encuentran en sus sucias manos."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:38:17.506049Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_8.state_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Your current task is to bring royal steel to Gregor in Thais. Royal steel can only be refined by very skilled smiths.", "translated": "Tu tarea actual es llevarle acero real a Gregor en Thais. El acero real sólo puede ser refinado por herreros muy expertos."}
