{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:38:17.508842Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_12.mission_9.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You found Angelina in a Prison. She told you a secret: Lynda in Thais can create a blessed wand. Greet her from Angelina, maybe she will aid you.", "translated": "Encontraste a Angelina en una prisión. Ella te contó un secreto: Lynda en Thais puede crear una varita bendita. Saludala de parte de Angelina, tal vez ella te ayude."}
