{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:38:31.942840Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_13.mission_1.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Sam sends you to see Kroox in Kazordoon to get a special dwarven armor. Just tell him, his old buddy Sam is sending you.", "translated": "Sam te envía a ver a Kroox en Kazordoon para conseguir una armadura enana especial. Sólo dile que su viejo amigo Sam te envía."}
