{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:38:31.945500Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_14.mission_1.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Spectulus in Edron has sent you on a mission to find out the whereabouts of a certain inventor. A beggar in Edron seems to know more about this topic than he wants to tell.", "translated": "Spectulus en Edron te ha enviado a una misión para descubrir el paradero de cierto inventor. Un mendigo en Edron parece saber más sobre este tema de lo que quiere contar."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:38:31.946459Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_14.mission_1.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The beggar turned out to be the inventor himself. You successfully convinced him to give you the only remaining plans of his creation. You should return to Spectulus in Edron to tell him the news.", "translated": "El mendigo resultó ser el propio inventor. Lo convenciste con éxito para que te diera los únicos planos restantes de su creación. Deberías regresar con Spectulus en Edron para contarle la noticia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:38:31.949472Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_14.mission_2.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Spectulus asked you to enter the Lost Mines beneath Edron and recover a rare crystal. In exchange for it you will gain access to the lair of the Collector who guards a vital component of the device.", "translated": "Spectulus te pidió que ingresaras a Last Mines debajo de Edron y recuperaras un cristal raro. A cambio, obtendrás acceso a la guarida del Coleccionista que guarda un componente vital del dispositivo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:38:31.950361Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_14.mission_2.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Luckily, you survived the horrors of the Lost Mines and recovered a rare crystal. You should visit Spectulus in Edron to seek counsel on what to do next.", "translated": "Afortunadamente, sobreviviste a los horrores de Last Mines y recuperaste un cristal raro. Debes visitar Spectulus en Edron para buscar consejo sobre qué hacer a continuación."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:38:31.952158Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_14.mission_3.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "In order to access the lair of the Collector, you will need to find the creature's well on an ice isle near Carlin. To donate the rare crystal overcome your greed and use it at the well's pedestal.", "translated": "Para acceder a la guarida del Coleccionista, necesitarás encontrar el pozo de la criatura en una isla de hielo cerca de Carlin. Para donar el cristal raro, supera tu codicia y úsalo en el pedestal del pozo."}
