{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:40:56.833805Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_22.mission_16.state_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You are now a honorary barbarian and can become a citizen of Svargrond. If you haven't done so yet, you should look for a barbarian in need of help in the north of the town.", "translated": "Ahora eres un bárbaro honorario y puedes convertirte en ciudadano de Svargrond. Si aún no lo has hecho, deberías buscar a un bárbaro que necesita ayuda en el norte del pueblo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:40:56.835953Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_22.mission_2.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Chakoyas may use the ice for a passage to the west and attack Svargrond. Use the rocks at east of nibelor on at least three of these places and the chakoyas probably won't be able to pass the ice.", "translated": "Chakoyas puede usar el hielo para pasar hacia el oeste y atacar Svargrond. Utilice las rocas al este de Nibelor en al menos tres de estos lugares y los chakoyas probablemente no podrán atravesar el hielo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:40:59.856863Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_13", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "So receive my prayer: 'Your hand shall be guided - your feet shall walk in <hicks> harmony'. Now, take your stake to Tyrias in <hicks> Liberty Bay for the next line of the prayer. I shall let him know what he is to do.", "translated": "Así que recibe mi oración: 'Tu mano será guiada - tus pies caminarán en armonía'. Ahora, lleva tu apuesta a Tyrias en <hicks> Liberty Bay para la siguiente línea de la oración. Le haré saber lo que debe hacer."}
