{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:41:42.421650Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_23.mission_2.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Henricus tells you to get The Witches' Grimoire, he sends you to Femor Hills where you can fly to the witches' mountain, say Eclipse to Uzon and he will take you there. Use the vial of holy water that he gives you on the big cauldron and open the chest to your left, then bring the witches' grimoire to Henricus.", "translated": "Henricus te dice que consigas el Grimorio de las Brujas, te envía a Femor Hills donde puedes volar a la montaña de las brujas, dile Eclipse a Uzon y él te llevará allí. Usa el frasco de agua bendita que te da en el caldero grande y abre el cofre a tu izquierda, luego lleva el grimorio de las brujas a Henricus."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:41:42.422486Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_23.mission_2.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Find the witches' grimoire and bring it to Henricus.", "translated": "Encuentra el grimorio de las brujas y llévaselo a Henricus."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:41:42.423021Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_23.mission_2.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You already brought the witches' grimoire to Henricus.", "translated": "Ya trajiste el grimorio de las brujas a Henricus."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:41:42.423951Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_23.mission_3.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >182 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Henricus wants you to find the Dwarfish Vampire Hunter, Storkus, located west of the Dwarf Bridge. It's good idea bring your 20 Vampire Dusts with you to save some time.", "translated": "Henricus quiere que encuentres al vampiro enano Hunter, Storkus, ubicado al oeste del Puente Enano. Es una buena idea llevar contigo tus 20 Vampire Dusts para ahorrar algo de tiempo."}
