{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:41:42.427661Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_23.mission_4.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Henricus will gave you a Special Flask (vial of holy water). Go to Liberty Bay and use the vial on an old house. Use this vial of holy water on that spot to drive out the evil being.", "translated": "Henricus te dará un Frasco Especial (frasco de agua bendita). Ve a Liberty Bay y usa el vial en una casa antigua. Utilice este frasco de agua bendita en ese lugar para expulsar al ser maligno."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:41:42.428188Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_23.mission_4.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Kill the Pirate Ghost and get back to Thais and report your mission to Henricus.", "translated": "Mata al fantasma pirata y regresa a Thais e informa tu misión a Henricus."}
