{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:44:31.345816Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_28.mission_5.state_27", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "In the south-east of Tiquanda is a small settlement of the lizard people. Beneath the newly constructed temple there, the lizards hide the urn. Acquire an ancient urn which is some sort of relic to the lizard people of Tiquanda.", "translated": "En el sureste de Tiquanda hay un pequeño asentamiento del pueblo lagarto. Debajo del templo recién construido, los lagartos esconden la urna. Adquiere una urna antigua que sea una especie de reliquia para el pueblo lagarto de Tiquanda."}
