{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:22.221351Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_4.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Daniel Steelsoul in Edron wants you to infiltrate the Edron Orc Cave and destroy 4 Spider Eggs.", "translated": "Daniel Steelsoul en Edron quiere que te infiltres en la cueva de orcos Edron y destruyas 4 huevos de araña."}
