{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:30.524039Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.themselves_were_to_be_the", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "themselves were to be the true and absolute rulers of Tibia. They did know no mercy in their rage! With fire and magic", "translated": "sami mieli być prawdziwymi i absolutnymi władcami Tibia. W swojej wściekłości nie znali litości! Z ogniem i magią"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:30.525534Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.then_however_uman_and_tibia", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Then however Uman and Tibia united, as it had been agreed upon, and Toth was born. Toth became the guardian of the", "translated": "Potem jednak Uman i Tibia zjednoczyli się, jak zostało uzgodnione, i narodził się Toth. Toth został strażnikiem"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:30.532877Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.there_is_no_better_way", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "There is no better way to get rid of top secret data. Awarded by TibiaSpy.com.", "translated": "Nie ma lepszego sposobu na pozbycie się ściśle tajnych danych. Nagroda przyznana przez TibiaSpy.com."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:36.548309Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_5.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Rabaz in Farmine asked you to collect samples from rare plant specimen in Zao. Go to the storage room to the west and receive the Botany Almanach. Find then the Giant Dreadcoil and use your Obsidian Knife on it to obtain a sample.", "translated": "Rabaz en Farmine te pidió que recolectaras muestras de un espécimen de planta raro en Zao. Ve al almacén del oeste y recibe el Botany Almanach. Encuentra luego el Giant Dreadcoil y usa tu cuchillo de obsidiana para obtener una muestra."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:36.549246Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_5.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >120 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Now you must find the second plant, a Giant Verminous and use your Obsidian Knife on it to obtain a sample.", "translated": "Ahora debes encontrar la segunda planta, una verminosa gigante y usar tu cuchillo de obsidiana para obtener una muestra."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:36.551109Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_7.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >134 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Search the Cursed Bone Pit in the dungeon north of Thais and dig for a well-preserved human bone for Muriel.", "translated": "Busca en el Pozo de Huesos Malditos en la mazmorra al norte de Thais y excava en busca de un hueso humano bien conservado para Muriel."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:36.553724Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_8.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Sanctify every single grave at the unholy graveyard north of Edron with the holy water.", "translated": "Santifica cada tumba en el cementerio impío al norte de Edron con agua bendita."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:36.554416Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_8.state_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You have sanctified all graves at the unholy graveyard of Edron. Report about your mission at Amanda.", "translated": "Has santificado todas las tumbas en el cementerio impío de Edron. Informe sobre su misión en Amanda."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:36.554914Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_8.state_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You helped Amanda by sanctifying the cursed graveyard of Edron.", "translated": "Ayudaste a Amanda a santificar el cementerio maldito de Edron."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:36.555650Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_9.name", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Exterminator", "translated": "The Exterminator"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:36.556498Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_9.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Padreia in Carlin asked you to exterminate the slimes in the sewers of Carlin by poisoning their spawn pool.", "translated": "Padreia en Carlin te pidió que exterminaras los limos en las alcantarillas de Carlin envenenando su piscina de desove."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:36.557246Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_9.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You poisoned the spawn pool of the slimes in the sewers of Carlin. Report to Padreia about your mission.", "translated": "Envenenaste el charco de generación de limos en las alcantarillas de Carlin. Informa a Padreia sobre tu misión."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:45:36.557851Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_31.mission_9.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You successfully helped Padreia in saving Carlin from a slimy disease.", "translated": "Ayudaste con éxito a Padreia a salvar a Carlin de una enfermedad viscosa."}
