{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:46:25.446718Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_34.mission_1.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Go to the tunnel in eastern Muggy Plains and reach the other side. Try to hide in the dark and avoid being seen at all by using the crate. After that you need to find the rebel hideout and talk to their leader Chartan.", "translated": "Vaya al túnel en el este de Muggy Plains y llegue al otro lado. Intenta esconderte en la oscuridad y evita que te vean usando la caja. Después de eso tendrás que encontrar el escondite de los rebeldes y hablar con su líder Chartan."}
