{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:05.951253Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.turn_the_switch_to_the", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Turn the switch to the right and follow the blue sunshine to get to Demona. You know the rest of the way.", "translated": "Przekręć przełącznik w prawo i podążaj za niebieskim słońcem, aby dotrzeć do Demona. Resztę znasz."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:19.833127Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_37.mission_4.description", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >114 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Undead dragons aspires for life. No better way to see life as it grows around the world, is there?", "translated": "Undead dragones aspira a la vida. No hay mejor manera de ver la vida a medida que crece en todo el mundo, ¿verdad?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:19.833881Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_1.description_dynamic", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "James asked you to enter the cave for hunting 50 empowered minotaurs. Then he will be able to continue his research.\nMinotaurs killed: %d/50", "translated": "James te pidió que entraras a la cueva para cazar 50 minotauros potenciados. Entonces podrá continuar su investigación.\nMinotaurs asesinado: %d/50"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:19.836523Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_2.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >99 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "You found an entrance to the minotaur boss. You killed it and now you have to return to Jamesfrancis.", "translated": "Encontraste una entrada al jefe minotauro. Lo mataste y ahora tienes que regresar con Jamesfrancis."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:19.837499Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_2.state_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You have reported the Druid of Crunor about the minotaur cult.", "translated": "Has informado el Druid de Crunor sobre el culto al minotauro."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:19.837939Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_3.name", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Patron of Arts", "translated": "Patron of Arts"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:19.838776Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_3.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Cronor gave you the hint that the Thais exhibition has expanded. The new section is called MOTA (Museum of Tibian Arts). It's really worth a visit.", "translated": "El Druid de Cronor te dio la pista de que la exposición Thais se ha ampliado. La nueva sección se llama MOTA (Museo de Artes Tibias). Realmente vale la pena una visita."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:19.841991Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_3.state_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Denomintator opened the door for you after you answered his questions to the wanted number. In the end he mentioned the Druid of Conor. Maybe you should pay him a visit.", "translated": "El Denominador le abrió la puerta después de que respondió sus preguntas al número buscado. Al final mencionó el Druid de Conor. Quizás deberías hacerle una visita."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:19.843886Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_3.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You found a ransom note, wich requests you to pay some money for the stolen picture to a stonge in Kazordoon. His name is Iwar. Nevertheless I should talk to Gareth first.", "translated": "Encontraste una nota de rescate que te pide que pagues algo de dinero por la foto robada a un hombre de Kazordoon. Su nombre es Iwar. Sin embargo, primero debería hablar con Gareth."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:22.526156Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.dedoras.stdmod_13", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >325 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Of course the dangers of such knowledge were obvious. It was hidden in a sacred place devoted to Zathroth and dangerous knowledge. ... \\z\n\tThe hidden library, the forbidden hoard, the shrouded trove of knowledge or the veiled hoard of forbidden knowledge, the place has many names in many {myths}.", "translated": "Por supuesto, los peligros de tal conocimiento eran obvios. Estaba escondido en un lugar sagrado dedicado a Zathroth y al conocimiento peligroso. ...\\z\n\tLa biblioteca oculta, el tesoro prohibido, el tesoro oculto del conocimiento o el tesoro velado del conocimiento prohibido, el lugar tiene muchos nombres en muchos {myths}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:24.149923Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.ultimate_healing_rune_800gp", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "pl_unexpected_uppercase", "severity": "LOW", "message": "PL: EN zaczyna małą 'u', PL wielką 'R'"}], "en": "ultimate healing rune (800gp)", "translated": "Runa ostatecznego leczenia (800sz)"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:24.150847Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.uman_in_his_wisdom_recognized", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Uman in his wisdom recognized the possibilities, which revealed themselves to them here, and he asked Tibiasula to join in the", "translated": "Uman w swojej mądrości rozpoznał możliwości, które przed nimi się tutaj ukazały i poprosił Tibiasulę, aby przyłączyła się do niego"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:24.154168Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "books.json", "key": "book.otbm.under_strict_protection_by_the", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Under strict protection by the Royal Council of Carlin.", "translated": "Pod ścisłą ochroną Rady Królewskiej Carlin."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:34.652554Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_3.state_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You paid the money to stooge in Kazordoon. You were told that the picture is delivered to Gareth himself.", "translated": "Pagaste el dinero para ser títere en Kazordoon. Le dijeron que la fotografía se la entregaron al propio Gareth."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:34.656281Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_4.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The members of the Barkless follow a rigid path of hardship and sacrifice. Their cult is located somewhere beneath Ab'dendriel. Whatever happened to their leader, only a true Barkless can find out.", "translated": "Los miembros del Barkless siguen un rígido camino de penurias y sacrificios. Su culto se encuentra en algún lugar debajo de Ab'dendriel. Lo que sea que le haya pasado a su líder, sólo un verdadero Barkless puede descubrirlo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:34.659204Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_4.state_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You broke enough Barkless markings to now reverse the seal held up by the cult object in the ritual chamber. The power you gained feels unnatural and excessive but it seems ther is no other way.", "translated": "Rompiste suficientes marcas Barkless para ahora revertir el sello que sostiene el objeto de culto en la cámara ritual. El poder que obtuviste parece antinatural y excesivo, pero parece que no hay otra manera."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:34.660432Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_4.state_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Something far more powerful than the beliel of your Barkless brothers and sisters powered the seal to the leader. Whatever the case - find Leiden, or as he's known to his devotees: the \"Penitent\".", "translated": "Algo mucho más poderoso que la creencia de tus hermanos y hermanas Barkless impulsó el sello hacia el líder. Cualquiera sea el caso, encuentre a Leiden, o como lo conocen sus devotos: el \"Penitente\"."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:34.661496Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_4.state_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Leiden you confronted has strayed far from his own original vision of Barkless. What you encountered was more monster than elf and less virtuous than his devotees would have you believe.", "translated": "El Leiden al que te enfrentaste se ha desviado mucho de su propia visión original de Barkless. Lo que encontraste fue más monstruo que elfo y menos virtuoso de lo que sus devotos te harían creer."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:34.662468Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_4.state_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You returned to Gerimor after putting an end to the mischief of Leyden the Penitent. May the Barkless walk the true path again one day.", "translated": "Regresaste a Gerimor después de poner fin a las travesuras de Leyden el Penitente. Que el Barkless vuelva a recorrer el verdadero camino algún día."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:34.662978Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_5.name", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Misguided", "translated": "Misguided"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:34.663989Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_5.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Below a ruin in the vicinity of the outlaw camp east of Thais a strange figure in ragged clothes hinted at something weird going on in a cave. He seemed too confused to decide whether to stop you.", "translated": "Debajo de una ruina en las cercanías del campamento de forajidos al este de Thais, una figura extraña con ropas andrajosas insinuaba que algo extraño estaba sucediendo en una cueva. Parecía demasiado confundido para decidir si debía detenerte."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:47:34.664927Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_38.mission_5.state_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You defeated the cult leader of Misguided by uncovering the true master to pull his strings and freeing this world from its malicious existance. Return to Gerimor to tell him about the victory.", "translated": "Derrotaste al líder del culto de Misguided al descubrir al verdadero maestro para mover sus hilos y liberar a este mundo de su existencia maliciosa. Vuelve con Gerimor para contarle sobre la victoria."}
