{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:48:09.381838Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_40.mission_1.description_dynamic", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You are exploring the Kha'zeel Dragon Lairs. Others obviously found a terrible end here. But the dragon hoards might justify the risks. You killed %d/50 dragons and dragon lords.", "translated": "Estás explorando las Kha'zeel Dragon Lairs. Otros obviamente encontraron aquí un final terrible. Pero los tesoros de dragones podrían justificar los riesgos. Mataste a %d/50 dragones y señores dragones."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:48:09.383146Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_40.mission_2.name", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Lost Brother", "translated": "The Lost Brother"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:48:09.384042Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_40.mission_2.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "At the Kha'zeel Mountains you met the merchant Tarun. His brother has gone missing and was last seen following a beautiful woman into a palace. Tarun fears this woman might have been a demon.", "translated": "En las montañas Kha'zeel conociste al comerciante Tarun. Su hermano desapareció y fue visto por última vez siguiendo a una hermosa mujer a un palacio. Tarun teme que esta mujer haya sido un demonio."}
