{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:48:34.355456Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_42.mission_12.state_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You've vanquished Kraknaknork and brought peace to the village of Rookgaard. It will soon be time for you to leave for the Isle of Destiny, choose a vocation and enter the open world of Tibia.", "translated": "Has vencido a Kraknaknork y has traído la paz al pueblo de Rookgaard. Pronto llegará el momento de partir hacia la Isla del Destino, elegir una vocación y entrar al mundo abierto de Tibia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:48:34.356384Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_42.mission_12.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You've got all items you need to finally kill Kraknaknork. Don't lose them, and carefully make your way towards the orc fortress located in the far west of Rookgaard. Leave the village to the north.", "translated": "Tienes todos los elementos que necesitas para finalmente matar a Kraknaknork. No los pierdas y dirígete con cuidado hacia la fortaleza orca ubicada en el extremo oeste de Rookgaard. Salga del pueblo hacia el norte."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:48:34.357145Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_42.mission_12.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >114 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "You've knocked out the unsuspecting orc. USE the orc before it wakes up again to disguise yourself as an orc!", "translated": "Has noqueado al orco desprevenido. ¡UTILIZA al orco antes de que se despierte nuevamente para disfrazarte de orco!"}
