{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:09.580309Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_1.state_13", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The troll Grarkharok sold the cloak to Tereban and he lost it during a flight with magic carpet. The cloak's feathers are now scattered along the carpet's beeline between Edron and Darashia.", "translated": "El troll Grarkharok vendió la capa a Tereban y la perdió durante un vuelo con la alfombra mágica. Las plumas de la capa ahora están esparcidas a lo largo de la línea recta de la alfombra entre Edron y Darashia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:09.581067Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_1.state_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You found many swan feathers on Edron and in Darama desert. Now you should have enough for an entire cloak. You should talk to the swan maiden.", "translated": "Encontraste muchas plumas de cisne en Edron y en el desierto de Darama. Ahora deberías tener suficiente para una capa entera. Deberías hablar con la doncella cisne."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:09.582631Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_1.state_16", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Alkestios was very happy about your support. You earned the Fae's trust and may now enter their secret realm. Search for an elemental shrine of ice, fire, earth or energy to reach Feyrist.", "translated": "Alkestios estaba muy feliz por su apoyo. Te ganaste la confianza de los Fae y ahora puedes ingresar a su reino secreto. Busca un santuario elemental de hielo, fuego, tierra o energía para llegar a Feyrist."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:09.585215Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_1.state_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Alkestios asked you for help on another issue. There seemms to be a problem with a wolf mother and her whelps. Find the snake Ikassis in the north-west of Edron and talk to her, she knows more.", "translated": "Alkestios te pidió ayuda con otro tema. Parece haber un problema con una madre loba y sus cachorros. Encuentra la serpiente Ikassis en el noroeste de Edron y habla con ella, ella sabe más."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:09.585938Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_1.state_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The snake Ikassis asked you to find a female wolf in the south of Cormaya. The animal is in need of help, yet Ikassis didn't know any details.", "translated": "La serpiente Ikassis te pidió que encontraras una loba en el sur de Cormaya. El animal necesita ayuda, pero Ikassis no conoce ningún detalle."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:14.813707Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.edgar_ellen.voice_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Through Rookgaard's sewer there swarmed no fewer than a hundred screeching rats. Wading through mud, and covered in blood, two young men fought back-to-back. To Trimera's end; a knight, and a friend.", "translated": "A través de la alcantarilla de Rookgaard pululaban no menos de cien ratas chillonas. Caminando por el barro y cubiertos de sangre, dos jóvenes lucharon espalda con espalda. Hasta el final de Trimera; un caballero y un amigo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.680757Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_1.state_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You talked to Irmana in Venore and she gave you the fur of one of the wolf whelps you're searching for. You should talk to their mother's ghost.", "translated": "Hablaste con Irmana en Venore y ella te dio el pelaje de uno de los cachorros de lobo que estás buscando. Deberías hablar con el fantasma de su madre."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.682068Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_2.name", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Nightmare Intruders", "translated": "Nightmare Intruders"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.683207Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_2.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You killed 200 of the nightmare monsters that are invading Feyrist. Maelyrra was very happy but it seems she still has other problems. She may need your help once more.", "translated": "Mataste a 200 de los monstruos de pesadilla que están invadiendo Feyrist. Maelyrra estaba muy feliz pero parece que todavía tiene otros problemas. Es posible que necesite tu ayuda una vez más."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.684458Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_2.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Maelyrra asked you to retrieve an artefact for her: the moon mirror. It was stolen by the tainted fae who inhabit the caves underneath Feyrist. She also asked you to free some captured fairies.", "translated": "Maelyrra te pidió que le recuperaras un artefacto: el espejo lunar. Fue robado por las hadas contaminadas que habitan las cuevas debajo de Feyrist. También te pidió que liberaras a algunas hadas capturadas."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.686250Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_2.state_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The barrier that protects Feyrist from the outside world is weakened. To strengthen it again you need to find the starlight vial and the sun catcher. Ask Aurita and Taegen for these items.", "translated": "La barrera que protege a Feyrist del mundo exterior se debilita. Para fortalecerlo nuevamente necesitas encontrar el vial de luz de las estrellas y el captador de sol. Pregúntale a Aurita y Taegen por estos artículos."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.688104Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_2.state_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You may now repair the barrier. Charge the five moon sculptures of Feyrist with moon rays, the five dreambird trees with starlight and the five sun mosics with sunlight.", "translated": "Ahora puedes reparar la barrera. Cargue las cinco esculturas lunares de Feyrist con rayos de luna, los cinco árboles de pájaros de ensueño con luz de estrellas y los cinco mosaicos solares con luz solar."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.688819Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_2.state_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You repaired tha magical barrier that protects Feyrist from the outside world. The fae's secret realm is safe again.", "translated": "Reparaste la barrera mágica que protege a Feyrist del mundo exterior. El reino secreto de las hadas vuelve a estar a salvo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.689288Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_3.name", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "An Unlikely Couple", "translated": "An Unlikely Couple"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.690176Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_3.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Help Aurita and Taegen and find a spell to transform Aurita's fishtail into legs temporarily. A fairy in a small fae village in the southwest of Feyrist might know more.", "translated": "Ayuda a Aurita y Taegen y encuentra un hechizo para transformar temporalmente la cola de pez de Aurita en piernas. Un hada de una pequeña aldea de hadas en el suroeste de Feyrist podría saber más."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.691727Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.mission_3.state_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >182 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "The faun Taegen wants to spend some time with his lover, the mermaid Aurita. He wants to visit her home and thus must be able to breath under water. Therefore he needs the rare raven herb.", "translated": "El fauno Taegen quiere pasar un tiempo con su amante, la sirena Aurita. Quiere visitar su casa y por eso debe poder respirar bajo el agua. Por eso necesita la rara hierba del cuervo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.693119Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_45.name", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Threatened Dreams", "translated": "Threatened Dreams"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:24.695215Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_46.mission_2.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >212 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Bake garlic cookies by using the garlic dough on a baking tray before you put it on the oven. Hand out cookies to the citizens and watch their reactions. Report any suspicious people to Julius.", "translated": "Hornea galletas de ajo usando la masa de ajo en una bandeja para hornear antes de ponerla en el horno. Reparte galletas a los ciudadanos y observa sus reacciones. Informa a Julius de cualquier persona sospechosa."}
