{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:35.462254Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_46.mission_4.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >211 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Your task is to find someone to bring you to Vengoth. Explore the island and use Julius' map whenever you find an unusual spot to mark it. Mark at least 5 spots including the castle and report back.", "translated": "Tu tarea es encontrar a alguien que te lleve a Vengoth. Explora la isla y usa el mapa de Julius cada vez que encuentres un lugar inusual para marcarlo. Marque al menos 5 lugares, incluido el castillo, e informe."}
