{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:57.351017Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_49.mission_2.state_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >117 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Brokul has been defeated and now you can talk with Spectulus or Dedoras what you found about the fishmen.", "translated": "Brokul ha sido derrotado y ahora puedes hablar con Spectulus o Dedoras sobre lo que encontraste sobre los pescadores."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:57.355426Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_49.mission_4.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "It is said that an ancient order of knights once resided in Edron. The knights disappeared a long time ago but their abandoned outpost is still there. The place may yet hold some surprises.", "translated": "Se dice que una antigua orden de caballeros alguna vez residió en Edron. Los caballeros desaparecieron hace mucho tiempo, pero su puesto de avanzada abandonado todavía está allí. El lugar aún puede deparar algunas sorpresas."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:50:57.356759Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_49.mission_5.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Go to Darashia and find out about the mysterious statue.", "translated": "Ve a Darashia y descubre la misteriosa estatua."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:51:14.408428Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_49.mission_6.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Dedoras told you where to search for leads to the Veiled Hoard: the museum in Thais, a fishmen temple in Tiquanda, an order fortress in Edron, the Asuri Palace and a deserted isle.", "translated": "Dedoras te dijo dónde buscar pistas para llegar al Tesoro Velado: el museo en Thais, un templo de pescadores en Tiquanda, una fortaleza de la orden en Edron, el Palacio Asuri y una isla desierta."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:51:14.410982Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_49.mission_6.state_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You have reported Gareth about the enigmatic inscription you have found in the chamber of doom. He was able to decipher it for you and referred to Dedoras in Cormaya for further assistance.", "translated": "Has informado a Gareth sobre la enigmática inscripción que has encontrado en la cámara de la perdición. Pudo descifrarlo por usted y lo refirió a Dedoras en Cormaya para obtener más ayuda."}
