{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:52:07.885299Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_6.mission_3.state_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >94 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "You spied 3 of 3 buildings of the camp. Zalamon should be informed about this as soon as possible.", "translated": "Viste 3 de 3 edificios del campamento. Se debe informar a Zalamon sobre esto lo antes posible."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:52:07.887405Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_6.mission_4.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Get the poison from Zalamon's storage room. Then go to the teleporter to the Muggy Plains and head east from there to the rice fields. Go to the very top rice field and use the poison anywhere on the water.", "translated": "Consigue el veneno del almacén de Zalamon. Luego ve al teletransportador hasta Muggy Plains y desde allí dirígete hacia el este hasta los campos de arroz. Ve al campo de arroz más alto y usa el veneno en cualquier parte del agua."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:52:19.268234Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_6.mission_5.state_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You already reported Zalamon about your success! You got a Tome of Knowledge as reward! Ask him for new mission!", "translated": "¡Ya le informaste a Zalamon sobre tu éxito! ¡Tienes un Tomo de Knowledge como recompensa! ¡Pídele una nueva misión!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:52:19.272926Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_7.mission_2.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >182 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "You have joined the Marid. These friendly, blue Djinns are honest and fair allies. You have pledged eternal loyalty to King Gabel and may enter Asha'daramai freely. Djanni'hah!", "translated": "Te has unido al Marid. Estos amigables Djinns azules son aliados honestos y justos. Has prometido lealtad eterna al rey Gabel y puedes entrar libremente en Asha'daramai. ¡Djanni'hah!"}
