{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:52:19.275713Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_8.mission_1.state_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Big Ben, the cyclops in Ab'Dendriel sends you to bring him 3 bast skirts for his woman. After this he will help you to forge different steel.", "translated": "Big Ben, el cíclope de Ab'Dendriel te envía a traerle 3 faldas de líber para su mujer. Después de esto, te ayudará a forjar diferentes aceros."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T21:52:19.276308Z", "lang": "es", "category": "questlog.json", "key": "questlog.quest_8.mission_1.state_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Big Ben, the cyclops in Ab'Dendriel will help you to forge different steel now. Just ask him if you need something.", "translated": "Big Ben, el cíclope en Ab'Dendriel te ayudará a forjar acero diferente ahora. Pregúntale si necesitas algo."}
