{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T22:40:39.621438Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.hugo.say_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Sorry, but I am not done with the outfit yet. Venore wasn't built in a day.", "translated": "Przepraszam, ale nie skończyłem jeszcze stroju. Venore nie zbudowano w jeden dzień."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T22:40:45.446002Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.humgolf.say_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Bah, Farmine here, Farmine there. Is there nothing else than Farmine to talk about these days? Hrmpf, whatever. So what do you want?", "translated": "No cóż, Farmine tutaj, Farmine tam. Czy obecnie nie ma nic innego do powiedzenia niż Farmine? Hrmpf, nieważne. Więc czego chcesz?"}
