{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T22:55:13.054919Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_bearded_woman.stdmod_3", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "newline_mismatch", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "EN ma 1 newline(s), tłumaczenie ma 0"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "I'd have been a much better captain then Kid was. I played several captains on stage and I was good! ... \\z\n\tWhere Kid longed for the appreciation of his men, I would rule by fear and with an iron fist!", "translated": "Byłabym o wiele lepszą kapitan niż Kid. Grałam na scenie kilka ról kapitanów i byłam świetna! ... \\z Gdy Kid łaknął uznania swoich ludzi, ja rządziłabym strachem i żelazną pięścią!"}
