{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:39:41.807889Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.spectulus.multi_41", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Unfortunately in the current state of time, he was never interested in attending Edron Academy, he never looked for a job to finance his studies and of course has never been one of my interns. ...", "translated": "Desafortunadamente en el estado actual de los tiempos, nunca estuvo interesado en asistir a la Academia Edron, nunca buscó un trabajo para financiar sus estudios y por supuesto nunca ha sido uno de mis pasantes. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:40:01.181624Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.spectulus.multi_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "There are rumours of aggressive fishmen in northern Tiquanda. We have to find out if this is even remotely connected to the Njey. ...", "translated": "Hay rumores de pescadores agresivos en el norte de Tiquanda. Tenemos que averiguar si esto está conectado, aunque sea remotamente, con el Njey. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:40:06.623303Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.spectulus.multi_64", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Alright, now listen. West of Edron, near the ocean, you'll find the Lost Mines. Go down there to recover one of its rare crystals. But beware, people say the mine workers who died there years ago in an horrible accident are still digging. ...", "translated": "Muy bien, ahora escucha. Al oeste de Edron, cerca del océano, encontrarás las Minas Perdidas. Baja allí para recuperar uno de sus raros cristales. Pero cuidado, la gente dice que los mineros que murieron allí hace años en un horrible accidente todavía están cavando. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:40:06.625584Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.spectulus.multi_67", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "A beggar here in Edron brags about how smart he is and that he knows about a man who lost his sanity because of an experiment, but he won't tell anyone any details. Maybe he knows more.", "translated": "Un mendigo aquí en Edron se jacta de lo inteligente que es y de que conoce a un hombre que perdió la cordura debido a un experimento, pero no le contará ningún detalle a nadie. Quizás él sepa más."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:40:29.676601Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.spectulus.say_11", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Found the well yet? Look on one of the ice isles near Carlin. I'm perfectly sure that the well with the pedestal is located on one of them. And be careful with the carrying device, I only have this one prototype.", "translated": "¿Ya encontraste el pozo? Busque en una de las islas de hielo cerca de Carlin. Estoy perfectamente seguro de que en uno de ellos se encuentra el pozo con el pedestal. Y ojo con el dispositivo de transporte, sólo tengo este prototipo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:40:38.892522Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.spectulus.say_22", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Good, because if you wouldn't do it... listen, this well is on one of the isles near Carlin. There you offer the crystal. Once you get access to its lair, find the collector and... convince it to give you the mirror crystal. Understood?", "translated": "Bien, porque si no lo harías... escucha, este pozo está en una de las islas cerca de Carlin. Allí ofreces el cristal. Una vez que tengas acceso a su guarida, encuentra al coleccionista y... convéncelo para que te dé el cristal del espejo. ¿Comprendido?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:40:48.040449Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.spectulus.say_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You should find the beggar somewhere in Edron. Stay persistent, I'm sure he knows more than he wants to tell us.", "translated": "Deberías encontrar al mendigo en algún lugar de Edron. Sea persistente, estoy seguro de que sabe más de lo que quiere decirnos."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:40:52.498705Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.spectulus.say_38", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >171 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Excellent, excellent. The rumours pointed to the north of Tiquanda, a sunken temple probably half drowned in water. Return to me if you find anything interesting!", "translated": "Excelente, excelente. Los rumores apuntaban al norte de Tiquanda, un templo hundido probablemente medio ahogado en el agua. ¡Vuelve conmigo si encuentras algo interesante!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:41:01.811686Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.spectulus.say_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Did you enter the Lost Mines yet? They are west of Edron, close to the sea. You will also need a pick once you get to the crystal deposit.", "translated": "¿Ya ingresaste a Las Minas Perdidas? Están al oeste de Edron, cerca del mar. También necesitarás una púa una vez que llegues al depósito de cristal."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:41:08.670428Z", "lang": "es", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.storkus.multi_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Ding, dong, the vampire is dead, eh? So I guess ye' can return to Henricus and tell him that ye' finished your job here. I'm quite sure he has some more challenging task up his sleeve. ...", "translated": "Ding, dong, el vampiro está muerto, ¿eh? Entonces supongo que puedes regresar con Henricus y decirle que terminaste tu trabajo aquí. Estoy bastante seguro de que tiene alguna tarea más desafiante bajo la manga. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-14T23:41:10.852522Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "items.json", "key": "item.21331.desc", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "This board will notify you of all relevant voting results, courtesy of the Rathleton Magistrate.", "translated": "Dzięki uprzejmości Sędziego Rathleton tablica ta powiadomi Cię o wszystkich istotnych wynikach głosowania."}
