{"timestamp": "2026-02-15T09:40:38.772082Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sven.L55.603", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Iskan told me that you killed huskies here in Svargrond. I will be lenient towards you and won't ban you from Svargrond. But you have to pay me a compensation of 1500 gold for each husky you have killed. Are you willing to pay", "translated": "Iskan me dijo que mataste perros esquimales aquí en Svargrond. Seré indulgente contigo y no te prohibiré el acceso a Svargrond. Pero tienes que pagarme una compensación de 1500 de oro por cada husky que hayas matado. ¿Estás dispuesto a pagar?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-15T09:40:52.615634Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.terrence.L75.456", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hey there, you are surely interested in helping the Rathleton city guard, right? Right - especially now since the dreaded minotaurs gain more ground every day.", "translated": "Hola, seguramente estás interesado en ayudar a la guardia de la ciudad Rathleton, ¿verdad? Claro, sobre todo ahora que los temidos minotauros ganan cada día más terreno."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-15T09:41:21.401343Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.thorgrin.L67.258", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >131 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! May earth protect you on the rocky grounds. If you need a {passage} back, I can help you.", "translated": "¡Bienvenido, |PLAYERNAME|! Que la tierra os proteja en los terrenos pedregosos. Si necesitas un respaldo {passage}, puedo ayudarte."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-15T09:41:38.842561Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tom.L74.1438", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >138 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Hey there, |PLAYERNAME|. I'm Tom the tanner. If you have fresh {corpses}, leather, paws or other animal body parts, {trade} with me.", "translated": "Hola, |PLAYERNAME|. Soy Tom el curtidor. Si tienes {corpses}, cuero, patas u otras partes del cuerpo de animales frescos, {trade} conmigo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-15T09:42:23.466029Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L159.1538", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >86 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Did you find a nice, fleshy bone in the crypt?", "translated": "¡Bienvenido de nuevo, |PLAYERNAME|! ¿Encontraste un bonito hueso carnoso en la cripta?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-15T09:42:23.466893Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L162.1539", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >85 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you have enough space for that sword now?", "translated": "¡Bienvenido de nuevo, |PLAYERNAME|! ¿Tienes suficiente espacio para esa espada ahora?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-15T09:42:28.274787Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L168.1541", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! But - back so soon? Please find the wasps' lair in the north-western region of Rookgaard and use the flask I gave you on its dead body. Or did you lose the flask?", "translated": "¡Bienvenido de nuevo, |PLAYERNAME|! Pero... ¿volverás tan pronto? Encuentra la guarida de las avispas en la región noroeste de Rookgaard y usa el frasco que te di en su cadáver. ¿O perdiste el matraz?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-15T09:42:33.709556Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L81.1520", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >119 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Welcome, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. These are dire times for Rookgaard... have you come to help in our {mission}?", "translated": "Bienvenido, aventurero |PLAYERNAME|. Son tiempos terribles para Rookgaard... ¿has venido a ayudar en nuestro {mission}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-15T09:43:19.554915Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zumtah.L141.1448", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >103 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla es"}], "en": "Another visitor to this constricted, cosy, calm realm, perfect except for an {exit}. Muhaha.", "translated": "Otro visitante de este reino restringido, acogedor y tranquilo, perfecto excepto por un {exit}. Mujaja."}
