{"timestamp": "2026-02-15T09:43:36.752018Z", "lang": "es", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.movements.others.dawnport.vocation.trial.L155.2341", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "As this is the first time you try out a vocation, the Guild has kitted you out.", "translated": "Como es la primera vez que pruebas una vocación, el Guild te ha preparado."}
