{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:22.894604Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.stdmod_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "She's pretty, isn't she? Will ship you safely to any port. Though a young landlubber such as you should consider to travel to Thais first. The travel is for free. Just once though! You have to ask for a {passage}.", "translated": "Jest ładna, prawda? Wyślemy Cię bezpiecznie do dowolnego portu. Chociaż młody szczur lądowy, taki jak ty, powinien najpierw rozważyć podróż do Thais. Podróż jest bezpłatna. Chociaż raz! Musisz poprosić o {passage}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:22.898260Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.stdmod_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "What? Then what DO you want? Learn about the main Tibian {cities}?", "translated": "Co? W takim razie czego chcesz? Dowiedz się o głównym tibijskim {cities}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:22.908394Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.say_13", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Kid, listen. Answering with a clear {yes} or {no} will get you much further in Tibia. Most people are not as sharp-eared as I am. Got that?", "translated": "Chłopie, posłuchaj. Odpowiadając wyraźnym {yes} lub {no}, dojdziesz znacznie dalej w Tibia. Większość ludzi nie ma tak bystrego słuchu jak ja. Rozumiem?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.790023Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.stdmod_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "She's pretty, isn't she? Will ship you safely to any port. Though a young landlubber such as you should consider to travel to Thais first. The travel is for free. Just once though! You have to ask for a {passage}.", "translated": "Она красивая, не так ли? Доставим вас в целости и сохранности в любой порт. Хотя такому молодому сухопутному жителю, как вы, следует подумать о том, чтобы сначала отправиться в Thais. Проезд бесплатный. Хотя бы один раз! Вы должны попросить {passage}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.791162Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.stdmod_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "You chose a peaceful world. Not much danger from other adventurers. Just beware the monsters. Want go there, ask for a {passage}.", "translated": "Вы выбрали мирный мир. Не большая опасность со стороны других искателей приключений. Просто остерегайтесь монстров. Хотите пойти туда, попросите {passage}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.793590Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.stdmod_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Good. Got all you want to take to the mainland, {yes}? Gear, limbs, loot?", "translated": "Хороший. У тебя есть все, что ты хочешь взять с собой на материк, {yes}? Снаряжение, конечности, добыча?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.794152Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.stdmod_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "What? Then what DO you want? Learn about the main Tibian {cities}?", "translated": "Что? Тогда чего ты хочешь? Узнать об основных тибианских {cities}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.797375Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.say_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Well, that's really generous of you. That'll feed a lot of hungry mouths for a while. Right, now which {city} did you say you wanted to go to?", "translated": "Что ж, это очень щедро с вашей стороны. Это на какое-то время накормит множество голодных ртов. Хорошо, а в какой {city}, ты сказал, хочешь пойти?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.799055Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.say_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "By tempest! What's all this gold weighing us down? Don't you think that's a little risky with all these pirates around? You can take {} with you, but that's it. Drop the rest or {donate} it to the Adventurers' Orphans Fund, really.", "translated": "К буре! Что нас тяготит все это золото? Тебе не кажется, что это немного рискованно, когда вокруг столько пиратов? Вы можете взять {} с собой, но не более того. Остальное отправьте или {donate} в Фонд сирот авантюристов, правда."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.801991Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.say_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "{} What do you say, {yes} or {no}?", "translated": "{} Что вы скажете: {yes} или {no}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.803968Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.say_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "By tempest! What's all this gold weighing us down? Don't you think that's a little risky with all these pirates around? You can take {} with you, but that's it. Drop the rest or {donate} it to the Adventurers' Orphans Fund, really.", "translated": "К буре! Что нас тяготит все это золото? Тебе не кажется, что это немного рискованно, когда вокруг столько пиратов? Вы можете взять {} с собой, но не более того. Остальное отправьте или {donate} в Фонд сирот авантюристов, правда."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.806371Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.say_13", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Kid, listen. Answering with a clear {yes} or {no} will get you much further in Tibia. Most people are not as sharp-eared as I am. Got that?", "translated": "Малыш, послушай. Ответив четко {yes} или {no}, вы продвинетесь гораздо дальше в Tibia. Большинство людей не такие зоркие, как я. Понял?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.807090Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.say_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Errr... was that a foreign language? Could you just answer with a clear {yes} or {no}?", "translated": "Э-э... это был иностранный язык? Не могли бы вы просто ответить четко {yes} или {no}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:25:55.807898Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_dreadnought.say_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Aw, come on! Talk to me in human words! {Yes}, {no}, or mention a city's name, that kind of stuff.", "translated": "Ой, давай! Поговорите со мной человеческими словами! {Yes}, {no} или упоминание названия города и тому подобное."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-23T21:26:43.549915Z", "lang": "pl", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_bearded_woman.stdmod_1", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "newline_mismatch", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "EN ma 2 newline(s), tłumaczenie ma 0"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "In a just world, I would be captain of a grand ship, ... \\z\n\tThose pirates out there would now be my minions, and we would brave the seas and become the terror of the coastal towns! ... \\z\n\tIf only our plan had worked!", "translated": "W sprawiedliwym świecie byłabym kapitanem wielkiego statku... \\z Ci piraci tam na zewnątrz byliby teraz moimi podwładnymi, a my przemierzalibyśmy morza i stalibyśmy się postrachem nadmorskich miast! ... \\z Gdyby tylko nasz plan się powiódł!"}
