{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:15.116409Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.captain.waverider.L97.707", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, daring adventurer. If you need a {passage}, let me know.", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, отважный искатель приключений. Если вам нужен {passage}, дайте мне знать."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:15.117185Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.captain.waverider.island.L61.1025", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, daring adventurer. If you need a return {passage}, let me know.", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, отважный искатель приключений. Если вам нужен возврат {passage}, дайте мне знать."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:15.117837Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.caramellia.L100.981", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello, |PLAYERNAME|. Please leave me alone in my {mourning}.", "translated": "Здравствуйте, |PLAYERNAME|. Пожалуйста, оставьте меня в покое в моем {mourning}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:21.171067Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carina.L97.831", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|. I am looking forward to trade with you.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, |PLAYERNAME|. Я с нетерпением жду возможности торговать с вами."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:21.172075Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L100.1093", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back |PLAYERNAME|, I hope you changed your mind and will bring me some {meat}? I'll even give you some gold for it.", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|. Надеюсь, ты передумал и принесешь мне немного {meat}? Я даже дам тебе за это немного золота."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:21.172853Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L103.1094", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Did you have a successful hunt and carry a piece of {meat} or ham with you?", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|! Удалась ли вам охота и вы взяли с собой кусок {meat} или ветчины?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:21.173777Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L107.1095", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, Isleth Eagonst! Do you still have that piece of meat or ham? If so, please ask me for a {trade} and I'll give you some gold for it.", "translated": "С возвращением, Айлет Иагонст! У тебя еще остался этот кусок мяса или ветчина? Если да, попросите у меня {trade}, и я дам вам за него немного золота."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:21.174626Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L110.1096", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Where did you put that delicious piece of food? Did you eat it yourself? Well, if you find another one, please come back.", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|! Куда ты положил этот вкусный кусок еды? Ты сам это ел? Ну, если найдешь еще одного, пожалуйста, возвращайся."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:21.175329Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L115.1097", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hey there, |PLAYERNAME|! Well, that's how trading with NPCs like me works. I think you are ready now to cross the bridge to Rookgaard! Take care!", "translated": "Привет, |PLAYERNAME|! Ну, вот как работает торговля с такими NPC, как я. Думаю, теперь вы готовы перейти мост к Rookgaard! Заботиться!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:26.480228Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L121.1098", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello again, |PLAYERNAME|! What are you still doing here? You should head over the bridge to Rookgaard village now!", "translated": "Еще раз здравствуйте, |PLAYERNAME|! Что ты еще здесь делаешь? Вам нужно прямо сейчас отправиться через мост в деревню Rookgaard!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:26.481193Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L241.1099", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Very nice! Food for me! Sell it to me, fast! Once you sold your food to me, just say {ready} to let me know you are done.", "translated": "Очень хорошо! Еда для меня! Продайте мне это, быстро! Как только вы продадите мне еду, просто скажите {ready}, чтобы я знал, что все готово."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:26.482282Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L243.1101", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Good bye traveller and enjoy your stay on Rookgaard.", "translated": "Прощай, путешественник, и приятного пребывания на Rookgaard."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:26.483113Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L86.1089", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be greeted, |PLAYERNAME|! As a tailor and merchant I have to say - we need to do something about your {outfit}, shall we?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, |PLAYERNAME|! Как портной и торговец я ​​должен сказать: нам нужно что-то сделать с вашим {outfit}, не так ли?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:26.483928Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L91.1090", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hey, I thought you were going to run away, but luckily you came back. I'll show you how to change your {outfit}, okay?", "translated": "Эй, я думал, ты собираешься сбежать, но, к счастью, ты вернулся. Я покажу тебе, как изменить твой {outfit}, хорошо?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:31.062591Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L94.1091", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back! You know, after providing my little outfit service, I like to ask a little favour of you. Can you {help} me?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать! Знаешь, после того, как я предоставил свою небольшую услугу по экипировке, я хотел бы попросить тебя о небольшой услуге. Можешь мне {help}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:31.063624Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L97.1092", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Oh hey |PLAYERNAME|, you didn't answer my question yet - could you help me get some {food}? I'll even give you some gold for it.", "translated": "О, привет, |PLAYERNAME|, ты еще не ответил на мой вопрос. Не мог бы ты помочь мне достать немного {food}? Я даже дам тебе за это немного золота."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:31.064997Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.cassino.L250.349", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome to the Cassino! Here we play with: \\n [PAYOUT 180%] {HIGH / LOW}: High for 4, 5, 6 and Low for 1, 2, and 3 - {ODD / EVEN }: Odd for 1, 3, 5 and Even for 2, 4 and 6 \\n [PAYOUT 500%] {NUMBERS}: You choose the number, and if you get it right ... {$$$$$}", "translated": "Добро пожаловать в Кассино! Здесь мы играем с: \\n [ВЫПЛАТА 180%] {HIGH / LOW}: Высокое для 4, 5, 6 и Низкое для 1, 2 и 3 - {ODD / EVEN }: Нечетное для 1, 3, 5 и четное для 2, 4 и 6 \\n [ВЫПЛАТА 500%] {NUMBERS}: Вы выбираете число, и если у вас все получится... {$$$$$}"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:31.065776Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.cedrik.L148.1392", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, юный |PLAYERNAME|! Если вы тяжело ранены или отравлены, я могу {heal} вас бесплатно."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:35.572810Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ceiron.L200.299", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Always nice to meet a fellow druid, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Всегда приятно познакомиться с таким же друидом, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:35.573538Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ceiron.L201.300", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "May Crunor bless and guide you, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Пусть Крунор благословит и направит тебя, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:35.574176Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ceiron.L202.301", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "May Crunor bless and guide you, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Пусть Крунор благословит и направит тебя, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:35.575079Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.cerdras.L86.658", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "May Crunor bless and guide you, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Пусть Крунор благословит и направит тебя, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:41.272372Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.charlotta.L85.901", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Ah, welcome! Welcome |PLAYERNAME|! If you need druid spells, you've come to the right place. Otherwise it's just nice to have a visitor.", "translated": "Ах, добро пожаловать! Добро пожаловать |PLAYERNAME|! Если вам нужны заклинания друида, вы попали по адресу. В остальном просто приятно иметь гостя."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:41.274131Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.chavis.L118.1346", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hey there! You don't happen to have some {food} on you, you're willing to share? Well, where are my manners, a warm welcome for now.", "translated": "Привет! У вас случайно нет с собой какого-нибудь {food}, вы готовы поделиться? Ну и где мои манеры, пока теплый прием."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:41.275097Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.chemar.L87.743", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Daraman's blessings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Благословения Дарамана, путешественник |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:45.151670Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.chief.grarkharok.L158.1407", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Me Chief Grarkharok! No do {nothing}!", "translated": "Я Шеф Грахарок! Нет, делай {nothing}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:45.152161Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.chief.grarkharok.L159.1408", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Grarkharok be {chief}!", "translated": "Грахарок, будь {chief}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:48.637130Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.chief.grarkharok.L160.1409", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Grarkharok be {chief}!", "translated": "Грахарок, будь {chief}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:48.638376Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.chrystal.L77.787", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "At your service |PLAYERNAME| and welcome to the post office.", "translated": "К вашим услугам |PLAYERNAME| и добро пожаловать на почту."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:41:54.225621Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.chrystal.L80.790", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Here. Don't forget that you need to buy a label too if you want to send a parcel. Always write the name of the {receiver} in the first line.", "translated": "Здесь. Не забывайте, что вам также нужно купить этикетку, если вы хотите отправить посылку. Всегда пишите имя {receiver} в первой строке."}
