{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:12.468015Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.gurbasch.L93.937", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Lovely steamboat, ain't it? I can even offer you a {passage} if you like.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, |PLAYERNAME|! Прекрасный пароход, не так ли? Если хотите, я даже могу предложить вам {passage}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:19.732670Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.hairycles.L58.1002", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be greeted, friend of the ape people. If you want to {trade}, just ask for my offers. If you are injured, ask for healing.", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, друг обезьянолюдей. Если вы хотите {trade}, просто спросите мои предложения. Если вы ранены, попросите об исцелении."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:19.733529Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.halvar.L119.799", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello competitor! Do you want to {fight} in the arena or shall I explain the {rules} first?", "translated": "Привет, конкурент! Хотите ли вы {fight} на арене, или мне сначала объяснить {rules}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:24.650762Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.hamish.L206.768", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Take your pick! Or maybe you want to look only at {potions}, {wands} or {runes}?", "translated": "Выбирайте! Или, может быть, вы хотите просмотреть только {potions}, {wands} или {runes}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:24.651822Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.hanna.L121.875", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Oh, please come in, |PLAYERNAME|. What do you need? Have a look at my wonderful {offers} in gems and jewellery.", "translated": "О, пожалуйста, заходите, |PLAYERNAME|. Что вам нужно? Взгляните на моего замечательного {offers} в драгоценных камнях и украшениях."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:43.660597Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.hireling.L792.1381", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "It is good to see you. I'm always at your {service}.", "translated": "Рад тебя видеть. Я всегда на твоем {service}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:43.661309Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.hireling.L793.1382", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Farewell, |PLAYERNAME|, I'll be here if you need me again.", "translated": "Прощай, |PLAYERNAME|, я буду здесь, если я тебе снова понадоблюсь."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:48.710340Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.humgolf.L92.710", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|, good day .. or night, whatever.", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|, добрый день .. или ночь, неважно."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:48.710966Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.humphrey.L111.77", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, noble |PLAYERNAME|", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, благородный |PLAYERNAME|"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:53.381868Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.hyacinth.L221.656", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Here. Don't forget, if you buy potions, there's a {deposit} of 5 gold on the empty flask.", "translated": "Здесь. Не забывайте: если вы покупаете зелья, в пустой колбе есть {deposit} в размере 5 золотых."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:54.242470Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.hyacinth.L58.651", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|. You must be the one sent by Lily. Do you have a sack of {herbs} for me?", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, путешественник |PLAYERNAME|. Должно быть, тебя послала Лили. У вас есть для меня мешок {herbs}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:58.625892Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.hyacinth.L60.652", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|. I still have a present for you! Would you like to have it now?", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, путешественник |PLAYERNAME|. У меня еще есть для тебя подарок! Хотели бы вы иметь это сейчас?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:58.626740Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.hyacinth.L62.653", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|. As you have found the way to my hut, how can I {help} you?", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, путешественник |PLAYERNAME|. Раз ты нашел дорогу к моей хижине, как я могу тебя {help}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:45:58.627747Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.imalas.L55.670", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|! What do you need? If it's {food}, you've come to the right place.", "translated": "Привет, |PLAYERNAME|! Что вам нужно? Если это {food}, вы попали по адресу."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:03.181693Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.imbuement.assistant.L360.558", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "See you later |PLAYERNAME| come back soon.", "translated": "Увидимся позже, |PLAYERNAME|, возвращайся скорее."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:03.182325Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.imbuement.assistant.L361.559", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "See you later |PLAYERNAME| come back soon.", "translated": "Увидимся позже, |PLAYERNAME|, возвращайся скорее."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:03.183168Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iptar.sin.L184.984", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free or you want the {adventurer stone}?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, юный |PLAYERNAME|! Если вы тяжело ранены или отравлены, я могу {heal} вам бесплатно или вы хотите {adventurer stone}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:08.379542Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ishina.L111.412", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be greeted, |PLAYERNAME|. Which of my fine gems do you {need}?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, |PLAYERNAME|. Какие из моих прекрасных драгоценностей тебе нравятся {need}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:16.977189Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.isimov.L169.1003", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, юный |PLAYERNAME|! Если вы тяжело ранены или отравлены, я могу {heal} вас бесплатно."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:16.979824Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iskan.L57.1280", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "I was told you have been killing huskies here in Svargrond! Never do that again, okay? They are precious animals for us. Give me 500 gold and I will forget that incident without telling it to Jarl Sven. Okay?", "translated": "Мне сказали, что ты убиваешь хаски здесь, в Svargrond! Никогда больше так не делай, ладно? Для нас это драгоценные животные. Дайте мне 500 золотых, и я забуду этот инцидент, не рассказав об этом ярлу Свену. Хорошо?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:22.018457Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iwan.L59.1266", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Feel welcome to my gem store, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать в мой магазин драгоценных камней, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:22.019318Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iwar.L84.274", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hiho Storm Killer! Welcome to Kazordoon furniture store.", "translated": "Привет, Штормовой убийца! Добро пожаловать в мебельный магазин Kazordoon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:29.389172Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iyad.L107.746", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Finally! A c...c...customer! Wh... where do you want to f...f...{fly}?", "translated": "Окончательно! К...к...клиент! Что... куда ты хочешь пойти...{fly}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:29.389747Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iyad.L108.747", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "D...Daraman's blessings... oh, how I m...miss my warm Darashia...", "translated": "Д...благословение Дарамана... ох, как мне...не хватает моего теплого Darashia..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:29.391084Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jack.L67.1251", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "You!! What have you told my family? They are mad at me and I don't even know why! They think I lied to them about working in Edron in secrecy! Why should I even do that!", "translated": "Ты!! Что ты сказал моей семье? Они злятся на меня, и я даже не знаю почему! Они думают, что я солгал им о секретной работе в Edron! Зачем мне вообще это делать!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:37.920927Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jack.drone.L61.504", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome on board, |PLAYERNAME|. Where can I {sail} you today? I can travel you back to {thais}.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать на борт, |PLAYERNAME|. Где я могу {sail} тебе сегодня? Я могу отправить вас обратно в {thais}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:37.922300Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jack.fate.L109.733", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome on board, Sir |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать на борт, сэр |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:50.457341Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jakahr.L53.433", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello, mourned pilgrim. How may I help you |PLAYERNAME|?", "translated": "Здравствуй, скорбящий паломник. Чем я могу вам помочь |PLAYERNAME|?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:50.457923Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jakahr.L54.434", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "It was an honour to serve you, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Для меня было честью служить вам, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:57.216485Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jakahr.L56.436", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Here. Don't forget that you need to buy a label too if you want to send a parcel. Always write the name of the {receiver} in the first line.", "translated": "Здесь. Не забывайте, что вам также нужно купить этикетку, если вы хотите отправить посылку. Всегда пишите имя {receiver} в первой строке."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:57.217897Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jamesfrancis.L64.648", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Gerimor is right. As an expert for minotaurs I am researching these creatures for years. I thought I already knew a lot but the monsters in this cave are {different}. It's a big {mystery}.", "translated": "Геримор прав. Как эксперт по минотаврам, я исследую этих существ уже много лет. Я думал, что уже многое знаю, но монстры в этой пещере — {different}. Это большой {mystery}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:57.219116Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jean.pierre.L116.691", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. What are you doing out here?", "translated": "Приветствую, |PLAYERNAME|. Что ты здесь делаешь?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:46:57.219750Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jefrey.L76.522", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:00.338080Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jerom.L134.948", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello. Sorry, but I'm not in the best {mood} today.", "translated": "Привет. Извините, но я сегодня не в лучшем состоянии {mood}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:00.338796Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jessica.L76.1594", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
