{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:05.116889Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.julius.L255.639", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|. Never trust anyone.", "translated": "До свидания, |PLAYERNAME|. Никогда никому не доверяй."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:09.490797Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.julius.L58.637", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be greeted, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. I assume you have read the {note} about the {vampire} threat in this city.", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, искатель приключений |PLAYERNAME|. Я предполагаю, что вы прочитали {note} об угрозе {vampire} в этом городе."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:09.491568Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.julius.L60.638", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be greeted, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. Please excuse me if I appear {distracted}!", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, искатель приключений |PLAYERNAME|. Извините, если я покажусь {distracted}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:09.492499Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.junkar.mines.L68.1372", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! You are lucky that the service is running right now. Save your coal for the days to come though!", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, |PLAYERNAME|! Вам повезло, что сервис работает прямо сейчас. Однако сохраните уголь на будущее!"}
