{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:13.094518Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.kais.L104.736", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hmm... surely you are in need of {help} - will you let me? I am {Kais} the Bound and I can lend you a hand in {healing} your body and soul or even grant an {enhanced} blessing!", "translated": "Хм... тебе наверняка нужен {help} - ты мне позволишь? Я {Kais} Связанный, и я могу помочь вам {healing} вашим телом и душой или даже дать {enhanced} благословение!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:23.246477Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.kasmir.L170.333", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, юный |PLAYERNAME|! Если вы тяжело ранены или отравлены, я могу {heal} вас бесплатно."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:27.444994Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.kawill.L88.276", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome |PLAYERNAME|! May earth protect you!", "translated": "Добро пожаловать |PLAYERNAME|! Пусть земля защитит тебя!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:27.446910Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.kaya.L76.384", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:47:30.289033Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.kendra.L82.1056", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome on board, |PLAYERNAME|. Where can I {sail} you today?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать на борт, |PLAYERNAME|. Где я могу {sail} тебе сегодня?"}
