{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:30.497162Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.marvin.L92.130", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Ah, you come just in time for the special voting about the most recent {funding} project. I guess you want to participate in it.", "translated": "А, вы пришли как раз вовремя для специального голосования по последнему проекту {funding}. Я думаю, вы хотите принять в этом участие."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:30.497959Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.mazarius.L189.562", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, dear visitor. Please tell me what {brings} you here, to my humble adobe.", "translated": "Приветствую, дорогой посетитель. Пожалуйста, скажи мне, что ты здесь, {brings}, в моем скромном Adobe."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:30.498639Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.mehkesh.L59.619", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be mourned, |PLAYERNAME|, pilgrim in flesh. If you are looking for potions, seek no further.", "translated": "Скорбись, |PLAYERNAME|, странник во плоти. Если вы ищете зелья, не ищите дальше."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:34.996656Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.mehkesh.L60.620", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "May enlightenment be your path, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Пусть просветление станет твоим путем, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:34.997501Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.mehkesh.L61.621", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "May enlightenment be your path, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Пусть просветление станет твоим путем, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:34.999719Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.melian.L94.776", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|. Where do you want me to {fly} you?", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, путешественник |PLAYERNAME|. Куда ты хочешь, чтобы я {fly} тебя?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:37.874814Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.memech.L60.1194", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "May enlightenment be your path, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Пусть просветление станет твоим путем, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:42.635309Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.miraia.L186.1358", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Daraman's blessings, |PLAYERNAME|. Welcome to the Enlightened Oasis. Sit down, have a {drink} or some {food}!", "translated": "Благословения Дарамана, |PLAYERNAME|. Добро пожаловать в Просвещенный Оазис. Садитесь, выпейте {drink} или немного {food}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:47.620862Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.moe.L115.326", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, traveller. It seems, you're a {guest} here, just like me.", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, путник. Кажется, ты здесь {guest}, как и я."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:47.622252Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.mordecai.L157.588", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome to the magic emporium, child. Ask me for a trade if you need {runes}, {wands}, or spellbooks.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать в волшебный магазин, дитя. Попросите меня обменять, если вам нужны {runes}, {wands} или книги заклинаний."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:53.752013Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.muhad.L108.928", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be greeted, foreigner under the sun of Darama. What brings you {here}?", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, иностранец под солнцем Дарамы. Что привело вас к {here}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:58.430432Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.muriel.L159.1305", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! Looking for wisdom and power, eh?", "translated": "Приветствую, |PLAYERNAME|! Ищешь мудрости и силы, да?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:58.431706Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.murim.L80.185", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:48:58.433487Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.muzir.L76.225", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:03.398330Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.myra.L319.1418", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. If you are looking for sorcerer {spells} don't hesitate to ask.", "translated": "Приветствую, |PLAYERNAME|. Если вы ищете колдуна {spells}, не стесняйтесь спрашивать."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:03.399927Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.myzzi.L100.65", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello adventurer. It is {good} to see you.", "translated": "Привет, искатель приключений. Вас ждет {good}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:07.939665Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nah.bob.L137.839", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Bye now, Neutrala |PLAYERNAME|. Visit old Bob again one day!", "translated": "Пока, Нейтрала |PLAYERNAME|. Однажды посетите старого Боба снова!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:07.941675Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.naji.L76.1424", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome to the Tibian bank, |PLAYERNAME| What can I do for you?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать в банк Тибиан, |PLAYERNAME|. Что я могу для вас сделать?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:12.558107Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nelly.L166.415", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|, What can I do for you? I'm working for the post office, but I also trade with important {potions}, {runes} and other magical equipment.", "translated": "Привет |PLAYERNAME|! Что я могу для тебя сделать? Я работаю на почте, но также торгую важным {potions}, {runes} и другим магическим оборудованием."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:17.621059Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nilsor.L227.1011", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|. Is there anything I can {do for you}?", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, путешественник |PLAYERNAME|. Могу ли я что-нибудь {do for you}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:17.623649Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ninev.L184.289", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free or you want the {adventurer stone}?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, юный |PLAYERNAME|! Если вы тяжело ранены или отравлены, я могу {heal} вам бесплатно или вы хотите {adventurer stone}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:22.040178Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ninos.L84.1480", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello. How may I help you |PLAYERNAME|? Ask me for a {trade} if you want to buy something. I can also explain the {mail} system.", "translated": "Привет. Чем я могу вам помочь |PLAYERNAME|? Попросите у меня {trade}, если хотите что-нибудь купить. Я также могу объяснить систему {mail}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:27.309542Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nomad.L108.168", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Ah, another diciple of the extreme... surviving the icy outdoors? Let me {help}! If you need some first aid out here, I can provide {healing} or grant you an {enhanced} blessing!", "translated": "Ах, еще один ученик экстрима... выжить на льду на улице? Позвольте мне {help}! Если вам понадобится первая помощь, я могу предоставить {healing} или дать вам благословение {enhanced}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:33.097278Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nor.L72.1088", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Psst, not that {loud}.", "translated": "Тсс, это не тот {loud}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:33.097990Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.norf.L105.282", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, pilgrim. How may I {help} you? Are you in need of {healing}?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, паломник. Как я могу тебе {help}? Вам нужен {healing}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:38.212438Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.norma.L189.1083", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, welcome! Have a seat! If you like a drink or something to eat, just ask me for a {trade}!", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, добро пожаловать! Садитесь! Если вы хотите выпить или что-нибудь поесть, просто попросите у меня {trade}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:43.472438Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nydala.L58.953", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Have a look. Most furniture comes in handy kits. Just use them in your house to assemble the furniture. Do you want to see only a certain {type} of furniture?", "translated": "Посмотрите. Большая часть мебели поставляется в удобных комплектах. Просто используйте их в своем доме, чтобы собрать мебель. Вы хотите видеть только определенный {type} мебели?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:43.474431Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.obi.L132.250", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello, hello, |PLAYERNAME|! Please come in, look, and buy! If you like to see my offers, ask me for a {trade}!", "translated": "Привет, привет, |PLAYERNAME|! Заходите, смотрите и покупайте! Если вам нравится видеть мои предложения, попросите у меня {trade}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:48.594986Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ocelus.L107.832", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, dear visitor |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Приветствую вас, уважаемый посетитель |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:48.595750Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.oldrak.L197.1032", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome |PLAYERNAME|! Only rarely I can welcome {visitors} these days.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать |PLAYERNAME|! В наши дни я редко могу приветствовать {visitors}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:48.598476Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.olrik.L87.581", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello. How may I help you |PLAYERNAME|? Ask me for a {trade} if you want to buy something. I can also explain the {mail} system.", "translated": "Привет. Чем я могу вам помочь |PLAYERNAME|? Попросите у меня {trade}, если хотите что-нибудь купить. Я также могу объяснить систему {mail}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:55.778020Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.olrik.L89.583", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Here. Don't forget that you need to buy a label too if you want to send a parcel. Always write the name of the {receiver} in the first line.", "translated": "Здесь. Не забывайте, что вам также нужно купить этикетку, если вы хотите отправить посылку. Всегда пишите имя {receiver} в первой строке."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:55.778830Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.omrabas.L546.362", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "At last, a visitor! Welcome to my... humble abode. {Scroll} or {mission}?", "translated": "Наконец-то гость! Добро пожаловать в мою... скромную обитель. {Scroll} или {mission}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:55.780375Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.one.eyed.joe.L83.566", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello there. I'm sorry, I hardly noticed you. I'm a bit nervous. The spooky {sounds} down there, you know", "translated": "Привет. Простите, я вас почти не заметил. Я немного нервничаю. Знаешь, там внизу жуткий {sounds}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:49:55.781451Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ongulf.L254.584", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello, |PLAYERNAME|. You've come at a good time for our {project}.", "translated": "Здравствуйте, |PLAYERNAME|. Вы пришли как раз вовремя для нашего {project}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:05.157580Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.partos.L85.1428", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome to my little kingdom, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать в мое маленькое королевство, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:05.159983Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.paulie.L66.1571", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome |PLAYERNAME|! Special newcomer offer, today only! Deposit some money - or {deposit ALL} of your money! - and get 50 gold for free!", "translated": "Добро пожаловать |PLAYERNAME|! Специальное предложение для новичков, только сегодня! Внесите немного денег — или {deposit ALL} ваших денег! - и получите 50 золотых бесплатно!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:11.047109Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.paulie.L68.1572", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:11.047989Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.pemaret.L105.1461", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, young man. Looking for a passage or some fish, |PLAYERNAME|?", "translated": "Приветствую, молодой человек. Ищете проход или рыбу, |PLAYERNAME|?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:16.026196Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.petros.L85.1230", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome on board, |PLAYERNAME|. Where can I {sail} you today?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать на борт, |PLAYERNAME|. Где я могу {sail} тебе сегодня?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:22.490762Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.phillip.L79.940", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello, mighty adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. Can I teach you something you don't know?", "translated": "Привет, могучий искатель приключений |PLAYERNAME|. Могу ли я научить тебя чему-то, чего ты не знаешь?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:22.493445Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.pino.L87.1404", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|. Where do you want me to {fly} you?", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, путешественник |PLAYERNAME|. Куда ты хочешь, чтобы я {fly} тебя?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:28.221842Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.prezil.L143.719", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, юный |PLAYERNAME|! Если вы тяжело ранены или отравлены, я могу {heal} вас бесплатно."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:28.223532Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.puffels.L218.811", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yeah, another fool {disturbing} me, what a joy.", "translated": "Да, еще один дурак {disturbing} мне, какая радость."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:33.207262Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.pukosch.L87.1589", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you feel adventurous? Do you want a weekly {ticket} for the ore wagon system here? You can use it right here to get to the centre of Kazordoon!", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, |PLAYERNAME|! Вы чувствуете себя авантюристом? Хотите еженедельную {ticket} для системы вагонов для руды? Вы можете использовать его прямо здесь, чтобы добраться до центра Kazordoon!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:33.208337Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.pydar.L96.217", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be greeted |PLAYERNAME|! I can smell the scent of a phoenix on you!", "translated": "Приветствую |PLAYERNAME|! Я чувствую запах феникса на тебе!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:33.208970Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.pydar.L97.218", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "May the fire in your heart never die, |PLAYERNAME|!", "translated": "Пусть огонь в твоем сердце никогда не угаснет, |PLAYERNAME|!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:36.703685Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.quentin.L179.175", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free or you want the {adventurer stone}?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, юный |PLAYERNAME|! Если вы тяжело ранены или отравлены, я могу {heal} вам бесплатно или вы хотите {adventurer stone}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:42.278356Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rabaz.L195.623", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Ah, a customer! Please feel free to browse my wares, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Ах, клиент! Пожалуйста, не стесняйтесь просматривать мои товары, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:42.608588Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rachel.L177.739", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome |PLAYERNAME|! Whats your need?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать |PLAYERNAME|! Что вам нужно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:45.703768Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.raffael.L76.662", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:48.834682Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rashid.L259.631", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Farewell, |PLAYERNAME|, may the winds guide your way.", "translated": "Прощай, |PLAYERNAME|, пусть ветры укажут тебе путь."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:52.366719Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rashid.custom.L262.773", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Farewell, |PLAYERNAME|, may the winds guide your way.", "translated": "Прощай, |PLAYERNAME|, пусть ветры укажут тебе путь."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:52.381215Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rata.mari.L103.828", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Meep? I mean - hello! Sorry, |PLAYERNAME|... Being a {rat} has kind of grown on me.", "translated": "Мип? Я имею в виду - привет! Извини, |PLAYERNAME|... Мне уже стало {rat}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:57.046900Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.raymond.striker.L217.357", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be greeted. Is there anything I can {do for you}?", "translated": "Приветствуйте. Могу ли я что-нибудь {do for you}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:50:57.047549Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.razan.L168.1176", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings |PLAYERNAME|. What leads you to me?", "translated": "Приветствую |PLAYERNAME|. Что привело тебя ко мне?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:00.989245Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.richard.L200.340", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello there, mate. Here for a {trade}? My stock's just been refilled.", "translated": "Привет, приятель. Здесь для {trade}? Мой запас только что пополнился."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:05.246605Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rock.in.a.hard.place.L301.138", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Everyone on this island has gone crazy! Except for me and you, it seems. Let's {trade} like normal people would.", "translated": "Все на этом острове сошли с ума! Кроме меня и тебя, кажется. Давайте {trade}, как это делают нормальные люди."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:09.755369Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rokyn.L75.973", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:14.336320Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.romella.L123.641", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "I welcome thee, |PLAYERNAME|! I suppose you are looking for a trade in fine weapons!", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, |PLAYERNAME|! Полагаю, вы ищете торговлю прекрасным оружием!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:19.091459Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rottin.wood.L210.1031", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hunter's greeting! I assume you want something from me since you came all the way out here on your own. This is a dangerous place to be, I doubt that all my men will accept strangers like I do. You don't seem to have any problems with that, though.", "translated": "Приветствие Hunter! Полагаю, ты чего-то от меня хочешь, раз уж ты проделал весь этот путь сюда один. Это опасное место, я сомневаюсь, что все мои люди примут незнакомцев, как я. Хотя у вас, похоже, с этим проблем нет."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:19.092301Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rowenna.L59.475", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome to the finest weaponshop in the land, |PLAYERNAME|! Tell me if you're looking for a good {trade}.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать в лучший оружейный магазин в стране, |PLAYERNAME|! Скажите мне, ищете ли вы хорошего {trade}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:23.463863Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rudolph.L53.206", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Oh, a customer. Hello |PLAYERNAME|. If you'd like to see my wonderful self-tailored clothes, ask me for a {trade}.", "translated": "О, клиент. Здравствуйте, |PLAYERNAME|. Если вы хотите увидеть мою замечательную одежду, сшитую самостоятельно, попросите у меня {trade}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:27.740109Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sam.L153.910", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome to my shop, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|! I {trade} with weapons and armor.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать в мой магазин, искатель приключений |PLAYERNAME|! Я {trade} с оружием и доспехами."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:31.753012Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sandra.L143.1396", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|, please come back soon.", "translated": "До свидания, |PLAYERNAME|, возвращайся поскорее."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:32.824168Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sandra.L144.1397", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|, please come back soon.", "translated": "До свидания, |PLAYERNAME|, возвращайся поскорее."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:32.826273Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sandra.L145.1398", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Of course, just browse through my wares. By the way, if you'd like to join our bonus system for depositing flasks and vial, you have to tell me about that {deposit}.", "translated": "Конечно, просто просмотрите мои товары. Кстати, если вы хотите присоединиться к нашей бонусной системе за внесение флаконов и флаконов, вам нужно сообщить мне об этом {deposit}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:38.711234Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L101.959", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if you saw your 'level up'! You did, {right}?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать! Где мы были...? Ах, да, я спросил тебя, видел ли ты свой 'level up'! Ты это сделал, {right}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:38.712091Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L104.960", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if those nasty cockroaches {hurt} you! Did they?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать! Где мы были...? Ах, да, я спросил тебя, {hurt} ли тебе эти противные тараканы! Они сделали?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:38.713030Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L107.961", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back! Where were we... ? Ah, right, I asked you if I should demonstrate some damage on you. Let's do it, {okay}?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать! Где мы были...? Ах, да, я спросил, стоит ли мне продемонстрировать на тебе какой-нибудь ущерб. Давай сделаем это, {okay}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:44.091819Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L119.965", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello again, |PLAYERNAME|! It's great to see you. If you like, we can chat a little. Just use the highlighted {keywords} again to choose a {topic}.", "translated": "Еще раз здравствуйте, |PLAYERNAME|! Приятно тебя видеть. Если хочешь, можем немного пообщаться. Просто используйте выделенный {keywords} еще раз, чтобы выбрать {topic}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:46.709196Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L251.967", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Good bye traveller, and enjoy your stay on Rookgaard.", "translated": "Прощай, путешественник, и приятного пребывания на Rookgaard."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:46.710192Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L70.954", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|, nice to see you on Rookgaard! I saw you walking by and wondered if you could help me. Could you? Please, say {yes}!", "translated": "Привет, |PLAYERNAME|, приятно видеть тебя на Rookgaard! Я увидел, как ты проходишь мимо, и подумал, сможешь ли ты мне помочь. Не могли бы вы? Пожалуйста, скажите {yes}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:46.711672Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L73.955", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Oh, |PLAYERNAME|, it's you again! It's probably impolite to disturb a busy adventurer like you, but I really need help. Please, say {yes}!", "translated": "О, |PLAYERNAME|, это снова ты! Наверное, невежливо беспокоить такого занятого искателя приключений, как ты, но мне действительно нужна помощь. Пожалуйста, скажите {yes}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:46.712890Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L80.956", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Ahh, you found my chest. Let me take a look at you. You put on that coat, {yes}?", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|! Ааа, ты нашел мой сундук. Позвольте мне взглянуть на вас. Ты надел это пальто, {yes}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:50.688176Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L83.957", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hey, I want to give you a weapon for free! You should not refuse that, in fact you should say '{yes}'!", "translated": "Эй, я хочу подарить тебе оружие бесплатно! Не стоит от этого отказываться, лучше сказать '{yes}'!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:50.689129Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L90.958", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Good job! For that, I'll grant you 100 experience points! Oh - what was that? I think you advanced a level, {right}?", "translated": "Хорошая работа! За это я дам вам 100 очков опыта! Ой, что это было? Я думаю, ты продвинулся на новый уровень, {right}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:50.689975Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sarina.L86.73", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Oh, please come in, |PLAYERNAME|. What can I do for you? If you need adventure equipment, ask me for a {trade}.", "translated": "О, пожалуйста, заходите, |PLAYERNAME|. Что я могу сделать для вас? Если вам нужно снаряжение для приключений, попросите у меня {trade}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:50.691889Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sarina.L89.76", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Of course, just browse through my wares. {Footballs} have to be purchased separately.", "translated": "Конечно, просто просмотрите мои товары. {Footballs} необходимо приобретать отдельно."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:55.052339Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.scrutinon.L101.1548", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|. I have been watching your fate for quite some time. It's about time you came here. Do you seek to enter the riven island of Quirefang or travel back from where you came?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|. Я уже давно наблюдаю за твоей судьбой. Пришло время тебе прийти сюда. Вы хотите попасть на расколотый остров Quirefang или вернуться оттуда, откуда пришли?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:55.053166Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sebastian.L116.1348", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, daring adventurer. If you need a {passage}, let me know.", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, отважный искатель приключений. Если вам нужен {passage}, дайте мне знать."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:55.053853Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sebastian.nargor.L68.1109", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, daring adventurer. If you need a {passage}, let me know.", "translated": "Приветствую тебя, отважный искатель приключений. Если вам нужен {passage}, дайте мне знать."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:51:55.054645Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.serafin.L78.1045", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome to my fruit and vegetable store, |PLAYERNAME|! Ask me for a {trade} if you'd like to see my wares.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать в мой магазин фруктов и овощей, |PLAYERNAME|! Попросите у меня {trade}, если хотите увидеть мои товары."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:02.647802Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sherry.mcronald.L59.404", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|! Welcome to our humble farm.", "translated": "Привет, |PLAYERNAME|! Добро пожаловать на нашу скромную ферму."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:05.846967Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sherry.mcronald.L60.405", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Grace our home with another visit soon, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Скоро украсьте наш дом еще одним визитом, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:05.848511Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.shiantis.L86.703", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Oh, please come in, |PLAYERNAME|. What can I do for you? If you need adventure equipment, ask me for a {trade}.", "translated": "О, пожалуйста, заходите, |PLAYERNAME|. Что я могу сделать для вас? Если вам нужно снаряжение для приключений, попросите у меня {trade}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:13.131927Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.shirtalis.of.the.summer.court.L83.56", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello fighter. I guess you are here to {fight} for our noble {cause}.", "translated": "Привет боец. Думаю, вы пришли к {fight} ради нашего благородного {cause}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:16.197027Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.siestaar.L76.570", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:16.198474Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.siflind.L214.1557", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be greeted, |PLAYERNAME|. If you are in need of potions or magical equipment, just ask me about my {offers}.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, |PLAYERNAME|. Если вам нужны зелья или магическое оборудование, просто спросите меня о моем {offers}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:19.880330Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sigurd.L144.1168", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome to the magic store, |PLAYERNAME|! Ask me for a trade if you need something.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать в магический магазин, |PLAYERNAME|! Попроси меня обменять, если тебе что-то понадобится."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:20.031755Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.simon.the.beggar.L315.1138", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|. I am a poor man. Please help me.", "translated": "Здравствуйте, |PLAYERNAME|. Я бедный человек. Пожалуйста, помогите мне."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:23.871393Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sinclair.L157.1276", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings |PLAYERNAME|. I have - very - little time, please make it as short as possible. I may be able to help you if you are here to help us with any of our tasks or missions.", "translated": "Приветствую |PLAYERNAME|. У меня очень мало времени, пожалуйста, сделайте его как можно короче. Возможно, я смогу помочь вам, если вы здесь, чтобы помочь нам с любыми нашими задачами или миссиями."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:23.873570Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sissek.L71.1049", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:28.219340Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.spectulus.L492.816", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|! You're late, do you have no concept of time? My mission is of utmost importance. If you are not interested in helping me, you might as well just leave.", "translated": "Привет, |PLAYERNAME|! Ты опоздал, у тебя нет понятия времени? Моя миссия имеет первостепенное значение. Если вы не заинтересованы в моей помощи, вы можете просто уйти."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:32.386999Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.spectulus.L67.814", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|! You're late, do you have no concept of time? My mission is of utmost importance. If you are not interested in helping me, you might as well just leave.", "translated": "Привет, |PLAYERNAME|! Ты опоздал, у тебя нет понятия времени? Моя миссия имеет первостепенное значение. Если вы не заинтересованы в моей помощи, вы можете просто уйти."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:32.387891Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.spectulus.L70.815", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Ah hello again |PLAYERNAME|! I still have one or two other {missions} for you. There are also some {tasks} someone needs to attend to.", "translated": "О, еще раз здравствуйте, |PLAYERNAME|! У меня еще есть для вас еще один или два {missions}. Есть также некоторые {tasks}, о которых нужно позаботиться."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:35.185578Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.suzy.L76.1112", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:40.290373Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sven.L55.603", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Iskan told me that you killed huskies here in Svargrond. I will be lenient towards you and won't ban you from Svargrond. But you have to pay me a compensation of 1500 gold for each husky you have killed. Are you willing to pay", "translated": "Искан сказал мне, что ты убивал хаски здесь, в Svargrond. Я буду снисходителен к вам и не забаню вас на Svargrond. Но вы должны выплатить мне компенсацию в размере 1500 золотых за каждого убитого вами хаски. Вы готовы заплатить"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:40.291621Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.swolt.L111.235", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Take a look, but not a sip before you've paid. And I hope it stays like this and you don't get any strange ideas about {rice}.", "translated": "Посмотрите, но не делайте глотка, пока не заплатите. И я надеюсь, что так и останется, и у вас не возникнет никаких странных представлений о {rice}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:40.292524Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.taegen.L204.753", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "May enlightenment be your path, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Пусть просветление станет твоим путем, |PLAYERNAME|."}
