{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:48.174194Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tanyt.L100.1187", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Ah, the wind brings in another visitor. Welcome, dear guest. Are you looking for a {passage} with my carpet?", "translated": "Ах, ветер приносит еще одного гостя. Добро пожаловать, дорогой гость. Вы ищете {passage} с моим ковром?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:52.219957Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tarak.sunken.L75.868", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Want to go back to Yalahar? Just ask me for a free {passage}.", "translated": "Хотите вернуться в Yalahar? Просто попросите у меня бесплатный {passage}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:52:59.262728Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.terrence.L75.456", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hey there, you are surely interested in helping the Rathleton city guard, right? Right - especially now since the dreaded minotaurs gain more ground every day.", "translated": "Привет, ты ведь наверняка заинтересован в помощи городской страже Rathleton, верно? Верно, особенно сейчас, когда ужасные минотавры с каждым днем ​​​​завоевывают все больше позиций."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:02.220370Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tesha.L76.913", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:12.000402Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.the.beggar.king.L103.328", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hi! You look like someone on a {mission}.", "translated": "Привет! Ты похож на кого-то на {mission}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:20.817200Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.the.lootmonger.L73.1309", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Ah, a customer! Be greeted, |PLAYERNAME|! I buy all kinds of loot, would you look at", "translated": "Ах, клиент! Добро пожаловать, |PLAYERNAME|! Я покупаю всякую добычу, вы бы посмотрели?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:20.819157Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.the.queen.of.the.banshees.L215.943", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Be greeted, dear visitor. Come and {stay} ... a while.", "translated": "Приветствую вас, дорогой посетитель. Приходите и {stay} ... некоторое время."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:25.239286Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.thorgrin.L67.258", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! May earth protect you on the rocky grounds. If you need a {passage} back, I can help you.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, |PLAYERNAME|! Пусть земля защитит тебя на каменистых землях. Если вам нужно вернуть {passage}, я могу вам помочь."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:28.407758Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tibra.L137.512", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome in the name of the gods, pilgrim |PLAYERNAME|!", "translated": "Добро пожаловать во имя богов, странник |PLAYERNAME|!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:28.408533Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tibra.L138.513", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|. May the gods be with you to guard and guide you, my child!", "translated": "До свидания, |PLAYERNAME|. Пусть боги будут с тобой, чтобы охранять и направлять тебя, дитя мое!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:34.382898Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.todd.L84.451", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes, goodbye |PLAYERNAME|, just leave me alone.", "translated": "Да, прощай, |PLAYERNAME|, просто оставь меня в покое."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:40.864769Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tom.L72.1437", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hey there, |PLAYERNAME|. You look... exhausted. Did you run a lot? And more importantly, were you able to find some war wolf leather?", "translated": "Привет, |PLAYERNAME|. Ты выглядишь... измученным. Ты много бегал? И что еще более важно, удалось ли вам найти кожу боевого волка?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:40.865668Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tom.L74.1438", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hey there, |PLAYERNAME|. I'm Tom the tanner. If you have fresh {corpses}, leather, paws or other animal body parts, {trade} with me.", "translated": "Привет, |PLAYERNAME|. Я Том, кожевник. Если у вас есть свежие {corpses}, кожа, лапы или другие части тела животных, {trade} со мной."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:48.229942Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.torkada.L96.1008", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings! This isn't the {time} to chitchat though.", "translated": "Привет! Однако это не тот {time}, чтобы болтать."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:51.947472Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.turvy.L58.372", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello, dear |PLAYERNAME|. Can I be of any assistance? Just tell me if you'd like to {trade} weapons or armor.", "translated": "Здравствуйте, дорогой |PLAYERNAME|. Могу ли я быть чем-нибудь полезен? Просто скажите мне, хотите ли вы {trade} оружие или броню."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:53:51.950003Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tyrias.L173.1272", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, юный |PLAYERNAME|! Если вы тяжело ранены или отравлены, я могу {heal} вас бесплатно."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:03.830758Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.undal.L167.1466", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings hero. I guess you came to {talk}.", "translated": "Приветствую героя. Я думаю, вы пришли в {talk}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:03.833972Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.urks.the.mute.L73.1084", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Lovely steamboat, ain't it? I can even offer you a {passage} if you like.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, |PLAYERNAME|! Прекрасный пароход, не так ли? Если хотите, я даже могу предложить вам {passage}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:07.281623Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.uzon.L115.987", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Daraman's blessings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Благословения Дарамана, путешественник |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:10.469407Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.uzon.back.L80.47", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Daraman's blessings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Благословения Дарамана, путешественник |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:11.199115Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.valentina.L83.544", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome to Valentine's Store. Let's {trade} something?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать в магазин Валентина. Давайте {trade} что-нибудь?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:13.999120Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.valindara.L68.1599", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "May enlightenment be your path, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Пусть просветление станет твоим путем, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:13.999749Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vanys.L167.531", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings hero. I guess you came to {talk}.", "translated": "Приветствую героя. Я думаю, вы пришли в {talk}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:18.799080Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L100.1525", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|. Glad to see you made it back in one piece. I hope you're not too exhausted, because I could use your {help} again.", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|. Рад видеть, что ты вернулся целым и невредимым. Надеюсь, вы не слишком утомлены, потому что мне снова пригодится ваш {help}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:18.799984Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L103.1526", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Oh, hello |PLAYERNAME|! Have you made up your mind about sneaking into the tarantula's lair and retrieving a sample of her web? Are you up for it?", "translated": "О, привет, |PLAYERNAME|! Вы уже решили пробраться в логово тарантула и забрать образец ее паутины? Вы готовы к этому?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:18.802128Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L114.1529", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! How about that studded armor - would you like to have it now?", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|! Как насчет этой шипованной брони? Хотели бы вы иметь ее сейчас?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:23.965645Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L121.1530", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|! Thank the gods you are back! While you were gone, something horrible happened. Do you smell the fire?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|! Слава богам, что вы вернулись! Пока тебя не было, произошло нечто ужасное. Чувствуешь запах огня?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:23.967183Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L131.1532", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Are you prepared for your next mission, |PLAYERNAME|?", "translated": "Готовы ли вы к следующей миссии, |PLAYERNAME|?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:23.969169Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L145.1534", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|, welcome back! That was great work you did there. Let me give you something for your efforts - you deserve it. Here, want a helmet?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|, с возвращением! Вы проделали там огромную работу. Позвольте мне воздать вам кое-что за ваши усилия — вы этого заслуживаете. Вот, хочешь шлем?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:23.969863Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L150.1535", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Do you have enough space for the brass helmet now?", "translated": "Приветствую, |PLAYERNAME|. У вас теперь достаточно места для медного шлема?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:28.111718Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L153.1536", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Are you ready for your next mission?", "translated": "Приветствую, |PLAYERNAME|. Готовы ли вы к следующей миссии?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:28.112553Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L156.1537", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. I see you haven't explored the whole crypt yet - do you need explanations again?", "translated": "Приветствую, |PLAYERNAME|. Я вижу, вы еще не весь склеп исследовали - опять нужны пояснения?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:28.113236Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L159.1538", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Did you find a nice, fleshy bone in the crypt?", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|! Ты нашел в склепе красивую мясистую кость?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:28.113892Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L162.1539", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you have enough space for that sword now?", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|! У тебя теперь достаточно места для этого меча?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:28.114935Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L165.1540", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! I'm in a really good mood, I must say. We're almost able to infiltrate Kraknaknork's hideout. I have one last little favour to ask and then my plan is complete. Are you ready?", "translated": "Приветствую, |PLAYERNAME|! Должен сказать, у меня очень хорошее настроение. Нам почти удалось проникнуть в убежище Кракнакнорка. У меня есть еще одна маленькая просьба, и тогда мой план выполнен. Вы готовы?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:28.115839Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L168.1541", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! But - back so soon? Please find the wasps' lair in the north-western region of Rookgaard and use the flask I gave you on its dead body. Or did you lose the flask?", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|! Но – вернуться так скоро? Пожалуйста, найдите логово ос в северо-западном регионе Rookgaard и используйте колбу, которую я вам дал, на его трупе. Или ты потерял фляжку?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:32.677164Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L171.1542", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Were you able to bring back some wasp poison?", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|! Удалось ли вам принести осиный яд?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:32.677935Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L174.1543", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you have enough space for that brass shield now?", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|! У тебя теперь достаточно места для этого латунного щита?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:32.678671Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L177.1544", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|, the time of our triumph has come. Are you ready to vanquish Kraknaknork once and for all?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|, пришло время нашего триумфа. Готовы ли вы победить Кракнакнорка раз и навсегда?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:32.679451Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L184.1545", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|! You're back! And you're covered in orc blood... that can only mean... were you able to kill Kraknaknork?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|! Ты вернулся! А ты весь в орочьей крови... это может означать только одно... смог ли ты убить Кракнакнорка?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:32.680116Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L81.1520", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. These are dire times for Rookgaard... have you come to help in our {mission}?", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, искатель приключений |PLAYERNAME|. Для Rookgaard наступили тяжелые времена... вы пришли помочь нашему {mission}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:32.680882Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L84.1521", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Your task is still not done - do you remember everything you need to do?", "translated": "Приветствую, |PLAYERNAME|. Твоя задача еще не выполнена – ты помнишь все, что нужно сделать?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:38.013656Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L87.1522", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. I've heard a loud rumbling from the roof - I hope the stones didn't fall on your toes. Have you loaded at least two catapults?", "translated": "Приветствую, |PLAYERNAME|. Я услышал громкий грохот с крыши — надеюсь, камни не упали тебе на пальцы ног. Вы загрузили хотя бы две катапульты?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:38.014689Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L90.1523", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Actually I have some more equipment I could give to you, but first I want to see how you fight. You have fought before, haven't you?", "translated": "Приветствую, |PLAYERNAME|. На самом деле у меня есть еще кое-какое снаряжение, которое я мог бы дать тебе, но сначала я хочу посмотреть, как ты сражаешься. Вы уже дрались раньше, не так ли?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:38.015386Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L93.1524", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|. Are you done with the 5 rats I asked you to kill?", "translated": "С возвращением, |PLAYERNAME|. Ты закончил с пятью крысами, которых я просил тебя убить?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:38.015998Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vescu.L103.84", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hey t-there, you look like someone who enjoys a good {booze}.", "translated": "Эй, ты выглядишь как человек, который любит хороший {booze}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:41.474283Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.virgil.L76.212", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:41.475986Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.walter.jaeger.L485.1182", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Good hunting! I can offer you some lovely {rewards} for finishing prey hunting tasks! Furthermore I can tell you how many hunting task points (HTP) you actually {have} and you have already {spent}.", "translated": "Удачной охоты! Я могу предложить вам несколько замечательных {rewards} для выполнения заданий по охоте на добычу! Кроме того, я могу сказать вам, сколько очков охотничьих заданий (HTP) вы на самом деле получили {have}, а у вас уже есть {spent}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:44.909198Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.wentworth.L387.330", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:44.910559Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.willard.L86.1037", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings and Banor be with you, |PLAYERNAME|! May I interest you in a {trade} for weapons, ammunition or armor?", "translated": "Приветствую и пребудет с тобой Банор, |PLAYERNAME|! Могу ли я заинтересовать вас {trade} для оружия, боеприпасов или доспехов?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:54:55.010395Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.willard.L89.1040", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Of course, just browse through my wares. If you're only interested in {distance} equipment, let me know.", "translated": "Конечно, просто просмотрите мои товары. Если вас интересует только оборудование {distance}, дайте мне знать."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:05.375914Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.yberius.L169.1364", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, юный |PLAYERNAME|! Если вы тяжело ранены или отравлены, я могу {heal} вас бесплатно."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:14.135236Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.yoem.L61.188", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|! Do you need some equipment for your house?", "translated": "Привет, |PLAYERNAME|! Вам нужно какое-то оборудование для дома?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:14.137520Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.yoem.L62.189", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Have a look. Most furniture comes in handy kits. Just use them in your house to assemble the furniture. Do you want to see only a certain {type} of furniture?", "translated": "Посмотрите. Большая часть мебели поставляется в удобных комплектах. Просто используйте их в своем доме, чтобы собрать мебель. Вы хотите видеть только определенный {type} мебели?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:18.391971Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zalamon.L421.1289", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Not many travellerzz zzezze dayzz. I hope you bring good newzz.", "translated": "Не так уж много путешественниковzz zzzze dayzz. Надеюсь, вы принесете хорошие новости."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:18.714152Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zebron.L134.469", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Greetings, high roller. So you care for a game, |PLAYERNAME|?", "translated": "Приветствую, хайроллер. Итак, тебя интересует игра, |PLAYERNAME|?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:18.716092Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zebron.L136.471", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Hey, you can't leave, |PLAYERNAME|. Luck is smiling on you. I can feel it!", "translated": "Эй, ты не можешь уйти, |PLAYERNAME|. Удача улыбается вам. Я чувствую это!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:18.717477Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zedrulon.the.fallen.L148.50", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать, юный |PLAYERNAME|! Если вы тяжело ранены или отравлены, я могу {heal} вас бесплатно."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:22.314272Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L180.497", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Good bye |PLAYERNAME|, may Uman bless you!.", "translated": "До свидания, |PLAYERNAME|, да благословит тебя Умань!."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:22.315385Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L67.488", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Oh, heaven must have sent you! Could you please help me with a {quest}?", "translated": "О, небо, должно быть, послало тебя! Не могли бы вы помочь мне с {quest}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:22.316101Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L70.489", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, darling... so about that firewood, could you please {help} me?", "translated": "С возвращением, дорогая... итак, насчет дров, не могла бы ты мне {help}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:26.174715Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L73.490", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, darling... so about the {dead trees}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?", "translated": "С возвращением, дорогая... Итак, насчет {dead trees}, позволь мне объяснить это немного подробнее, {yes}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:35.000978Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L76.491", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, darling... so about the {branches}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?", "translated": "С возвращением, дорогая... Итак, насчет {branches}, позволь мне объяснить это немного подробнее, {yes}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:35.002422Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L79.492", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, darling... so about the {pushing}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?", "translated": "С возвращением, дорогая... Итак, насчет {pushing}, позволь мне объяснить это немного подробнее, {yes}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:35.003813Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L82.493", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome back, darling... so about the {cart}, let me explain that a little more, {yes}?", "translated": "С возвращением, дорогая... Итак, насчет {cart}, позволь мне объяснить это немного подробнее, {yes}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:35.005351Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L85.494", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Oh, sweetheart, is there a problem with the quest? Should I {explain} it again?", "translated": "Ой, милый, а с квестом проблемы? Стоит ли мне {explain} еще раз?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:35.006564Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L88.495", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Right, thank you sweetheart! This will be enough to heat my oven. Oh, and you are probably waiting for your reward, {yes}?", "translated": "Точно, спасибо, дорогая! Этого будет достаточно, чтобы нагреть мою духовку. О, и ты, наверное, ждешь своей награды, {yes}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:39.181891Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zirella.L91.496", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Oh, welcome back, dear Isleth Eagonst! Are you here for a little chat? Just use the highlighted {keywords} again to choose a {topic}.", "translated": "О, с возвращением, дорогой Айлет Игонст! Вы здесь, чтобы немного поболтать? Просто используйте выделенный {keywords} еще раз, чтобы выбрать {topic}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:39.182721Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ziyad.L100.872", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Ah, the wind brings in another visitor. Welcome, dear guest. Are you looking for a {passage} with my carpet?", "translated": "Ах, ветер приносит еще одного гостя. Добро пожаловать, дорогой гость. Вы ищете {passage} с моим ковром?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:39.184292Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zizzle.L114.1235", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Ah our human {alliez} have finally arrived! I've already feared zat ze emperor'z forzez had caught you. Your rezilienze and prowezz are imprezzive.", "translated": "О, наш человек {alliez} наконец-то прибыл! Я уже боялся, что тебя поймал Император'з Форзез. Ваша решимость и мастерство впечатляют."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:43.216706Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.znozel.L71.200", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Yes? What may I do for you, |PLAYERNAME|? Bank business, perhaps?", "translated": "Да? Что я могу для тебя сделать, |PLAYERNAME|? Банковский бизнес, возможно?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:43.218442Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zoltan.L113.593", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Welcome |PLAYERNAME|, student of the arcane arts. I teach the fiercest {spells} available.", "translated": "Добро пожаловать |PLAYERNAME|, изучающий тайные искусства. Я преподаю самые жестокие {spells} из доступных."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:55:43.219116Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zoltan.L114.594", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "Use your knowledge wisely, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Используйте свои знания с умом, |PLAYERNAME|."}
