{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:57:52.216361Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.cults.of.tibia.movements.energy.fence.L49.2121", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "As you cross the threshold in to the inner sanctuary of the cult of the Misguided, you feel an eerie presence all around you.", "translated": "Когда вы пересекаете порог внутреннего святилища культа Misguided, вы чувствуете жуткое присутствие вокруг себя."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T22:57:52.532635Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.cults.of.tibia.movements.ice.death.L63.2088", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "en": "You are still blessed with Wisdom of Solitude, Spark of the Phoenix, Fire of the Suns, Spiritual Shielding, Embrace of Tibia, Heart of the Mountain, Blood of the Mountain, and Twist of Fate.", "translated": "Вы все еще благословлены Мудростью Одиночества, Искрой Феникса, Огнем Солнца, Духовной Защитой, Объятиями Tibia, Сердцем Горы, Кровью Горы и Иронией Судьбы."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T23:00:30.305029Z", "lang": "ro", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelo.L58.1443", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a {project} that tries to find out more about this new {area}.", "translated": "Druid din Crunor? Ți-a spus că aici a apărut o peșteră nouă? Asta e corect. Sunt șeful unui {project} care încearcă să afle mai multe despre acest nou {area}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-24T23:00:36.789944Z", "lang": "ro", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelo.L64.1446", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a project that tries to find out more about this new area.", "translated": "Druid din Crunor? Ți-a spus că aici a apărut o peșteră nouă? Asta e corect. Sunt șeful unui proiect care încearcă să afle mai multe despre această nouă zonă."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:14:38.311739Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.a.prisoner.L140.263", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (3 przypadków)", "count": 3}], "en": "Huh? What? I can see! Wow! A non-mino. Did they {capture} you as well?", "translated": "Hein? Quoi? Je peux voir ! Ouah! Un non-mino. Vous ont-ils {capture} également ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:14:38.313281Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.a.strange.chalice.L117.1623", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (2 przypadków)", "count": 2}], "en": "Hi? What do you mean 'hi' - can't you see I am a... I have to lower my voice. Did it occur to you, that this 'chalice' does not want to be disturbed?! Leave me alone!", "translated": "Salut? Que veux-tu dire 'hi' - tu ne vois pas que je suis un... Je dois baisser la voix. Vous est-il venu à l'esprit que ce 'chalice' ne veut pas être dérangé ?! Laisse-moi tranquille!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:15:58.179158Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelo.L58.1443", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a {project} that tries to find out more about this new {area}.", "translated": "Le Druid de Crunor ? Il vous a dit qu'une nouvelle grotte était apparue ici ? C'est exact. Je suis à la tête d'un {project} qui tente d'en savoir plus sur ce nouveau {area}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:16:04.405186Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelo.L64.1446", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a project that tries to find out more about this new area.", "translated": "Le Druid de Crunor ? Il vous a dit qu'une nouvelle grotte était apparue ici ? C'est exact. Je suis à la tête d'un projet qui tente d'en savoir plus sur ce nouveau domaine."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:16:25.903477Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.armenius.L86.644", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >82 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Ah, an adventurer. Be greeted and have a seat. How may I {serve} you?", "translated": "Ah, un aventurier. Soyez accueilli et asseyez-vous. Comment puis-je vous {serve} ?"}
