{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:17:58.342123Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.a.wrinkled.bonelord.L80.1421", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: optisch", "examples": ["optisch"]}], "en": "What is this? An optically challenged entity called |PLAYERNAME|. How fascinating!", "translated": "Was ist das? Eine optisch behinderte Entität namens |PLAYERNAME|. Wie faszinierend!"}
