{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:05.020198Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ahmet.L182.407", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >113 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: betrauerter", "examples": ["betrauerter"]}], "en": "Be mourned pilgrim in flesh. I'm selling general goods. Just ask me for a {trade}.", "translated": "Sei ein betrauerter Pilger im Fleisch. Ich verkaufe allgemeine Waren. Fragen Sie mich einfach nach einem {trade}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:05.021513Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.al.dee.L168.598", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: linken", "examples": ["linken"]}], "en": "Take a look in the trade window to your left.", "translated": "Werfen Sie einen Blick in das Handelsfenster auf der linken Seite."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:05.022233Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.albinius.L267.1035", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: bereit", "examples": ["bereit"]}], "en": "Greetings, pilgrim. Welcome to the halls of hope. We are the keepers of this {temple} and welcome everyone willing to contribute.", "translated": "Sei gegrüßt, Pilger. Willkommen in den Hallen der Hoffnung. Wir sind die Hüter dieses {temple} und heißen alle willkommen, die bereit sind, einen Beitrag zu leisten."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:16.615377Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.alia.L148.1158", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >110 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Willkommen, junger |PLAYERNAME|! Wenn Sie schwer verwundet oder vergiftet sind, kann ich Sie kostenlos {heal}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:16.616290Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.alia.L149.1159", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >95 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.", "translated": "Denken Sie daran: Wenn Sie schwer verwundet oder vergiftet sind, kann ich Sie kostenlos heilen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:16.617787Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.alkestios.L130.1473", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: finsteren", "examples": ["finsteren"]}], "en": "Nature's blessing, traveller! May you not be affected by any sinister force.", "translated": "Ein Segen der Natur, Reisender! Mögen Sie nicht von einer finsteren Macht beeinflusst werden."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:22.967008Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.altar.L83.730", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: alles, blutigen", "examples": ["alles", "blutigen"]}], "en": "Kneel before the all-devouring power of blooded decay.", "translated": "Knie nieder vor der alles verschlingenden Macht des blutigen Verfalls."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:26.790899Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.amanda.L200.1226", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >110 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Willkommen, junger |PLAYERNAME|! Wenn Sie schwer verwundet oder vergiftet sind, kann ich Sie kostenlos {heal}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:26.791573Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.amanda.L201.1227", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >95 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.", "translated": "Denken Sie daran: Wenn Sie schwer verwundet oder vergiftet sind, kann ich Sie kostenlos heilen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:38.201331Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.andrew.lyze.L101.514", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >194 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Hello, I am the warden of this {monument}. The {sarcophagus} in front of you was established to prevent people from going {down} there. But I doubt that this step is sufficient.", "translated": "Hallo, ich bin der Leiter dieses {monument}. Der {sarcophagus} vor Ihnen wurde eingerichtet, um zu verhindern, dass Leute dorthin gehen {down}. Aber ich bezweifle, dass dieser Schritt ausreicht."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:38.202005Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.andrew.lyze.L103.515", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >101 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Well, let's see if your mission was successful. Just bring me all needed {materials}.", "translated": "Mal sehen, ob Ihre Mission erfolgreich war. Bring mir einfach alles mit, was du brauchst {materials}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:48.844243Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelina.L58.143", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: kleine", "examples": ["kleine"]}], "en": "The gods must be praised that I am finally saved. I do not have many worldly possessions, but please accept a small reward, do you?", "translated": "Die Götter müssen dafür gelobt werden, dass ich endlich gerettet bin. Ich habe nicht viele weltliche Besitztümer, aber bitte nehmen Sie eine kleine Belohnung an, oder?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:48.845151Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelina.L60.144", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >96 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Thanks for saving my life! Should I teleport you out of the Dark Cathedral?", "translated": "Danke, dass du mein Leben gerettet hast! Soll ich dich aus der Dunklen Kathedrale teleportieren?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:48.846791Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelo.L58.1443", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: neue, ist, versucht", "examples": ["neue", "ist", "versucht"]}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a {project} that tries to find out more about this new {area}.", "translated": "Der Druid von Crunor? Er hat dir erzählt, dass hier eine neue Höhle entstanden ist? Das ist richtig. Ich bin der Leiter eines {project}, der versucht, mehr über diesen neuen {area} herauszufinden."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:18:55.853389Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelo.L64.1446", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: neue, ist, versucht", "examples": ["neue", "ist", "versucht"]}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a project that tries to find out more about this new area.", "translated": "Der Druid von Crunor? Er hat dir erzählt, dass hier eine neue Höhle entstanden ist? Das ist richtig. Ich bin Leiter eines Projekts, das versucht, mehr über diesen neuen Bereich herauszufinden."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:19:12.242743Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.arkulius.L184.894", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: warten", "examples": ["warten"]}], "en": "At last! Good things come to those who wait.", "translated": "Endlich! Gute Dinge kommen zu denen, die warten."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:19:12.243394Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.armenius.L74.643", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: dich", "examples": ["dich"]}], "en": "Oh, the nerve. Go to the rats which raised you.", "translated": "Oh, der Nerv. Geh zu den Ratten, die dich großgezogen haben."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:19:12.244468Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.aruda.L257.1339", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >88 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|. I really hope we'll talk again soon.", "translated": "Auf Wiedersehen, |PLAYERNAME|. Ich hoffe wirklich, dass wir uns bald wieder unterhalten."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:19:17.754439Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.aruda.L67.1337", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: bisschen", "examples": ["bisschen"]}], "en": "Oh, hello, handsome! It's a pleasure to meet you, |PLAYERNAME|. Gladly I have the time to {chat} a bit.", "translated": "Oh, hallo, Hübscher! Es ist mir eine Freude, Sie kennenzulernen, |PLAYERNAME|. Ich freue mich, dass ich die Zeit habe, ein bisschen zu {chat}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:19:21.720290Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.atur.L77.728", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
