{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:21:43.157461Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L110.1096", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: köstliche, finden", "examples": ["köstliche", "finden"]}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Where did you put that delicious piece of food? Did you eat it yourself? Well, if you find another one, please come back.", "translated": "Willkommen zurück, |PLAYERNAME|! Wo hast du das köstliche Stück Essen hingelegt? Hast du es selbst gegessen? Wenn Sie noch einen finden, kommen Sie bitte zurück."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:21:43.158249Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L115.1097", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hey there, |PLAYERNAME|! Well, that's how trading with NPCs like me works. I think you are ready now to cross the bridge to Rookgaard! Take care!", "translated": "Hallo, |PLAYERNAME|! Nun, so funktioniert der Handel mit NPCs wie mir. Ich denke, Sie sind jetzt bereit, die Brücke zu Rookgaard zu überqueren! Aufpassen!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:21:43.158797Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L121.1098", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hello again, |PLAYERNAME|! What are you still doing here? You should head over the bridge to Rookgaard village now!", "translated": "Hallo nochmal, |PLAYERNAME|! Was machst du noch hier? Sie sollten jetzt über die Brücke zum Dorf Rookgaard gehen!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:21:50.337505Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L243.1101", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Good bye traveller and enjoy your stay on Rookgaard.", "translated": "Auf Wiedersehen, Reisender, und genießen Sie Ihren Aufenthalt auf Rookgaard."}
