{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:25:11.784059Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.denominator.L57.152", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: folgenden", "examples": ["folgenden"]}], "en": "Enter answers for the following {questions}:", "translated": "Geben Sie Antworten für die folgenden {questions} ein:"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:25:24.984385Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.doubleday.L157.1240", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >104 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Hello there, hmm just... just wait right there, I'll be with you in a second. Just getting this {experiment} done...", "translated": "Hallo, hmm... warte einfach mal, ich bin gleich bei dir. Ich mache gerade dieses {experiment} fertig ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:25:29.489097Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.dukosch.L87.1221", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: wöchentlichen", "examples": ["wöchentlichen"]}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you feel adventurous? Do you want a weekly {ticket} for the ore wagon system here? You can use it right here to get to the centre of Kazordoon!", "translated": "Willkommen, |PLAYERNAME|! Fühlen Sie sich abenteuerlustig? Möchten Sie hier einen wöchentlichen {ticket} für das Erzwagensystem? Sie können es direkt hier nutzen, um ins Zentrum von Kazordoon zu gelangen!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:25:33.519480Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ebenizer.L77.1494", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
