{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:26:42.937146Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ferus.L149.700", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >95 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.", "translated": "Denken Sie daran: Wenn Sie schwer verwundet oder vergiftet sind, kann ich Sie kostenlos heilen."}
