{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:26:52.363808Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.frafnar.L92.107", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >88 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Don't you see that I'm trying to write a poem? <sighs> So what's the matter?", "translated": "Siehst du nicht, dass ich versuche, ein Gedicht zu schreiben? <sighs> Also, was ist los?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:26:52.364392Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.frans.L130.252", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >98 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Beeee greeeeted, Simula! What is your neeeed?", "translated": "Bieeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee auf auf euch auf eurer Seite, Simula! Was brauchen Sie?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:27:01.540827Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.freezhild.L80.1296", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: kalten", "examples": ["kalten"]}], "en": "I hope you have a cold day, friend.", "translated": "Ich hoffe, du hast einen kalten Tag, Freund."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:27:01.541342Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.freezhild.L81.1297", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: kalten", "examples": ["kalten"]}], "en": "I hope you have a cold day, friend.", "translated": "Ich hoffe, du hast einen kalten Tag, Freund."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:27:05.425626Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.frosty.L148.1121", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >195 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: aus", "examples": ["aus"]}], "en": "No, you can't have my nose! If you're in need of a {carrot}, go to the market or just dig up one! Or did you come to bring me a {percht skull}?", "translated": "Nein, meine Nase kannst du nicht haben! Wenn Sie einen {carrot} brauchen, gehen Sie auf den Markt oder graben Sie einfach einen aus! Oder bist du gekommen, um mir einen {percht skull} zu bringen?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:27:10.124306Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.galuna.L59.1204", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >101 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Oh, please come in, |PLAYERNAME|. What do you need? Distance weapons? I sell lots of them.", "translated": "Oh, bitte kommen Sie herein, |PLAYERNAME|. Was brauchen Sie? Distanzwaffen? Ich verkaufe viele davon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:27:14.410980Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.gamon.L76.377", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: tun", "examples": ["tun"]}], "en": "You'll come back. They all do.", "translated": "Du wirst zurückkommen. Das tun sie alle."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:27:14.411969Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.gamon.L78.379", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: meisten, bestimmte", "examples": ["meisten", "bestimmte"]}], "en": "Have a look. Most furniture comes in handy kits. Just use them in your house to assemble the furniture. Do you want to see only a certain type of furniture?", "translated": "Schauen Sie mal rein. Die meisten Möbel werden in praktischen Bausätzen geliefert. Benutzen Sie sie einfach in Ihrem Haus, um die Möbel zusammenzubauen. Möchten Sie nur eine bestimmte Art von Möbeln sehen?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:27:18.742259Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.gareth.L59.1399", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome to the wonderful and only recently opened Museum of Tibian Arts! Free entrance for everybody, but patrons of the arts are wanted and favoured.", "translated": "Willkommen im wunderbaren und erst kürzlich eröffneten Museum für Tibianische Künste! Freier Eintritt für alle, Kunstmäzene sind jedoch gefragt und willkommen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:27:18.743118Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.gareth.L61.1400", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor has sent you? He seems to know that this new museum shines like a diamond. Enjoy your stay! If you like to {support} this place, talk to me.", "translated": "Der Druid von Crunor hat dich geschickt? Er scheint zu wissen, dass dieses neue Museum wie ein Diamant glänzt. Genießen Sie Ihren Aufenthalt! Wenn Sie diesen Ort {support} mögen, sprechen Sie mit mir."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:27:18.744067Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.gareth.L65.1402", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >199 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: letzten, verzweifelt", "examples": ["letzten", "verzweifelt"]}], "en": "You again? How could you flee from the last floor. The cultists should have 'dealt' with you! That beats me. You have to leave this place right now. There's nothing more to say.", "translated": "Du schon wieder? Wie konntest du aus der letzten Etage fliehen? Die Kultisten sollten 'dealt' bei euch haben! Das verzweifelt mich. Du musst diesen Ort sofort verlassen. Es gibt nichts mehr zu sagen."}
