{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:30:00.224657Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iskan.L57.1280", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: nie", "examples": ["nie"]}], "en": "I was told you have been killing huskies here in Svargrond! Never do that again, okay? They are precious animals for us. Give me 500 gold and I will forget that incident without telling it to Jarl Sven. Okay?", "translated": "Mir wurde gesagt, dass Sie hier in Svargrond Huskys getötet haben! Mach das nie wieder, okay? Für uns sind sie wertvolle Tiere. Gib mir 500 Gold und ich werde diesen Vorfall vergessen, ohne es Jarl Sven zu erzählen. Okay?"}
