{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:30:06.252590Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iwar.L84.274", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hiho Storm Killer! Welcome to Kazordoon furniture store.", "translated": "Hiho Sturmkiller! Willkommen im Möbelhaus Kazordoon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:30:11.753182Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iyad.L108.747", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "D...Daraman's blessings... oh, how I m...miss my warm Darashia...", "translated": "D...Daramans Segen... oh, wie sehr ich... mein warmes Darashia vermisse..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:30:11.754421Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jack.L67.1251", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: überhaupt", "examples": ["überhaupt"]}], "en": "You!! What have you told my family? They are mad at me and I don't even know why! They think I lied to them about working in Edron in secrecy! Why should I even do that!", "translated": "Du!! Was hast du meiner Familie erzählt? Sie sind sauer auf mich und ich weiß nicht einmal warum! Sie denken, ich hätte sie angelogen, weil ich heimlich bei Edron gearbeitet habe! Warum sollte ich das überhaupt tun!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:30:16.088697Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jack.L77.1253", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: nicht", "examples": ["nicht"]}], "en": "Yes? What can I do for you? I hope this won't take long, though.", "translated": "Ja? Was kann ich für Sie tun? Ich hoffe aber, dass das nicht lange dauern wird."}
