{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:32:01.050245Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.lukosch.L87.215", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: wöchentlichen", "examples": ["wöchentlichen"]}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you feel adventurous? Do you want a weekly {ticket} for the ore wagon system here? You can use it right here to get to the centre of Kazordoon!", "translated": "Willkommen, |PLAYERNAME|! Fühlen Sie sich abenteuerlustig? Möchten Sie hier einen wöchentlichen {ticket} für das Erzwagensystem? Sie können es direkt hier nutzen, um ins Zentrum von Kazordoon zu gelangen!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:32:09.361033Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.maealil.L170.1601", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >110 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Willkommen, junger |PLAYERNAME|! Wenn Sie schwer verwundet oder vergiftet sind, kann ich Sie kostenlos {heal}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:32:09.361574Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.maealil.L171.1602", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >95 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.", "translated": "Denken Sie daran: Wenn Sie schwer verwundet oder vergiftet sind, kann ich Sie kostenlos heilen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:32:14.034283Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.malor.L193.131", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: mir", "examples": ["mir"]}], "en": "Farewell, human. When I have taken my rightful place I shall remember those who served me well. Even if they are only humans.", "translated": "Lebe wohl, Mensch. Wenn ich meinen rechtmäßigen Platz eingenommen habe, werde ich mich an diejenigen erinnern, die mir gute Dienste geleistet haben. Auch wenn es nur Menschen sind."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:32:14.035244Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.malunga.L58.1370", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: paar", "examples": ["paar"]}], "en": "Greetings. I have only little time to {spare}, so the conversation will be short. I teach sorcerer {spells} and buy a few magical {ingredients}.", "translated": "Grüße. Ich habe nur wenig Zeit für {spare}, daher wird das Gespräch kurz sein. Ich unterrichte Zauberer {spells} und kaufe ein paar magische {ingredients}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:32:18.765435Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.maris.L91.978", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: guten", "examples": ["guten"]}], "en": "I hope you have a good reason to step near my {ship}, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Ich hoffe, Sie haben einen guten Grund, sich meinem {ship}, |PLAYERNAME| zu nähern."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:32:29.638487Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.marlene.L101.423", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: weiteren", "examples": ["weiteren"]}], "en": "Good bye and come again for another small talk! *waves*", "translated": "Auf Wiedersehen und kommen Sie wieder für einen weiteren Smalltalk! *winkt*"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:32:29.639140Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.marvin.L92.130", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: neueste", "examples": ["neueste"]}], "en": "Ah, you come just in time for the special voting about the most recent {funding} project. I guess you want to participate in it.", "translated": "Ah, Sie kommen gerade rechtzeitig zur Sonderabstimmung über das neueste {funding}-Projekt. Ich schätze, Sie möchten daran teilnehmen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:32:45.582634Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.miraia.L186.1358", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >128 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: erleuchteten", "examples": ["erleuchteten"]}], "en": "Daraman's blessings, |PLAYERNAME|. Welcome to the Enlightened Oasis. Sit down, have a {drink} or some {food}!", "translated": "Daramans Segen, |PLAYERNAME|. Willkommen in der erleuchteten Oase. Setzen Sie sich, trinken Sie einen {drink} oder einen {food}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:00.084878Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.murim.L81.186", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
