{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:08.020334Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nah.bob.L137.839", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: alten", "examples": ["alten"]}], "en": "Bye now, Neutrala |PLAYERNAME|. Visit old Bob again one day!", "translated": "Tschüss, Neutrala |PLAYERNAME|. Besuchen Sie den alten Bob eines Tages noch einmal!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:19.308869Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nina.L61.878", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: große", "examples": ["große"]}], "en": "Beware, if you go any further you will have to fight a large group of Chosen. This place is called the Fire Dragon Dojo. Tread carefully since these are lizard training grounds.", "translated": "Seien Sie vorsichtig, wenn Sie noch weiter gehen, müssen Sie gegen eine große Gruppe von Auserwählten kämpfen. Dieser Ort wird Feuerdrachen-Dojo genannt. Gehen Sie vorsichtig vor, da es sich hier um Übungsplätze für Eidechsen handelt."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:22.145346Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ninev.L185.290", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >95 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.", "translated": "Denken Sie daran: Wenn Sie schwer verwundet oder vergiftet sind, kann ich Sie kostenlos heilen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:28.222657Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nokmir.L100.97", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: bisschen", "examples": ["bisschen"]}], "en": "You are....kind of tall! Hello.", "translated": "Du bist...ein bisschen groß! Hallo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:28.224103Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nomad.L108.168", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: weiterer, eisige", "examples": ["weiterer", "eisige"]}], "en": "Ah, another diciple of the extreme... surviving the icy outdoors? Let me {help}! If you need some first aid out here, I can provide {healing} or grant you an {enhanced} blessing!", "translated": "Ah, ein weiterer Anhänger des Extremen ... die eisige Natur überleben? Lass mich {help}! Wenn Sie hier draußen Erste Hilfe benötigen, kann ich Ihnen {healing} geben oder Ihnen einen {enhanced}-Segen erteilen!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:28.224513Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nomad.L109.169", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: steife", "examples": ["steife"]}], "en": "Keep a stiff upper lip!", "translated": "Behalten Sie eine steife Oberlippe!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:28.224921Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nomad.L110.170", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: steife", "examples": ["steife"]}], "en": "Keep a stiff upper lip!", "translated": "Behalten Sie eine steife Oberlippe!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:33.739631Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.noodles.L105.679", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_language", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Tłumaczenie zawiera 66% nieprzetłumaczonych angielskich słów", "en_kept_ratio": 0.667}], "en": "<sniff> Woof! <sniff>", "translated": "<sniff> Wuff! <sniff>"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:40.442753Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nurik.L105.126", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: besonderen", "examples": ["besonderen"]}], "en": "It's .. It's YOU! At last!! So what's this special proposal you would like to make, my friend?", "translated": "Es ist... Du bist es! Endlich!! Was für einen besonderen Vorschlag möchtest du also machen, mein Freund?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:44.668685Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.nydala.L58.953", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: meisten, bestimmten", "examples": ["meisten", "bestimmten"]}], "en": "Have a look. Most furniture comes in handy kits. Just use them in your house to assemble the furniture. Do you want to see only a certain {type} of furniture?", "translated": "Schauen Sie mal rein. Die meisten Möbel werden in praktischen Bausätzen geliefert. Benutzen Sie sie einfach in Ihrem Haus, um die Möbel zusammenzubauen. Möchten Sie nur einen bestimmten {type} an Möbeln sehen?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:56.397217Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.olrik.L89.583", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: erste", "examples": ["erste"]}], "en": "Here. Don't forget that you need to buy a label too if you want to send a parcel. Always write the name of the {receiver} in the first line.", "translated": "Hier. Vergessen Sie nicht, dass Sie auch ein Etikett kaufen müssen, wenn Sie ein Paket versenden möchten. Schreiben Sie immer den Namen des {receiver} in die erste Zeile."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:56.397890Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.omrabas.L546.362", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >95 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "At last, a visitor! Welcome to my... humble abode. {Scroll} or {mission}?", "translated": "Endlich ein Besucher! Willkommen in meiner... bescheidenen Unterkunft. {Scroll} oder {mission}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:33:56.398804Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.one.eyed.joe.L81.565", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: verfluchte", "examples": ["verfluchte"]}], "en": "Well done! But know this: The cursed crystal seems to regenerate over time. It could be necessary to come back and repeat whatever you have done down there.", "translated": "Gut gemacht! Aber wissen Sie eines: Der verfluchte Kristall scheint sich mit der Zeit zu regenerieren. Es könnte notwendig sein, zurückzukommen und alles zu wiederholen, was Sie dort unten getan haben."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:34:00.453579Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.one.eyed.joe.L83.566", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: gruselige", "examples": ["gruselige"]}], "en": "Hello there. I'm sorry, I hardly noticed you. I'm a bit nervous. The spooky {sounds} down there, you know", "translated": "Hallo. Es tut mir leid, ich habe dich kaum bemerkt. Ich bin etwas nervös. Der gruselige {sounds} da unten, wissen Sie"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:34:00.454222Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ongulf.L254.584", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: guten", "examples": ["guten"]}], "en": "Hello, |PLAYERNAME|. You've come at a good time for our {project}.", "translated": "Hallo, |PLAYERNAME|. Sie kommen zu einem guten Zeitpunkt für unseren {project}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:34:05.228520Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.padreia.L135.554", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >83 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Welcome to our humble guild, wanderer. May I be of any assistance to you?", "translated": "Willkommen in unserer bescheidenen Gilde, Wanderer. Darf ich Ihnen behilflich sein?"}
