{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:34:49.580315Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.raffael.L77.663", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:34:49.580754Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.raffael.L78.664", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:34:49.581476Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rapanaio.boat.L71.128", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >88 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Good bye. Recommend us if you were satisfied with our service.", "translated": "Auf Wiedersehen. Empfehlen Sie uns weiter, wenn Sie mit unserem Service zufrieden waren."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:34:53.201580Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rapanaio.isle.of.evil.L71.1191", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >88 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Good bye. Recommend us if you were satisfied with our service.", "translated": "Auf Wiedersehen. Empfehlen Sie uns weiter, wenn Sie mit unserem Service zufrieden waren."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:34:57.679326Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rata.mari.L103.828", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >116 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Meep? I mean - hello! Sorry, |PLAYERNAME|... Being a {rat} has kind of grown on me.", "translated": "Meep? Ich meine – hallo! Tut mir leid, |PLAYERNAME|... Dass ich ein {rat} bin, ist mir irgendwie ans Herz gewachsen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:05.417425Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.red.lilly.L140.365", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: leere", "examples": ["leere"]}], "en": "Of course, just browse through my wares. Remember that if you buy vials of oil, there's a deposit of 5 gold on the empty one.", "translated": "Stöbern Sie natürlich einfach in meinen Angeboten. Denken Sie daran, dass beim Kauf von Fläschchen mit Öl ein Pfand von 5 Gold auf das leere Fläschchen erhoben wird."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:21.957548Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rokyn.L76.974", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:21.957994Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rokyn.L77.975", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:27.357125Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.romella.L124.642", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: nächste", "examples": ["nächste"]}], "en": "Goodbye and please bring more gold next time <chuckles>. I mean, it would be nice to see you again.", "translated": "Auf Wiedersehen und bitte bringen Sie das nächste Mal mehr Gold mit <kichert>. Ich meine, es wäre schön, dich wiederzusehen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:32.579314Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rottin.wood.L210.1031", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: ganzen, gefährlicher", "examples": ["ganzen", "gefährlicher"]}], "en": "Hunter's greeting! I assume you want something from me since you came all the way out here on your own. This is a dangerous place to be, I doubt that all my men will accept strangers like I do. You don't seem to have any problems with that, though.", "translated": "Hunters Gruß! Ich gehe davon aus, dass du etwas von mir willst, da du den ganzen Weg hierher alleine gekommen bist. Dies ist ein gefährlicher Ort. Ich bezweifle, dass alle meine Männer Fremde so akzeptieren wie ich. Allerdings scheinen Sie damit keine Probleme zu haben."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:32.579937Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rowenna.L59.475", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >125 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: guten", "examples": ["guten"]}], "en": "Welcome to the finest weaponshop in the land, |PLAYERNAME|! Tell me if you're looking for a good {trade}.", "translated": "Willkommen im besten Waffenladen des Landes, |PLAYERNAME|! Sagen Sie mir, ob Sie auf der Suche nach einem guten {trade} sind."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:36.862948Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.saideh.L53.693", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: der", "examples": ["der"]}], "en": "Hello, my name is Saideh. Once this was the entry to the crypt of our heroes. One of the graves belongs to our beloved hero Dayyan. Nowadays it is not a good idea to visit this place.", "translated": "Hallo, mein Name ist Saideh. Einst war dies der Eingang zur Gruft unserer Helden. Eines der Gräber gehört unserem geliebten Helden Dayyan. Heutzutage ist es keine gute Idee, diesen Ort zu besuchen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:58.723090Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L119.965", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: wenig, hervorgehobene", "examples": ["wenig", "hervorgehobene"]}], "en": "Hello again, |PLAYERNAME|! It's great to see you. If you like, we can chat a little. Just use the highlighted {keywords} again to choose a {topic}.", "translated": "Hallo nochmal, |PLAYERNAME|! Schön dich zu sehen. Wenn Sie möchten, können wir uns ein wenig unterhalten. Verwenden Sie einfach erneut das hervorgehobene {keywords}, um ein {topic} auszuwählen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:58.723858Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L251.967", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Good bye traveller, and enjoy your stay on Rookgaard.", "translated": "Auf Wiedersehen, Reisender, und genießen Sie Ihren Aufenthalt auf Rookgaard."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:58.724473Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L70.954", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|, nice to see you on Rookgaard! I saw you walking by and wondered if you could help me. Could you? Please, say {yes}!", "translated": "Hallo |PLAYERNAME|, schön dich auf Rookgaard zu sehen! Ich sah dich vorbeigehen und fragte mich, ob du mir helfen könntest. Könnten Sie? Bitte sagen Sie {yes}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:35:58.725166Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L73.955", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: vielbeschäftigten", "examples": ["vielbeschäftigten"]}], "en": "Oh, |PLAYERNAME|, it's you again! It's probably impolite to disturb a busy adventurer like you, but I really need help. Please, say {yes}!", "translated": "Oh, |PLAYERNAME|, du bist es wieder! Es ist wahrscheinlich unhöflich, einen vielbeschäftigten Abenteurer wie dich zu stören, aber ich brauche wirklich Hilfe. Bitte sagen Sie {yes}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:03.666789Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L83.957", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: sollten", "examples": ["sollten"]}], "en": "Hey, I want to give you a weapon for free! You should not refuse that, in fact you should say '{yes}'!", "translated": "Hey, ich möchte dir eine Waffe kostenlos geben! Das sollten Sie nicht ablehnen, im Gegenteil, Sie sollten '{yes}' sagen!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:07.453160Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.scrutinon.L101.1548", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: zerrissene", "examples": ["zerrissene"]}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|. I have been watching your fate for quite some time. It's about time you came here. Do you seek to enter the riven island of Quirefang or travel back from where you came?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|. Ich habe dein Schicksal schon seit geraumer Zeit beobachtet. Es ist an der Zeit, dass Sie hierher kommen. Möchten Sie die zerrissene Insel Quirefang betreten oder von dort zurückkehren, wo Sie hergekommen sind?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:17.318260Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sherry.mcronald.L60.405", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: weiteren", "examples": ["weiteren"]}], "en": "Grace our home with another visit soon, |PLAYERNAME|.", "translated": "Beehren Sie unser Zuhause bald mit einem weiteren Besuch, |PLAYERNAME|."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:20.676799Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sherry.mcronald.L61.406", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: seltsamer", "examples": ["seltsamer"]}], "en": "What a strange person.", "translated": "Was für ein seltsamer Mensch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:30.307630Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.shoddy.beggar.L172.53", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: alten", "examples": ["alten"]}], "en": "What do you want? Listen to the old madman? If you have nothing to spare, leave me alone.", "translated": "Was willst du? Hören Sie auf den alten Verrückten? Wenn du nichts übrig hast, lass mich in Ruhe."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:30.308779Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.siestaar.L77.571", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:30.309167Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.siestaar.L78.572", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:34.626840Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.simon.the.beggar.L315.1138", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: armer", "examples": ["armer"]}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|. I am a poor man. Please help me.", "translated": "Hallo |PLAYERNAME|. Ich bin ein armer Mann. Bitte hilf mir."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:39.391820Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.simon.the.beggar.L316.1139", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:39.392283Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.simon.the.beggar.L317.1140", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:39.393103Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sinclair.L157.1276", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: unserer", "examples": ["unserer"]}], "en": "Greetings |PLAYERNAME|. I have - very - little time, please make it as short as possible. I may be able to help you if you are here to help us with any of our tasks or missions.", "translated": "Grüße |PLAYERNAME|. Ich habe – sehr – wenig Zeit, bitte machen Sie es so kurz wie möglich. Vielleicht kann ich Ihnen helfen, wenn Sie hier sind, um uns bei einer unserer Aufgaben oder Missionen zu unterstützen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:44.021536Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sissek.L72.1050", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:44.022206Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sissek.L73.1051", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:44.023124Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.skjaar.L89.1578", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: anderes, glaubt", "examples": ["anderes", "glaubt"]}], "en": "Another creature who believes thinks physical strength is more important than wisdom! Why are you disturbing me?", "translated": "Ein anderes Wesen, das glaubt, körperliche Stärke sei wichtiger als Weisheit! Warum störst du mich?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:50.930348Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.spectulus.L70.815", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: oder, sich", "examples": ["oder", "sich"]}], "en": "Ah hello again |PLAYERNAME|! I still have one or two other {missions} for you. There are also some {tasks} someone needs to attend to.", "translated": "Ah hallo nochmal |PLAYERNAME|! Ich habe noch ein oder zwei weitere {missions} für euch. Es gibt auch einige {tasks}, um die sich jemand kümmern muss."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:50.931284Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.stricken.soul.L53.1482", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >229 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "This place is... haunted... heed my warning... there are... ghooooooosts here...! Why are you giving me that... look? I am certain, there aaaaaaare ghosts here - I've seen them! Do you believe me?", "translated": "Dieser Ort ist ... heimgesucht ... Beachten Sie meine Warnung ... es gibt ... Ghooooooosts hier ...! Warum wirfst du mir diesen... Blick zu? Ich bin mir sicher, es gibt hier aaaaaaa Geister – ich habe sie gesehen! Glaubst du mir?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:53.783726Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.suzy.L77.1113", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:58.186831Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.suzy.L78.1114", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:58.187685Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sven.L55.603", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Iskan told me that you killed huskies here in Svargrond. I will be lenient towards you and won't ban you from Svargrond. But you have to pay me a compensation of 1500 gold for each husky you have killed. Are you willing to pay", "translated": "Iskan hat mir erzählt, dass du hier in Svargrond Huskys getötet hast. Ich werde Ihnen gegenüber nachsichtig sein und Sie nicht aus Svargrond verbannen. Aber du musst mir für jeden Husky, den du getötet hast, eine Entschädigung von 1500 Gold zahlen. Sind Sie bereit zu zahlen?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:36:58.188552Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.swolt.L111.235", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >180 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Take a look, but not a sip before you've paid. And I hope it stays like this and you don't get any strange ideas about {rice}.", "translated": "Werfen Sie einen Blick darauf, aber nehmen Sie keinen Schluck, bevor Sie bezahlt haben. Und ich hoffe, dass das so bleibt und Sie keine seltsamen Vorstellungen von {rice} bekommen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:09.749034Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tamoril.L113.1311", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: weiterer, glaubt", "examples": ["weiterer", "glaubt"]}], "en": "Another pesky mortal who believes his gold outweighs his nutrition value.", "translated": "Ein weiterer lästiger Sterblicher, der glaubt, dass sein Gold seinen Nährwert übersteigt."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:09.750563Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tanyt.L100.1187", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >122 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: weiteren", "examples": ["weiteren"]}], "en": "Ah, the wind brings in another visitor. Welcome, dear guest. Are you looking for a {passage} with my carpet?", "translated": "Ah, der Wind bringt einen weiteren Besucher herein. Willkommen, lieber Gast. Suchen Sie einen {passage} zu meinem Teppich?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:13.645138Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tanyt.L101.1188", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >88 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Good bye. Recommend us if you were satisfied with our service.", "translated": "Auf Wiedersehen. Empfehlen Sie uns weiter, wenn Sie mit unserem Service zufrieden waren."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:13.646362Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tarak.sunken.L75.868", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: kostenlosen", "examples": ["kostenlosen"]}], "en": "Want to go back to Yalahar? Just ask me for a free {passage}.", "translated": "Möchten Sie zu Yalahar zurückkehren? Fragen Sie mich einfach nach einem kostenlosen {passage}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:26.533038Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.terrence.L75.456", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: gefürchteten", "examples": ["gefürchteten"]}], "en": "Hey there, you are surely interested in helping the Rathleton city guard, right? Right - especially now since the dreaded minotaurs gain more ground every day.", "translated": "Hallo, Sie sind sicherlich daran interessiert, der Stadtwache von Rathleton zu helfen, oder? Richtig – besonders jetzt, da die gefürchteten Minotauren von Tag zu Tag mehr an Boden gewinnen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:26.533840Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tesha.L77.914", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:26.534245Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tesha.L78.915", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:32.979133Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.thanita.L86.1073", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: von", "examples": ["von"]}], "en": "How could you sneak up on me like this? I thought you were one of THEM! Well, since you are not, what brings you to this wilderness?", "translated": "Wie konntest du dich so an mich heranschleichen? Ich dachte, du wärst einer von IHNEN! Nun, da Sie es nicht sind, was führt Sie in diese Wildnis?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:43.278944Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.the.first.dragon.L149.1115", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >144 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: kleine", "examples": ["kleine"]}], "en": "Hello, my sparring buddy. We should have another fight sometimes. I think you may have earned a little reward.", "translated": "Hallo, mein Sparringskumpel. Manchmal sollten wir uns noch einmal streiten. Ich denke, Sie haben sich vielleicht eine kleine Belohnung verdient."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:49.357772Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.the.orc.king.L61.114", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >102 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Harrrrk! You think you are strong now? You shall never escape my wrath! I am immortal!", "translated": "Harrrrk! Glaubst du, du bist jetzt stark? Du wirst meinem Zorn niemals entkommen! Ich bin unsterblich!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:54.223211Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.the.queen.of.the.banshees.L217.945", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >85 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Yes, flee from death. But know it shall be always one step behind you.", "translated": "Ja, fliehe vor dem Tod. Aber wisse, dass es immer einen Schritt hinter dir sein wird."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:37:54.223935Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.thorgrin.L67.258", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: felsigen", "examples": ["felsigen"]}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! May earth protect you on the rocky grounds. If you need a {passage} back, I can help you.", "translated": "Willkommen, |PLAYERNAME|! Möge die Erde Sie auf dem felsigen Gelände beschützen. Wenn Sie eine {passage}-Rückseite benötigen, kann ich Ihnen helfen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:38:11.849724Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tom.L69.1436", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: ich", "examples": ["ich"]}], "en": "Now, now - we can't work with that. Go back to that wolf den and fulfil your mission! Unless there is anything else I can help you with.", "translated": "Nun, nun – damit können wir nicht arbeiten. Geh zurück in die Wolfshöhle und erfülle deine Mission! Sofern es nichts anderes gibt, bei dem ich Ihnen helfen kann."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:38:33.955141Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tyrias.L173.1272", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >110 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Welcome, young |PLAYERNAME|! If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can {heal} you for free.", "translated": "Willkommen, junger |PLAYERNAME|! Wenn Sie schwer verwundet oder vergiftet sind, kann ich Sie kostenlos {heal}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:38:33.955721Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tyrias.L174.1273", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >95 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}], "en": "Remember: If you are heavily wounded or poisoned, I can heal you for free.", "translated": "Denken Sie daran: Wenn Sie schwer verwundet oder vergiftet sind, kann ich Sie kostenlos heilen."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:00.618938Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L109.1528", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: tolle", "examples": ["tolle"]}], "en": "Oh, well done! Let me take that spider web sample from you - careful, careful... it's sturdy, yet fragile. Thank you! I should be able to make a great paralyse trap with this one. Here, I have something sturdy for you as well - want it?", "translated": "Oh, gut gemacht! Lassen Sie mich diese Spinnennetzprobe von Ihnen nehmen – vorsichtig, vorsichtig ... es ist robust und dennoch zerbrechlich. Danke schön! Damit sollte ich in der Lage sein, eine tolle Lähmungsfalle zu bauen. Hier habe ich auch etwas Robustes für dich – willst du es?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:07.196752Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L128.1531", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: ist", "examples": ["ist"]}], "en": "Oh my, what happened to your hair? Your face is all black, too - it must have been a hell of flames down there. That's so brave of you. Did you get the book?", "translated": "Oh mein Gott, was ist mit deinen Haaren passiert? Auch dein Gesicht ist ganz schwarz – da unten müssen höllische Flammen gewesen sein. Das ist so mutig von dir. Hast du das Buch bekommen?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:07.198462Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L145.1534", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: war", "examples": ["war"]}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|, welcome back! That was great work you did there. Let me give you something for your efforts - you deserve it. Here, want a helmet?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|, willkommen zurück! Das war tolle Arbeit, die du da geleistet hast. Lassen Sie mich Ihnen etwas für Ihre Bemühungen geben – Sie haben es verdient. Hier, willst du einen Helm?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:13.670973Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L156.1537", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: ganze", "examples": ["ganze"]}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. I see you haven't explored the whole crypt yet - do you need explanations again?", "translated": "Grüße, |PLAYERNAME|. Wie ich sehe, hast du noch nicht die ganze Krypta erkundet – brauchst du noch einmal Erklärungen?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:13.671893Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L159.1538", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! Did you find a nice, fleshy bone in the crypt?", "translated": "Willkommen zurück, |PLAYERNAME|! Hast du in der Krypta einen schönen, fleischigen Knochen gefunden?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:13.673127Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L165.1540", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: letzten", "examples": ["letzten"]}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! I'm in a really good mood, I must say. We're almost able to infiltrate Kraknaknork's hideout. I have one last little favour to ask and then my plan is complete. Are you ready?", "translated": "Grüße, |PLAYERNAME|! Ich bin richtig gut drauf, muss ich sagen. Wir sind fast in der Lage, Kraknaknorks Versteck zu infiltrieren. Ich muss Sie noch um einen letzten kleinen Gefallen bitten, und dann ist mein Plan abgeschlossen. Sind Sie bereit?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:13.673934Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L168.1541", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: nordwestlichen, ich, toten", "examples": ["nordwestlichen", "ich", "toten"]}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! But - back so soon? Please find the wasps' lair in the north-western region of Rookgaard and use the flask I gave you on its dead body. Or did you lose the flask?", "translated": "Willkommen zurück, |PLAYERNAME|! Aber – schon bald zurück? Bitte finden Sie das Wespenversteck in der nordwestlichen Region von Rookgaard und verwenden Sie die Flasche, die ich Ihnen gegeben habe, für den toten Körper. Oder hast du die Flasche verloren?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:19.890402Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L177.1544", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: für", "examples": ["für"]}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|, the time of our triumph has come. Are you ready to vanquish Kraknaknork once and for all?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|, die Zeit unseres Triumphs ist gekommen. Bist du bereit, Kraknaknork ein für alle Mal zu besiegen?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:19.891134Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L184.1545", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: kann", "examples": ["kann"]}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|! You're back! And you're covered in orc blood... that can only mean... were you able to kill Kraknaknork?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|! Du bist zurück! Und du bist voller Orkblut ... das kann nur bedeuten ... konntest du Kraknaknork töten?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:19.891692Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L81.1520", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. These are dire times for Rookgaard... have you come to help in our {mission}?", "translated": "Willkommen, Abenteurer |PLAYERNAME|. Es sind schlimme Zeiten für Rookgaard... sind Sie gekommen, um in unserem {mission} zu helfen?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:19.892886Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L87.1522", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: lautes", "examples": ["lautes"]}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. I've heard a loud rumbling from the roof - I hope the stones didn't fall on your toes. Have you loaded at least two catapults?", "translated": "Grüße, |PLAYERNAME|. Ich habe ein lautes Grollen vom Dach gehört – ich hoffe, die Steine ​​sind dir nicht auf die Zehen gefallen. Hast du mindestens zwei Katapulte geladen?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:24.394352Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L90.1523", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: ich", "examples": ["ich"]}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|. Actually I have some more equipment I could give to you, but first I want to see how you fight. You have fought before, haven't you?", "translated": "Grüße, |PLAYERNAME|. Eigentlich hätte ich noch mehr Ausrüstung, die ich dir geben könnte, aber zuerst möchte ich sehen, wie du kämpfst. Du hast schon einmal gekämpft, nicht wahr?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:24.395588Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vescu.L103.84", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: ein", "examples": ["ein"]}], "en": "Hey t-there, you look like someone who enjoys a good {booze}.", "translated": "Hey, du siehst aus wie jemand, der ein gutes {booze} genießt."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:24.396047Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vescu.L196.85", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: weiteres", "examples": ["weiteres"]}], "en": "T-time for another b-beer. <hicks>", "translated": "T-Zeit für ein weiteres B-Bier. <hicks>"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:28.995584Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.virgil.L77.213", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:39:28.996079Z", "lang": "de", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.virgil.L78.214", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: schönen", "examples": ["schönen"]}], "en": "Have a nice day.", "translated": "Einen schönen Tag noch."}
