{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:42:54.858883Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.kilmaresh.quest.1.fafnars.wrath.2.ambassadors.treason.L41.2274", "source": "simple", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You examine the scrolls carefully. Those are orders from Rathleton for the Ambassador. No sign of treason here.", "translated": "Você examina os pergaminhos cuidadosamente. Essas são ordens de Rathleton para o Embaixador. Nenhum sinal de traição aqui."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:43:38.586136Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.ahmet.L182.407", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >93 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "Be mourned pilgrim in flesh. I'm selling general goods. Just ask me for a {trade}.", "translated": "Seja lamentado peregrino em carne e osso. Vendo produtos em geral. Basta me pedir um {trade}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:44:30.894298Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelo.L58.1443", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >157 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a {project} that tries to find out more about this new {area}.", "translated": "O Druid de Crunor? Ele te contou que uma nova caverna apareceu aqui? Isso mesmo. Sou o chefe de um {project} que tenta descobrir mais sobre esse novo {area}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:44:30.895649Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelo.L64.1446", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a project that tries to find out more about this new area.", "translated": "O Druid de Crunor? Ele te contou que uma nova caverna apareceu aqui? Isso mesmo. Sou responsável por um projeto que tenta saber mais sobre esta nova área."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:44:47.412157Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.aruda.L257.1339", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >83 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "Good bye, |PLAYERNAME|. I really hope we'll talk again soon.", "translated": "Adeus, |PLAYERNAME|. Eu realmente espero que possamos conversar novamente em breve."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:45:38.856795Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.bertha.L91.1555", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >87 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "Of course, just browse through my wares. {Footballs} have to be purchased separately.", "translated": "Claro, basta navegar pelos meus produtos. {Footballs} deve ser adquirido separadamente."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:46:34.337880Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.cael.L392.236", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! You must have come around quite a bit. I'm always interested in learning new things about Zao.", "translated": "Saudações, |PLAYERNAME|! Você deve ter mudado bastante. Estou sempre interessado em aprender coisas novas sobre Zao."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:47:03.044101Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.captain.jack.rat.L57.982", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >108 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "Hail, pirat! Come on board to go home! Welcome on board of the ship Flying Bat. Should I set {sail}s?", "translated": "Salve, pirata! Venha a bordo para ir para casa! Bem-vindo a bordo do navio Flying Bat. Devo definir {sail}s?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:47:25.959925Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L115.1097", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hey there, |PLAYERNAME|! Well, that's how trading with NPCs like me works. I think you are ready now to cross the bridge to Rookgaard! Take care!", "translated": "Olá, |PLAYERNAME|! Bem, é assim que funciona a negociação com NPCs como eu. Acho que agora você está pronto para cruzar a ponte para Rookgaard! Tomar cuidado!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:47:25.960564Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L121.1098", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hello again, |PLAYERNAME|! What are you still doing here? You should head over the bridge to Rookgaard village now!", "translated": "Olá de novo, |PLAYERNAME|! O que você ainda está fazendo aqui? Você deveria atravessar a ponte para a vila Rookgaard agora!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:47:33.135731Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.carlos.L243.1101", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Good bye traveller and enjoy your stay on Rookgaard.", "translated": "Adeus viajante e aproveite sua estadia em Rookgaard."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:49:08.778266Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.dukosch.L87.1221", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you feel adventurous? Do you want a weekly {ticket} for the ore wagon system here? You can use it right here to get to the centre of Kazordoon!", "translated": "Bem vindo, |PLAYERNAME|! Você se sente aventureiro? Você quer um {ticket} semanal para o sistema de vagões de minério aqui? Você pode usá-lo aqui mesmo para chegar ao centro de Kazordoon!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:51:04.247494Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.gareth.L59.1399", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome to the wonderful and only recently opened Museum of Tibian Arts! Free entrance for everybody, but patrons of the arts are wanted and favoured.", "translated": "Bem-vindo ao maravilhoso e inaugurado recentemente Museu de Artes Tibianas! Entrada gratuita para todos, mas os patronos das artes são procurados e favorecidos."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:51:04.248251Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.gareth.L61.1400", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor has sent you? He seems to know that this new museum shines like a diamond. Enjoy your stay! If you like to {support} this place, talk to me.", "translated": "O Druid do Crunor enviou para você? Ele parece saber que este novo museu brilha como um diamante. Aproveite sua estadia! Se você gosta de {support} esse lugar, fale comigo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:51:16.639059Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.gewen.L120.1496", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Greetings, traveller |PLAYERNAME|. Where do you want me to {fly} you? Or do you need a weekly ticket for the Kazordoon public lorry transport?", "translated": "Saudações, viajante |PLAYERNAME|. Onde você quer que eu {fly} você? Ou necessita de um bilhete semanal para o transporte público em camião Kazordoon?"}
