{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:52:34.107018Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.guide.tiko.L103.800", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hello there, and welcome to Port Hope! Would you like some information and a map guide?", "translated": "Olá e bem-vindo ao Port Hope! Gostaria de algumas informações e um guia de mapa?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:53:41.359178Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iskan.L57.1280", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I was told you have been killing huskies here in Svargrond! Never do that again, okay? They are precious animals for us. Give me 500 gold and I will forget that incident without telling it to Jarl Sven. Okay?", "translated": "Disseram-me que você tem matado huskies aqui em Svargrond! Nunca mais faça isso, ok? Eles são animais preciosos para nós. Dê-me 500 ouro e esquecerei esse incidente sem contar ao Jarl Sven. OK?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:53:53.005723Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iwar.L84.274", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hiho Storm Killer! Welcome to Kazordoon furniture store.", "translated": "Hiho Assassino da Tempestade! Bem-vindo à loja de móveis Kazordoon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:53:53.006837Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.iyad.L108.747", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "D...Daraman's blessings... oh, how I m...miss my warm Darashia...", "translated": "D...as bênçãos de Daraman... ah, como estou...saudade do meu caloroso Darashia..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:53:59.085649Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.jack.L67.1251", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You!! What have you told my family? They are mad at me and I don't even know why! They think I lied to them about working in Edron in secrecy! Why should I even do that!", "translated": "Você!! O que você disse à minha família? Eles estão bravos comigo e eu nem sei por quê! Eles acham que menti para eles sobre trabalhar em segredo em Edron! Por que eu deveria fazer isso!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:54:32.259818Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.julius.L60.638", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >91 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "Be greeted, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. Please excuse me if I appear {distracted}!", "translated": "Seja saudado, aventureiro |PLAYERNAME|. Por favor, desculpe-me se eu aparecer {distracted}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:55:45.437341Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.lukosch.L87.215", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you feel adventurous? Do you want a weekly {ticket} for the ore wagon system here? You can use it right here to get to the centre of Kazordoon!", "translated": "Bem vindo, |PLAYERNAME|! Você se sente aventureiro? Você quer um {ticket} semanal para o sistema de vagões de minério aqui? Você pode usá-lo aqui mesmo para chegar ao centro de Kazordoon!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:55:58.982693Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.malor.L193.131", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >125 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "Farewell, human. When I have taken my rightful place I shall remember those who served me well. Even if they are only humans.", "translated": "Adeus, humano. Quando eu ocupar meu lugar de direito, lembrarei daqueles que me serviram bem. Mesmo que sejam apenas humanos."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:57:01.559589Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.naji.L76.1424", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome to the Tibian bank, |PLAYERNAME| What can I do for you?", "translated": "Bem-vindo ao banco Tibiano, |PLAYERNAME| O que posso fazer por você?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:57:21.876920Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.noodles.L105.679", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_language", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Tłumaczenie zawiera 66% nieprzetłumaczonych angielskich słów", "en_kept_ratio": 0.667}], "en": "<sniff> Woof! <sniff>", "translated": "<sniff> Uau! <sniff>"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:58:24.097326Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.pukosch.L87.1589", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome, |PLAYERNAME|! Do you feel adventurous? Do you want a weekly {ticket} for the ore wagon system here? You can use it right here to get to the centre of Kazordoon!", "translated": "Bem vindo, |PLAYERNAME|! Você se sente aventureiro? Você quer um {ticket} semanal para o sistema de vagões de minério aqui? Você pode usá-lo aqui mesmo para chegar ao centro de Kazordoon!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:59:25.136944Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.rottin.wood.L210.1031", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hunter's greeting! I assume you want something from me since you came all the way out here on your own. This is a dangerous place to be, I doubt that all my men will accept strangers like I do. You don't seem to have any problems with that, though.", "translated": "Saudação de Hunter! Presumo que você queira algo de mim, já que veio até aqui sozinho. Este é um lugar perigoso para se estar, duvido que todos os meus homens aceitem estranhos como eu. Você não parece ter nenhum problema com isso, no entanto."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:59:56.260109Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L251.967", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Good bye traveller, and enjoy your stay on Rookgaard.", "translated": "Adeus viajante e aproveite sua estadia em Rookgaard."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T07:59:56.260861Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.santiago.L70.954", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hello |PLAYERNAME|, nice to see you on Rookgaard! I saw you walking by and wondered if you could help me. Could you? Please, say {yes}!", "translated": "Olá |PLAYERNAME|, que bom ver você no Rookgaard! Eu vi você passando e me perguntei se você poderia me ajudar. Você poderia? Por favor, diga {yes}!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:00:04.759584Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sarina.L89.76", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >87 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "Of course, just browse through my wares. {Footballs} have to be purchased separately.", "translated": "Claro, basta navegar pelos meus produtos. {Footballs} deve ser adquirido separadamente."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:00:04.760377Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.scrutinon.L101.1548", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "|PLAYERNAME|. I have been watching your fate for quite some time. It's about time you came here. Do you seek to enter the riven island of Quirefang or travel back from where you came?", "translated": "|PLAYERNAME|. Tenho observado seu destino há algum tempo. Já era hora de você vir aqui. Você pretende entrar na ilha dividida de Quirefang ou viajar de volta de onde veio?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:00:55.204828Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.sven.L55.603", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Iskan told me that you killed huskies here in Svargrond. I will be lenient towards you and won't ban you from Svargrond. But you have to pay me a compensation of 1500 gold for each husky you have killed. Are you willing to pay", "translated": "Iskan me contou que você matou huskies aqui em Svargrond. Serei tolerante com você e não vou proibi-lo de Svargrond. Mas você tem que me pagar uma compensação de 1.500 ouro para cada husky que você matou. Você está disposto a pagar"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:01:11.719551Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.tarak.sunken.L75.868", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Want to go back to Yalahar? Just ask me for a free {passage}.", "translated": "Quer voltar para Yalahar? Basta me pedir um {passage} grátis."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:01:23.630786Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.terrence.L75.456", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hey there, you are surely interested in helping the Rathleton city guard, right? Right - especially now since the dreaded minotaurs gain more ground every day.", "translated": "Olá, você certamente está interessado em ajudar a guarda municipal Rathleton, certo? Certo - especialmente agora que os temidos minotauros ganham mais terreno a cada dia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:03:11.972629Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L168.1541", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome back, |PLAYERNAME|! But - back so soon? Please find the wasps' lair in the north-western region of Rookgaard and use the flask I gave you on its dead body. Or did you lose the flask?", "translated": "Bem-vindo de volta, |PLAYERNAME|! Mas - voltou tão cedo? Por favor, encontre o covil das vespas na região noroeste de Rookgaard e use o frasco que lhe dei em seu cadáver. Ou você perdeu o frasco?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:03:19.743370Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.vascalir.L81.1520", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome, adventurer |PLAYERNAME|. These are dire times for Rookgaard... have you come to help in our {mission}?", "translated": "Bem-vindo, aventureiro |PLAYERNAME|. Estes são tempos difíceis para Rookgaard... você veio ajudar em nosso {mission}?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:04:22.473290Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zora.L85.1331", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >87 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "Of course, just browse through my wares. {Footballs} have to be purchased separately.", "translated": "Claro, basta navegar pelos meus produtos. {Footballs} deve ser adquirido separadamente."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:04:27.717008Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.zumtah.L141.1448", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >98 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "Another visitor to this constricted, cosy, calm realm, perfect except for an {exit}. Muhaha.", "translated": "Outro visitante deste reino restrito, aconchegante e calmo, perfeito exceto por um {exit}. Muhaha."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:04:34.172219Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.actions.object.imbuement.shrine.L5.2354", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You did not collect enough knowledge from the ancient Shapers. Visit the Shaper temple in Thais for help.", "translated": "Você não coletou conhecimento suficiente dos antigos Shapers. Visite o templo Shaper em Thais para obter ajuda."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:05:26.635706Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.movements.others.dawnport.tiles.L124.2337", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome to Dawnport! Walk around and explore on your own, or talk to Inigo if you need directions.", "translated": "Bem-vindo ao Dawnport! Caminhe e explore por conta própria ou fale com Inigo se precisar de instruções."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:05:39.826422Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.movements.others.dawnport.tiles.L99.2336", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Use these stairs to enter the Adventurer's Outpost on Dawnport.", "translated": "Use essas escadas para entrar no Posto Avançado do Aventureiro em Dawnport."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:05:39.826986Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.movements.others.dawnport.vocation.trial.L155.2341", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "As this is the first time you try out a vocation, the Guild has kitted you out.", "translated": "Como esta é a primeira vez que você experimenta uma vocação, o Guild preparou você."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:05:46.290962Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.movements.teleport.citizen.L40.2325", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You first need to absolve the Barbarian Test Quest to become citizen!", "translated": "Primeiro você precisa absolver a missão de teste Barbarian para se tornar cidadão!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:05:46.292357Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.movements.teleport.roshamuul.carpet.L16.2323", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The flying carpet brought you back to Thais.", "translated": "O tapete voador trouxe você de volta a Thais."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:06:00.431775Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.chayenne.realm.actions.lever.L11.1689", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You do not have the Chayenne's magical key.", "translated": "Você não tem a chave mágica do Chayenne."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:06:05.939657Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.chayenne.realm.movements.enter.realm.L16.1684", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You do not have level 40+ or missing the Chayenne's magical key.", "translated": "Você não tem nível 40+ ou está faltando a chave mágica do Chayenne."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:06:12.531437Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.cults.of.tibia.actions.counter.agent.L37.2085", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >115 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla pt"}], "en": "A sandstorm has destroyed almost all pillars. The effect of the counteragent worked different than expected.", "translated": "Uma tempestade de areia destruiu quase todos os pilares. O efeito do contra-agente funcionou diferente do esperado."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:06:20.122468Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.cults.of.tibia.actions.document.L10.2103", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "So for a small expense allowance you'll get it back. Just talk to Iwar in Kazordoon for further information.", "translated": "Portanto, por um pequeno subsídio para despesas, você o receberá de volta. Basta falar com Iwar em Kazordoon para mais informações."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:06:41.509346Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.cults.of.tibia.movements.energy.fence.L49.2121", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "As you cross the threshold in to the inner sanctuary of the cult of the Misguided, you feel an eerie presence all around you.", "translated": "Ao cruzar o limiar do santuário interno do culto do Misguided, você sente uma presença misteriosa ao seu redor."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:06:41.510896Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.cults.of.tibia.movements.ice.death.L63.2088", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You are still blessed with Wisdom of Solitude, Spark of the Phoenix, Fire of the Suns, Spiritual Shielding, Embrace of Tibia, Heart of the Mountain, Blood of the Mountain, and Twist of Fate.", "translated": "Você ainda é abençoado com Sabedoria da Solidão, Centelha da Fênix, Fogo dos Sóis, Proteção Espiritual, Abraço de Tibia, Coração da Montanha, Sangue da Montanha e Torção do Destino."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:07:44.261400Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.demon.oak.movements.entrance.L33.1985", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Go talk with Odralk and get the Hallowed Axe to kill The Demon Oak.", "translated": "Vá falar com Odralk e pegue o Machado Sagrado para matar o Demon Oak."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:09:08.968720Z", "lang": "pt", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.scripts.quests.grimvale.actions.closed.silvered.trap.L8.2036", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You may use it in the Feroxa's room.", "translated": "Você pode usá-lo na sala do Feroxa."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:11:32.994270Z", "lang": "nl", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelo.L58.1443", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a {project} that tries to find out more about this new {area}.", "translated": "De Druid van Crunor? Heeft hij je verteld dat hier een nieuwe grot is verschenen? Dat klopt. Ik ben het hoofd van een {project} die meer te weten wil komen over deze nieuwe {area}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T08:11:32.995972Z", "lang": "nl", "category": "server.json", "key": "data.otservbr.global.npc.angelo.L64.1446", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a project that tries to find out more about this new area.", "translated": "De Druid van Crunor? Heeft hij je verteld dat hier een nieuwe grot is verschenen? Dat klopt. Ik ben het hoofd van een project dat probeert meer te weten te komen over dit nieuwe gebied."}
