{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T10:58:13.143386Z", "lang": "ru", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "scripts.2_ambassadors_treason.msg_5", "source": "existing_value", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "mixed_scripts", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Wykryto mieszane skrypty Unicode"}], "action": "retranslate", "en": "You examine the scrolls carefully. Those are orders from Rathleton for the Ambassador. No sign of treason here.", "translated": "Вы внимательно изучаете свитки. Это приказ от Rathleton послу. Никаких признаков измены здесь нет."}
