{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T11:31:48.613372Z", "lang": "de", "category": "scripts.json", "key": "gamestore.desc.namechange_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "MEDIUM", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >89 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla de"}, {"type": "de_noun_lowercase", "severity": "MEDIUM", "message": "DE: Rzeczownik po artykule małą literą: neuen, neues", "examples": ["neuen", "neues"]}], "en": "Are you hunted? Tired of that? Get a new name, a new life!", "translated": "Bist du gejagt? Haben Sie genug davon? Holen Sie sich einen neuen Namen, ein neues Leben!"}
