{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:24:30.718009Z", "lang": "ro", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ambassador_of_rathleton.voice_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "What a beautiful palace. The Kilmareshians are highly skilful architects.", "translated": "Ce frumos palat. Kilmareshienii sunt arhitecți foarte pricepuți."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:24:30.718892Z", "lang": "ro", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ambassador_of_rathleton.voice_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The new treaty of amity and commerce with Kilmaresh is of utmost importance.", "translated": "Noul tratat de prietenie și comerț cu Kilmaresh este de cea mai mare importanță."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:25:08.205131Z", "lang": "ro", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.stdmod_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I wish I could eat some salmon right now... best prepared in Liberty Bay style... yummy.", "translated": "Mi-aș dori să pot mânca niște somon chiar acum... cel mai bine preparat în stil Liberty Bay... delicios."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:25:41.823313Z", "lang": "ro", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.stdmod_28", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I'm trying to explore each spot of Tibia, and one day I'll have seen it all.", "translated": "Încerc să explorez fiecare loc din Tibia și într-o zi le voi vedea pe toate."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:25:41.824542Z", "lang": "ro", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.stdmod_29", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "If you travel to Thais, you really should visit the marvelous castle there.", "translated": "Dacă călătoriți în Thais, chiar ar trebui să vizitați minunatul castel de acolo."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:25:41.826284Z", "lang": "ro", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.stdmod_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "What was that word again in Orcish language... hmm.", "translated": "Care a fost cuvântul ăla din nou în limba orcică... hmm."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:44:39.100659Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_prisoner.greet_msg_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (3 przypadków)", "count": 3}], "en": "Huh? What? I can see! Wow! A non-mino. Did they {capture} you as well?", "translated": "Hein? Quoi? Je peux voir ! Ouah! Un non-mino. Vous ont-ils {capture} également ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:44:39.101820Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_prisoner.say_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (2 przypadków)", "count": 2}], "en": "Hurray! For that I will give you my key for - hmm - let's say ... some apples. Interested?", "translated": "Hourra! Pour cela, je vais vous donner ma clé pour - hmm - disons... quelques pommes. Intéressé?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:45:11.663458Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_restless_soul.multi_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I was captured and tortured to death by the cultists here. They worship a being that they call Ghazbaran ...", "translated": "J'ai été capturé et torturé à mort par les cultistes ici. Ils adorent un être qu'ils appellent Ghazbaran..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:45:26.686663Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.multi_26", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >140 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "The loudness of the gargantuan spectacle around you bursts your hearing, yet you absorb all the sounds around you. ...", "translated": "Le volume du spectacle gargantuesque qui vous entoure fait exploser votre audition, mais vous absorbez tous les sons qui vous entourent. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:45:26.700726Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.multi_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >226 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "I assume you need to get through the gate to reach the evildoer. I can help you if you trust me, wayfarer. I will share a part of my mind with you which should enable you to step through the gate. ...", "translated": "Je suppose que vous devez franchir la porte pour atteindre le malfaiteur. Je peux t'aider si tu me fais confiance, voyageur. Je partagerai avec vous une partie de mon esprit qui devrait vous permettre de franchir la porte. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:45:26.712018Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >120 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "You head north passing countless stones in the crimson sea of stones beneath your feet.", "translated": "Vous vous dirigez vers le nord en passant devant d’innombrables pierres dans la mer cramoisie de pierres sous vos pieds."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:46:13.444812Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >149 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "As you rip the solid stand out of its socket and take it with you, the large gate opens with a deafening rumble. ", "translated": "Alors que vous arrachez le support solide de son support et que vous l'emportez avec vous, le grand portail s'ouvre avec un grondement assourdissant. "}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:46:13.446465Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sleeping_dragon.say_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >121 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "You gasp at the size of the large open gate as you walk through to head further to the east.", "translated": "Vous haletez devant la taille de la grande porte ouverte alors que vous la franchissez pour vous diriger plus vers l'est."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:46:13.449996Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_strange_chalice.greet_msg_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (2 przypadków)", "count": 2}], "en": "Hi? What do you mean 'hi' - can't you see I am a... I have to lower my voice. Did it occur to you, that this 'chalice' does not want to be disturbed?! Leave me alone!", "translated": "Salut? Que veux-tu dire 'hi' - tu ne vois pas que je suis un... Je dois baisser la voix. Vous est-il venu à l'esprit que ce 'chalice' ne veut pas être dérangé ?! Laisse-moi tranquille!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:46:13.457379Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_strange_chalice.multi_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "No water then? Ah drat - er, don't worry, no problem. So, from the day I received news of the discovery of Zao, I wanted to study its inhabitants, wildlife, plants and geography. ...", "translated": "Pas d'eau alors ? Ah merde... euh, ne t'inquiète pas, pas de problème. Ainsi, dès le jour où j'ai reçu la nouvelle de la découverte de Zao, j'ai eu envie d'étudier ses habitants, sa faune, sa flore et sa géographie. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:46:13.458656Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_strange_chalice.multi_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The academy instated the 'Edron-Zaoan Exploration Division' shortly after. I was a founding member and head of the 'Draken' research branch. ...", "translated": "L'académie a instauré le '__PH0__-Zaoan Exploration Division' peu de temps après. J'étais membre fondateur et responsable de la branche de recherche 'Draken'. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:46:13.463758Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_strange_chalice.multi_19", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Well, besides being a renowned sorcerer and scholar at the magic academy in Edron, I am also the proud father of a beautiful daughter, Ivalisse. My little endeavour here must have troubled the poor thing all the time since I left. ...", "translated": "Eh bien, en plus d'être un sorcier et érudit renommé à l'académie de magie de Edron, je suis également le fier père d'une magnifique fille, Ivalisse. Mon petit effort ici a dû troubler la pauvre créature tout le temps depuis mon départ. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:46:45.117697Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_strange_chalice.multi_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Tell her I love her and that I will take care. I have to press on! My research is most valuable to the 'Edron-Zaoan Exploration Division'. You don't happen to have some water, do you? Ah nevermind. It's a long {story}.", "translated": "Dis-lui que je l'aime et que j'en prendrai soin. Je dois continuer ! Mes recherches sont les plus précieuses pour le '__PH0__-Zaoan Exploration Division'. Vous n'auriez pas de l'eau par hasard, n'est-ce pas ? Ah tant pis. C'est un long {story}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:46:45.132697Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_strange_fellow.say_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (2 przypadków)", "count": 2}], "en": "Uh? What do you want?!", "translated": "Euh? Que veux-tu?!"}
