{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:47:14.956044Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_swan.multi_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >143 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "This is everything that remained of my cloak? That's terrible! However, I guess I can put the feathers together again. Yes, that should be enough feathers. ...", "translated": "C'est tout ce qui reste de ma cape ? C'est terrible ! Cependant, je suppose que je peux reconstituer les plumes. Oui, cela devrait suffire. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:47:14.967315Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.a_sweaty_cyclops.say_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >83 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Good good! Woman happy will be. Now me happy too and help you.", "translated": "Bien bien ! La femme sera heureuse. Maintenant, je suis heureux aussi et je t'aide."}
