{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:49:16.452273Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ahmet.multi_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (3 przypadków)", "count": 3}], "en": "What are you talking about?? I was robbed!!!! Someone catch those filthy thieves!!!!! GUARDS! ...", "translated": "De quoi parles-tu?? On m'a volé!!!! Que quelqu'un attrape ces sales voleurs !!!!! GARDES! ..."}
