{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:50:18.793121Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ajax.say_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (2 przypadków)", "count": 2}], "en": "Please? What you mean please? Like I say please you say bye? Please?", "translated": "S'il te plaît? Que veux-tu dire s'il te plaît ? Comme je dis s'il te plaît, tu dis au revoir ? S'il te plaît?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:50:18.794947Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ajax.say_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >107 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Bron gave me present. Ugly, but nice from him. Me want to give present too. You help me?", "translated": "Bron m'a offert un cadeau. Moche, mais gentil de sa part. Moi aussi, je veux offrir un cadeau. Tu m'aides ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:50:50.117474Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.al_dee.stdmod_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >169 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "If you want to explore the dungeons such as the {sewers}, you have to {equip} yourself with the vital stuff I am selling. It's {vital} in the deepest sense of the word.", "translated": "Si vous souhaitez explorer les donjons tels que le {sewers}, vous devez vous {equip} avec les objets vitaux que je vends. C'est {vital} au sens le plus profond du terme."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:50:50.120601Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.al_dee.stdmod_19", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Thais is a crowded town.", "translated": "Thais est une ville peuplée."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:50:50.122430Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.al_dee.stdmod_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Have you ever wondered what that 'main' is people are talking about? Well, once you've reached level 8, you should talk to the {oracle}. You can choose a {profession} afterwards and explore much more of Tibia.", "translated": "Vous êtes-vous déjà demandé de quoi parlait ce 'main' ? Eh bien, une fois que vous avez atteint le niveau 8, vous devriez parler au {oracle}. Vous pouvez ensuite choisir un {profession} et explorer beaucoup plus de Tibia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:50:50.125684Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.al_dee.stdmod_25", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >154 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Blueberries grow on bushes. They're quite common in Tibia. Just pick them from a bush if you need a snack!", "translated": "Les myrtilles poussent sur les buissons. Ils sont assez courants dans Tibia. Cueillez-les simplement dans un buisson si vous avez besoin d’une collation !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:51:20.611968Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.al_dee.stdmod_29", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The big building in the centre of Rookgaard. They have a library, a training centre, a {bank} and the room of the {oracle}. {Seymour} is the teacher there.", "translated": "Le grand bâtiment au centre de Rookgaard. Ils disposent d'une bibliothèque, d'un centre de formation, d'un {bank} et de la salle du {oracle}. {Seymour} est le professeur là-bas."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:51:20.623349Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.al_dee.stdmod_45", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >105 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "He mostly stays by himself. He's a hermit outside of town - good luck finding him.", "translated": "Il reste la plupart du temps seul. C'est un ermite en dehors de la ville. Bonne chance pour le retrouver."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:51:40.023805Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.al_dee.stdmod_49", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >90 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "He's the local tanner. You could try selling fresh corpses or leather to him.", "translated": "C'est le tanneur local. Vous pourriez essayer de lui vendre des cadavres frais ou du cuir."}
