{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:53:08.568842Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.alia.stdmod_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.", "translated": "Il y a cinq bénédictions disponibles dans cinq lieux sacrés : le bouclier {spiritual}, l'étincelle du {phoenix}, le {embrace} de Tibia, le feu du {suns} et la sagesse du {solitude}. De plus, vous pouvez recevoir le {twist of fate} ici."}
