{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:56:51.162964Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.stdmod_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "mixed_language", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Tłumaczenie zawiera 66% nieprzetłumaczonych angielskich słów", "en_kept_ratio": 0.667}], "en": "I'm recovering from a {sea} passage.", "translated": "Je me remets d'un passage {sea}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:56:51.163562Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.stdmod_60", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >105 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "I speak some Orcish words, not many though, just a few basics like '{yes}' and '{no}'.", "translated": "Je prononce quelques mots orques, mais pas beaucoup, juste quelques mots de base comme '{yes}' et '{no}'."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:56:51.164076Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.stdmod_61", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "It's 'mok' in Orcish. I tell you more if you bring me some {food}.", "translated": "C'est 'mok' en orque. Je vous en dis plus si vous m'apportez du {food}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:56:51.165323Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.stdmod_64", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (2 przypadków)", "count": 2}], "en": "Yeah! If you give me some salmon, I'll tell you another Orcish word. Okay?", "translated": "Ouais! Si vous me donnez du saumon, je vous dirai un autre mot orque. D'accord?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:56:51.165793Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.stdmod_65", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Thank you. Orcs call arrows 'pixo'.", "translated": "Merci. Les orques appellent les flèches 'pixo'."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:57:04.936055Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.voice_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I wish I could eat some salmon right now... best prepared in Liberty Bay style... yummy.", "translated": "J'aimerais pouvoir manger du saumon maintenant... mieux préparé dans le style Liberty Bay... délicieux."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:57:04.938156Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.amber.voice_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "What was that word again in Orcish language... hmm.", "translated": "C'était quoi déjà ce mot en langue orque... hmm."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:57:21.450540Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.andrew_lyze.multi_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Well, a while ago powerful magic devices were used all around Tibia. These are chargeable compasses. There was but one problem: they offered the possibility to make people rich in a quite easy way. ...", "translated": "Eh bien, il y a quelque temps, de puissants appareils magiques étaient utilisés partout autour de Tibia. Ce sont des boussoles payantes. Il n’y avait qu’un seul problème : ils offraient la possibilité de rendre les gens riches d’une manière assez simple. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:57:21.469251Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.andrew_lyze.say_12", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "It was decided to collect all of the compasses, destroy them and throw them in the fiery depths of Tibia. I still have some of them here. I {sell} them for a low price if you want.", "translated": "Il fut décidé de récupérer toutes les boussoles, de les détruire et de les jeter dans les profondeurs enflammées de Tibia. J'en ai encore quelques-uns ici. Je les {sell} à petit prix si tu veux."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:57:35.327952Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.andrew_lyze.say_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "This sarcophagus seals the entrance to the caves down there. Only here you can get all the {materials} you need for a working compass of this kind. So no entrance here - no further magic compasses in Tibia. In theory.", "translated": "Ce sarcophage ferme l'entrée des grottes. Seulement ici, vous pouvez obtenir tous les {materials} dont vous avez besoin pour une boussole fonctionnelle de ce type. Donc pas d'entrée ici - plus de boussoles magiques dans Tibia. Théoriquement."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:57:35.335235Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.anerui.stdmod_11", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >97 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "We try to live in harmony with the forces of nature, may they be living or unliving.", "translated": "Nous essayons de vivre en harmonie avec les forces de la nature, qu'elles soient vivantes ou non."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:57:35.336241Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.anerui.stdmod_13", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Life and death are significant parts of the balance.", "translated": "La vie et la mort sont des éléments importants de l'équilibre."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:57:51.421663Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.anerui.stdmod_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Life and death are significant parts of the balance.", "translated": "La vie et la mort sont des éléments importants de l'équilibre."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:57:51.425106Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.anerui.stdmod_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hunters live a life of freedom and closeness to nature, unlike a simple farmer or bugherder.", "translated": "Les chasseurs mènent une vie de liberté et de proximité avec la nature, contrairement à un simple agriculteur ou un bouvier."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:57:51.430906Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aneus.multi_11", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >97 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Nobody knows. But one third of the soldiers died by a disease on the way back. <m>", "translated": "Personne ne le sait. Mais un tiers des soldats sont morts de maladie sur le chemin du retour. <m>"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:08.951587Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aneus.multi_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "... over Tibia came to avenge their friends, and they killed nearly all ... <m>", "translated": "... plus de Tibia sont venus venger leurs amis, et ils ont presque tous tué... <m>"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:08.960966Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aneus.multi_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "... the orcs went back to their cities. The city of Carlin was rescued. <m>", "translated": "... les orcs retournèrent dans leurs villes. La ville de Carlin a été sauvée. <m>"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:08.961943Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aneus.multi_30", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >82 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "... of our king Tibianus III wanted to build the best CITY in whole of Tibia.", "translated": "... de notre roi Tibianus III voulait construire la meilleure VILLE de tout Tibia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:08.962637Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aneus.multi_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Since then, a woman has always been ruling over Carlin and this statue ... <m>", "translated": "Depuis, une femme a toujours régné sur Carlin et cette statue... <m>"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:26.661981Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aneus.multi_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "... and the Red Legion. So that was the story of Carlin and these Fields of Glory. I hope you liked it. *He smiles*", "translated": "... et la Légion Rouge. Voilà donc l'histoire de Carlin et de ces Champs de Gloire. J'espère que vous l'avez aimé. *Il sourit*"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:26.664631Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aneus.stdmod_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >98 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "The orcs attacked the workers from time to time and so they disturbed the WORKS on the city.", "translated": "Les orcs attaquaient les ouvriers de temps en temps et perturbaient ainsi les TRAVAUX de la ville."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:26.668234Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angelina.say_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I will tell you a small secret now. My friend Lynda in Thais can create a blessed wand. Greet her from me, maybe she will aid you.", "translated": "Je vais vous confier un petit secret maintenant. Mon amie Lynda dans Thais peut créer une baguette bénie. Saluez-la de ma part, peut-être qu'elle vous aidera."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:26.669434Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angelo.greet_msg_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a {project} that tries to find out more about this new {area}.", "translated": "Le Druid de Crunor ? Il vous a dit qu'une nouvelle grotte était apparue ici ? C'est exact. Je suis à la tête d'un {project} qui tente d'en savoir plus sur ce nouveau {area}."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:26.671238Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angelo.greet_msg_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Druid of Crunor? He told you that a new cave appeared here? That's right. I'm the head of a project that tries to find out more about this new area.", "translated": "Le Druid de Crunor ? Il vous a dit qu'une nouvelle grotte était apparue ici ? C'est exact. Je suis à la tête d'un projet qui tente d'en savoir plus sur ce nouveau domaine."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:26.673648Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angelo.say_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "MoTA is short for the recently founded Museum of Tibian Arts. We work together in close collaboration. New {results} are communicated to the museum instantly.", "translated": "MoTA est l'abréviation de Musée des Arts Tibiens récemment fondé. Nous travaillons ensemble en étroite collaboration. Les nouveaux {results} sont communiqués au musée instantanément."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:44.471909Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angelo.say_13", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >99 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}, {"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (2 przypadków)", "count": 2}], "en": "Fantastic! Go there and then tell me what you've seen. I've opened the door for you. Take care of yourself!", "translated": "Fantastique! Allez-y et dites-moi ce que vous avez vu. Je t'ai ouvert la porte. Prends soin de toi!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:44.480732Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.multi_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >144 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Our members travel to far away places and cross dangerous areas, many fall prey to enemies or the land ...", "translated": "Nos membres voyagent dans des endroits lointains et traversent des zones dangereuses, beaucoup deviennent la proie des ennemis ou de la terre..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:58:44.482854Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.multi_12", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The mission should be simple to fulfil. For our excavations we have ordered a sturdy pickaxe in Kazordoon. You would have to seek out this trader Uzgod and get the pickaxe for us ...", "translated": "La mission doit être simple à remplir. Pour nos fouilles, nous avons commandé une pioche robuste en Kazordoon. Il faudrait chercher ce commerçant Uzgod et nous procurer la pioche..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:03.270185Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.multi_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "We would like to study some ancient runes that were used by the lizard race. We suspect some relation of the lizards to the founders of Ankrahmun ...", "translated": "Nous aimerions étudier quelques runes anciennes utilisées par la race des lézards. Nous soupçonnons une relation entre les lézards et les fondateurs de Ankrahmun..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:03.271111Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.multi_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Somewhere under the ape infested city of Banuta, one can find dungeons that were once inhabited by lizards...", "translated": "Quelque part sous la ville infestée de singes de Banuta, on peut trouver des donjons qui étaient autrefois habités par des lézards..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:03.271918Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.multi_16", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Look there for an atypical structure that would rather fit to Ankrahmun and its Ankrahmun Tombs. Copy the runes you will find on this structure...", "translated": "Cherchez-y une structure atypique qui conviendrait plutôt à Ankrahmun et ses Tombeaux Ankrahmun. Copiez les runes que vous trouverez sur cette structure..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:03.275249Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.multi_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "As far as we know the ruins found in the north-west of Edron were once inhabited by beings who used such stones. Do you have the heart to go there and to get us such a stone?", "translated": "À notre connaissance, les ruines trouvées au nord-ouest de Edron étaient autrefois habitées par des êtres qui utilisaient de telles pierres. Aurez-vous le cœur d'y aller et de nous procurer une telle pierre ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:03.276637Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.multi_22", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "For sure someone in Ab'Dendriel will own a copy. So you would just have to ask around there. Are you willing to accept this mission?", "translated": "Bien sûr, quelqu'un dans Ab'Dendriel en possédera une copie. Il suffirait donc de demander là-bas. Êtes-vous prêt à accepter cette mission ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:03.277498Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.multi_23", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "We want to learn more about the ancient race of bonelords. We believe the black pyramid north east of Darashia was originally built by them ...", "translated": "Nous voulons en savoir plus sur l'ancienne race des Bonelords. Nous pensons que la pyramide noire au nord-est de Darashia a été construite par eux..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:03.282812Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.multi_29", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "And remember: it's a small teleport for you, but a big teleport for all Tibians! Here is a small present for your efforts!", "translated": "Et rappelez-vous : c'est une petite téléportation pour vous, mais une grande téléportation pour tous les Tibiens ! Voici un petit cadeau pour vos efforts !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:30.779224Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.multi_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >261 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "That is quite courageous. We know, it's much we are asking for. The queen of the banshees lives in the so called Ghostlands, south west of Carlin. It is rumoured that her lair is located in the deepest dungeons beneath that cursed place ...", "translated": "C'est assez courageux. Nous le savons, c'est beaucoup que nous demandons. La reine des banshees vit dans ce qu'on appelle les Ghostlands, au sud-ouest de Carlin. La rumeur dit que son repaire se trouve dans les cachots les plus profonds de cet endroit maudit..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:30.786284Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.say_16", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Did you get the requested pickaxe from Uzgod in Kazordoon?", "translated": "Avez-vous reçu la pioche demandée par Uzgod en Kazordoon ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:49.246713Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.say_25", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "In this mission we require you to get us some plant samples from Tiquandan plants. Would you like to fulfil this mission?", "translated": "Dans cette mission, nous vous demandons de nous procurer des échantillons de plantes de Tiquandan. Souhaitez-vous remplir cette mission ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:49.251540Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.say_31", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The explorer society would like to acquire an ancient urn which is some sort of relic to the lizard people of Tiquanda. Would you like to accept this mission?", "translated": "La société des explorateurs aimerait acquérir une urne ancienne qui serait une sorte de relique du peuple lézard de Tiquanda. Souhaitez-vous accepter cette mission ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T13:59:49.255972Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.say_39", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "We will see if you can handle this simple task. Get the pickaxe from Uzgod in Kazordoon and bring it to one of our bases. Report there about the pickaxe.", "translated": "Nous verrons si vous pouvez gérer cette tâche simple. Récupérez la pioche auprès d'Uzgod à Kazordoon et apportez-la à l'une de nos bases. Signalez-y la pioche."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:00:16.608377Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.say_52", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You have indeed the spirit of an adventurer! In the south-east of Tiquanda is a small settlement of the lizard people ...", "translated": "Vous avez effectivement l'esprit d'un aventurier ! Au sud-est de Tiquanda se trouve un petit village du peuple lézard..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:00:16.609719Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.say_54", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Excellent! So travel to the city of Darashia and then head north-east for the pyramid ...", "translated": "Excellent! Rendez-vous donc jusqu'à la ville de Darashia puis dirigez-vous vers le nord-est en direction de la pyramide..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:00:16.612278Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.say_58", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Excellent. This mission is easy but nonetheless vital. Travel to Ab'Dendriel and get the book.", "translated": "Excellent. Cette mission est facile mais néanmoins vitale. Rendez-vous à Ab'Dendriel et récupérez le livre."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:00:35.199129Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.say_59", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >150 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Let me have a look! Yes, that's what we wanted. A copy of 'Songs of the Forest'. I won't ask any questions about those bloodstains.", "translated": "Laissez-moi jeter un oeil ! Oui, c'est ce que nous voulions. Une copie de 'Songs of the Forest'. Je ne poserai aucune question sur ces taches de sang."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:00:35.200726Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.say_60", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "In the ruins of north-western Edron you should be able to find a memory stone. Good luck.", "translated": "Dans les ruines du nord-ouest de Edron, vous devriez pouvoir trouver une pierre de mémoire. Bonne chance."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:00:35.208539Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.angus.say_73", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "What a strange map. I wonder if any of our explorers recognises this coastal lines. However, you earned yourself another chance to convince me. Why do you think that Farmine would be interesting for us?", "translated": "Quelle étrange carte. Je me demande si l'un de nos explorateurs reconnaît ces lignes côtières. Cependant, vous avez gagné une autre chance de me convaincre. Pourquoi pensez-vous que Farmine serait intéressant pour nous ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:00:51.495257Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.appaloosa.say_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "We can bring you to Thais with one of our coaches for 125 gold. Are you interested?", "translated": "Nous pouvons vous amener à Thais avec l'un de nos coachs pour 125 pièces d'or. Êtes-vous intéressé?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:01:05.968649Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ariella.multi_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The sailors always tell tales about the famous beer of Carlin. You must know, alcohol is forbidden in that city. ...", "translated": "Les marins racontent toujours des histoires sur la fameuse bière de Carlin. Il faut savoir que l'alcool est interdit dans cette ville. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:01:40.310638Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ariella.say_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Did you get a sample of the whisper beer from Carlin?", "translated": "Avez-vous obtenu un échantillon de la bière murmurée de Carlin ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:01:40.317620Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.arito.multi_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (2 przypadków)", "count": 2}], "en": "What?? My name on a deathlist which you retrieved from a nomad?? Show me!! ...", "translated": "Quoi?? Mon nom sur une liste de morts que vous avez récupérée auprès d'un nomade ?? Montre-moi!! ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:02:42.422921Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.armenius.greet_msg_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >82 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Ah, an adventurer. Be greeted and have a seat. How may I {serve} you?", "translated": "Ah, un aventurier. Soyez accueilli et asseyez-vous. Comment puis-je vous {serve} ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:02:42.426891Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aruda.greet_msg_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >116 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Oh, hello, handsome! It's a pleasure to meet you, |PLAYERNAME|. Gladly I have the time to {chat} a bit.", "translated": "Oh, bonjour, beau ! C'est un plaisir de vous rencontrer, |PLAYERNAME|. Heureusement, j'ai le temps de {chat} un peu."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:03:15.990936Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aruda.say_23", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "He should really sell some stylish gowns or something like that. We Tibians never get some clothing of the latest fashion. It's a shame.", "translated": "Il devrait vraiment vendre des robes élégantes ou quelque chose comme ça. Nous, les Tibiens, ne recevons jamais de vêtements à la dernière mode. C'est dommage."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:03:45.687260Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aruda.say_34", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Powerful sorcerers frighten me a little.", "translated": "Les sorciers puissants me font un peu peur."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:03:45.688461Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aruda.say_36", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Druids seldom visit a town, what do you know about druids?", "translated": "Les druides visitent rarement une ville, que savez-vous des druides ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:03:45.693022Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aruda.say_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >87 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Thank you very much. How kind of you to care about me. I am fine, thank you.", "translated": "Merci beaucoup. Comme c'est gentil de ta part de te soucier de moi. Je vais bien merci."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:17.733235Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aurita.multi_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "But there is a fairy who once told me about it. Perhaps she will share her knowledge. You can find her in a small fairy village in the southwest of Feyrist.", "translated": "Mais il y a une fée qui m'en a parlé un jour. Peut-être qu'elle partagera ses connaissances. Vous pouvez la trouver dans un petit village de fées au sud-ouest de Feyrist."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:17.735965Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aurita.multi_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "A long time ago a pixie knight of Maelyrra carried it with her. But when she was flying above the waves she accidentally dropped it and it sunk. I found it but now you may take it and use it to help Feyrist.", "translated": "Il y a bien longtemps, un chevalier lutin de Maelyrra le portait avec elle. Mais alors qu'elle volait au-dessus des vagues, elle l'a accidentellement laissé tomber et il a coulé. Je l'ai trouvé, mais maintenant vous pouvez le prendre et l'utiliser pour aider Feyrist."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:17.738236Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.aurita.multi_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "There is a fairy who once told me about this spell. Perhaps she will share her knowledge. You can find her in a small fairy village in the southwest of Feyrist.", "translated": "Il y a une fée qui m'a parlé un jour de ce sort. Peut-être qu'elle partagera ses connaissances. Vous pouvez la trouver dans un petit village de fées au sud-ouest de Feyrist."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:17.741267Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.avar_tar.multi_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I'm tired of all these young unskilled wannabe heroes. Every Tibian can show his skills or actions by wearing a special outfit. To prove oneself worthy of the demon outfit, this is how it goes: ...", "translated": "J'en ai marre de tous ces jeunes héros en herbe non qualifiés. Chaque Tibian peut montrer ses compétences ou ses actions en portant une tenue spéciale. Pour se montrer digne de la tenue de démon, voici comment procéder : ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:45.212579Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.awarness_of_the_emperor.multi_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I grant you three chests - filled to the lid with platinum coins, a house in the city in which you may reside, a set of the finest armor Zao has to offer, and a casket of never-ending mana. ...", "translated": "Je vous accorde trois coffres - remplis jusqu'au couvercle de pièces de platine, une maison dans la ville dans laquelle vous résidez, un ensemble de la plus belle armure que Zao a à offrir et un cercueil de mana sans fin. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:45.222653Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.azalea.stdmod_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.", "translated": "Il y a cinq bénédictions disponibles dans cinq lieux sacrés : le bouclier {spiritual}, l'étincelle du {phoenix}, le {embrace} de Tibia, le feu du {suns} et la sagesse du {solitude}. De plus, vous pouvez recevoir le {twist of fate} ici."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:45.223387Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.azalea.stdmod_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.", "translated": "Je vois que vous avez reçu la protection spirituelle dans le temple de Whiteflower au sud de Thais."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:45.223934Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.azalea.stdmod_16", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.", "translated": "Je peux sentir que les druides au nord de Carlin vous ont fourni l'Étreinte de Tibia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:45.224587Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.azalea.stdmod_17", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.", "translated": "Je vois que vous avez reçu la bénédiction des deux soleils dans la tour solaire près de Ab'Dendriel."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:45.225339Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.azalea.stdmod_18", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.", "translated": "Je peux sentir que l'étincelle du phénix vous a déjà été donnée par les prêtres nains de la terre et du feu en Kazordoon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:55.990479Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.azalea.stdmod_19", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.", "translated": "Je sens que vous avez déjà parlé à l'ermite Eremo sur l'île de Cormaya et que vous avez reçu cette bénédiction."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:55.991638Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.azalea.stdmod_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.", "translated": "Vous pouvez demander la bénédiction du bouclier spirituel dans le temple de la fleur blanche au sud de Thais."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:55.992156Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.azalea.stdmod_21", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.", "translated": "Les druides au nord de Carlin vous offriront l’étreinte de Tibia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:55.992776Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.azalea.stdmod_22", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.", "translated": "Vous pouvez demander la bénédiction des deux soleils dans la tour solaire près de Ab'Dendriel."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:04:55.993444Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.azalea.stdmod_23", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.", "translated": "L'étincelle du phénix est donnée par les prêtres nains de la terre et du feu en Kazordoon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:05:13.282384Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.baa_leal.multi_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "His identity is still unknown but we have been told that the thief fled to the human settlement called Carlin. I want you to find him and report back to me. Nobody messes with the Efreet and lives to tell the tale! ...", "translated": "Son identité est encore inconnue mais on nous a dit que le voleur s'est enfui vers l'établissement humain appelé Carlin. Je veux que vous le trouviez et que vous me fassiez un rapport. Personne ne s'attaque aux Efreet et vit pour raconter l'histoire ! ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:05:13.284160Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.baa_leal.multi_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >146 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Now go! Travel to the northern city Carlin! Keep your eyes open and look around for something that might give you a clue!", "translated": "Maintenant, partez ! Voyagez dans la ville du nord Carlin ! Gardez les yeux ouverts et cherchez quelque chose qui pourrait vous donner un indice !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:05:13.286449Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.baa_leal.say_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hmmm... I don't think so. Return to Thais and continue your search!", "translated": "Hmmm... Je ne pense pas. Retournez à Thais et continuez votre recherche !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:05:13.293167Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.baa_leal.say_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Then go to Carlin and search for him! Look for something that might give you a clue!", "translated": "Alors allez à Carlin et cherchez-le ! Cherchez quelque chose qui pourrait vous donner un indice !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:05:13.294152Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.baa_leal.say_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hmmm... I don't think so. Return to Thais and continue your search!", "translated": "Hmmm... Je ne pense pas. Retournez à Thais et continuez votre recherche !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:05:46.759570Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.barnabas_dee.say_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "word_repetition", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Powtórzony wyraz 3+ razy"}], "en": "No no no, I need 15 doses of freshly harvested pollen! Please, harvest those 15 doses yourself, to make absolutely sure you have first-rate quality. I am afraid nothing less will do.", "translated": "Non non non, j'ai besoin de 15 doses de pollen fraîchement récolté ! S'il vous plaît, récoltez ces 15 doses vous-même, pour être absolument sûr d'avoir une qualité de premier ordre. Je crains que rien de moins ne suffise."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:05:59.314671Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bashira.voice_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome to Ab'Dendriel's store for general goods.", "translated": "Bienvenue dans le magasin de produits généraux de Ab'Dendriel."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:06:15.386911Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.baxter.voice_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "People of Thais, bring honour to your king by fighting in the orc war!", "translated": "Peuple de Thais, faites honneur à votre roi en combattant dans la guerre des orcs !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:06:15.393465Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.benjamin.voice_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >95 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "If you need help with letters or parcels, just ask me. I can explain everything.", "translated": "Si vous avez besoin d'aide pour des lettres ou des colis, demandez-moi. Je peux tout expliquer."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:06:29.790168Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.berenice.say_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (2 przypadków)", "count": 2}], "en": "Yes! That's the logbook! However... it seems that the water has already destroyed many of the pages. This is not your fault though, you did your best. Thank you!", "translated": "Oui! C'est le journal de bord ! Cependant... il semble que l'eau ait déjà détruit de nombreuses pages. Ce n’est pas de ta faute, tu as fait de ton mieux. Merci!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:06:45.977363Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.billy.stdmod_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >87 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "I came here for peace and leisure, so leave me alone with 'time'.", "translated": "Je suis venu ici pour la paix et les loisirs, alors laissez-moi tranquille avec 'time'."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:07:04.659172Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.billy.stdmod_26", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >110 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "You'll find a lot of dungeons if you look around. One example are the {sewers} below Rookgaard.", "translated": "Vous trouverez de nombreux donjons si vous regardez autour de vous. Un exemple est le {sewers} sous Rookgaard."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:07:21.532810Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.billy.stdmod_47", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >136 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "That's {Obi's} granddaughter. She helps him out by selling {armors} and {shields}. I think she'll be a beauty when she's grown up.", "translated": "C'est la petite-fille de {Obi's}. Elle l'aide en vendant {armors} et {shields}. Je pense qu'elle sera magnifique quand elle sera grande."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:07:21.535062Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.billy.stdmod_50", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >102 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "She lives in the very south of this town, selling her potions. Sweet - well, sweet-loving girl.", "translated": "Elle vit tout au sud de cette ville et vend ses potions. Douce... eh bien, une fille douce et aimante."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:07:36.485054Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.blind_orc.greet_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "partial_translation_mix", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Tłumaczenie to mix EN/lang (>70% EN): 'Ikem Charach Maruk.' (EN: 'Ikem Charach maruk.')"}], "en": "Ikem Charach maruk.", "translated": "Ikem Charach Maruk."}
