{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:07:51.622606Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bloodshade_sacrifice.multi_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >145 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Hm. I see. Well, I will be frank. Every blood sacrifice has its price. Blood money will please the blood god... just as well. ...", "translated": "Hum. Je vois. Eh bien, je serai franc. Chaque sacrifice de sang a son prix. L'argent du sang fera plaisir au dieu du sang... tout aussi bien. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:08:08.352976Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bo_ques.say_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >89 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Whoa! A human! This is no place for you, |PLAYERNAME|. Go and play somewhere else.", "translated": "Waouh ! Un humain ! Ce n'est pas un endroit pour toi, |PLAYERNAME|. Allez jouer ailleurs."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:08:38.803401Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.boozer.say_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Good! Listen closely. Take this bottle and go to Kazordoon. I need a sample of their very special brown ale. You may find a cask in their brewery. Come back as soon as you got it.", "translated": "Bien! Écoutez attentivement. Prenez cette bouteille et allez à Kazordoon. J'ai besoin d'un échantillon de leur bière brune très spéciale. Vous trouverez peut-être un fût dans leur brasserie. Revenez dès que vous l'avez reçu."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:09:11.149979Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.greet_msg_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >89 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Hello, hello, hello, little lady |PLAYERNAME|! What brings you {here}?", "translated": "Bonjour, bonjour, bonjour, petite dame |PLAYERNAME| ! Qu'est-ce qui vous apporte {here} ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:09:11.152291Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.mission_30_t3_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The orc king in the orc fortress Uldrek's Rock and the last one to EITHER Yaman, the green djinn, OR, Nah'Bob, the blue djinn ...", "translated": "Le roi orc dans la forteresse orc Uldrek's Rock et le dernier à SOIT Yaman, le djinn vert, OU, Nah'Bob, le djinn bleu..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:09:11.158109Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.multi_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >150 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Getting some requisites will be your first job. First of all we need a good supply of water squirt flowers ...", "translated": "Obtenir certaines conditions requises sera votre premier travail. Tout d'abord, nous avons besoin d'un bon approvisionnement en fleurs de jet d'eau..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:09:11.159385Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.multi_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I'm making them on my own in my spare time but I need the right material. South of Thais, next to the Whiteflower Temple, you will find the ideal flowers ...", "translated": "Je les fabrique moi-même pendant mon temps libre mais j'ai besoin du bon matériel. Au sud de Thais, à côté du Temple de la Fleur Blanche, vous trouverez les fleurs idéales..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:09:30.497801Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.stdmod_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >88 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "I wonder if they love my water squirt flowers as much as all other plants.", "translated": "Je me demande s’ils aiment mes fleurs de jet d’eau autant que toutes les autres plantes."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:10:21.770804Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.stdmod_21", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >104 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Sell? Hmm, I know a little about magic and by chance I can sell you a truly unusual {weapon}.", "translated": "Vendre? Hmm, je connais un peu la magie et par hasard je peux vous vendre un {weapon} vraiment insolite."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:10:21.778599Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.stdmod_37", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >112 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Did you know that he sells a 'power axe of doom' now? Run and buy it, he only has got three in store.", "translated": "Saviez-vous qu'il vend un 'power axe of doom' maintenant ? Courez et achetez-le, il n’en a que trois en magasin."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:10:54.451831Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.stdmod_39", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >90 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "I know a lot of monster jokes. Just tell me a monster's name, come on.", "translated": "Je connais beaucoup de blagues sur les monstres. Dis-moi juste le nom d'un monstre, allez."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:10:54.456947Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.stdmod_48", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >93 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Why do trolls live underground? ... Because there are so many pks on the surface!", "translated": "Pourquoi les trolls vivent-ils sous terre ? ... Parce qu'il y a tellement de pks en surface !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:10:54.458590Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.stdmod_50", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >81 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Why does the rat have a wooden leg? ... Because it is a former pirate!", "translated": "Pourquoi le rat a-t-il une patte en bois ? ... Parce que c'est un ancien pirate !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:11:11.499062Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bozo.stdmod_60", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >106 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Ah, don't ask me! Usually mages and mystics know more about such stuff.", "translated": "Ah, ne me demandez pas ! Habituellement, les mages et les mystiques en savent plus sur ce genre de choses."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:00.371831Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brasith.stdmod_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Life takes many forms. Plants are a very basic form of life. Its simplicity makes them close to the core of nature.", "translated": "La vie prend plusieurs formes. Les plantes sont une forme de vie très fondamentale. Sa simplicité les rend proches du cœur de la nature."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:12.824274Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brasith.stdmod_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Life takes many forms. Plants are a very basic form of life. Its simplicity makes them close to the core of nature.", "translated": "La vie prend plusieurs formes. Les plantes sont une forme de vie très fondamentale. Sa simplicité les rend proches du cœur de la nature."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:12.827112Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.say_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >141 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "The only person who might have some cough syrup is this druid Ustan. You find him in the tavern. Hmmm the tavern ... <hicks>", "translated": "La seule personne qui pourrait avoir du sirop contre la toux est ce druide Ustan. Vous le trouvez dans la taverne. Hmmm la taverne... <hicks>"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:12.829881Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_13", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "So receive my prayer: 'Your hand shall be guided - your feet shall walk in <hicks> harmony'. Now, take your stake to Tyrias in <hicks> Liberty Bay for the next line of the prayer. I shall let him know what he is to do.", "translated": "Alors recevez ma prière : « Votre main sera guidée – vos pieds marcheront en <hicks> harmonie ». Maintenant, apportez votre pieu à Tyrias dans <hicks> Liberty Bay pour la prochaine ligne de la prière. Je lui ferai savoir ce qu'il doit faire."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:12.836231Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_21", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.", "translated": "Il y a cinq bénédictions disponibles dans cinq lieux sacrés : le bouclier {spiritual}, l'étincelle du {phoenix}, le {embrace} de Tibia, le feu du {suns} et la sagesse du {solitude}. De plus, vous pouvez recevoir le {twist of fate} ici."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:21.748957Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_22", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.", "translated": "Je vois que vous avez reçu la protection spirituelle dans le temple de Whiteflower au sud de Thais."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:21.749586Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_23", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.", "translated": "Je peux sentir que les druides au nord de Carlin vous ont fourni l'Étreinte de Tibia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:21.750290Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_24", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.", "translated": "Je vois que vous avez reçu la bénédiction des deux soleils dans la tour solaire près de Ab'Dendriel."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:21.751076Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_25", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.", "translated": "Je peux sentir que l'étincelle du phénix vous a déjà été donnée par les prêtres nains de la terre et du feu en Kazordoon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:21.751765Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_26", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.", "translated": "Je sens que vous avez déjà parlé à l'ermite Eremo sur l'île de Cormaya et que vous avez reçu cette bénédiction."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:21.752410Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_27", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.", "translated": "Vous pouvez demander la bénédiction du bouclier spirituel dans le temple de la fleur blanche au sud de Thais."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:21.752913Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_28", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.", "translated": "Les druides au nord de Carlin vous offriront l’étreinte de Tibia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:21.753523Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_29", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.", "translated": "Vous pouvez demander la bénédiction des deux soleils dans la tour solaire près de Ab'Dendriel."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:21.754718Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.brewster.stdmod_30", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.", "translated": "L'étincelle du phénix est donnée par les prêtres nains de la terre et du feu en Kazordoon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:12:49.021483Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.briasol.multi_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Rashid sent you, I suppose. Before I sell you that vase, one word of advice. ...", "translated": "Rashid vous a envoyé, je suppose. Avant de vous vendre ce vase, un conseil. ..."}
