{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:14:10.316559Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bruno.stdmod_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >94 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "I like this old salt. I learned much from him. Whatever. You like some fish? *grin*", "translated": "J'aime ce vieux sel. J'ai beaucoup appris de lui. Peu importe. Tu aimes le poisson ? *sourire*"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:14:34.169270Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.budrik.multi_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "By all that is holy! You are a truly great warrior! With much patience! I have just found out the location the hideout of The Horned Fox! I have marked the spot on your map so you can find it. Go there and slay him!! ...", "translated": "Par tout ce qui est saint ! Tu es vraiment un grand guerrier ! Avec beaucoup de patience ! Je viens de découvrir l'emplacement de la cachette du Horned Fox ! J'ai marqué l'endroit sur votre carte pour que vous puissiez le trouver. Allez-y et tuez-le !! ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:14:34.171286Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.budrik.multi_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I want you to kill 5000 minotaurs - no matter where - for me and all the dwarfs of Kazordoon! Are you willing to do that?", "translated": "Je veux que vous tuiez 5 000 minotaures - n'importe où - pour moi et tous les nains de Kazordoon ! Êtes-vous prêt à faire cela ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:14:34.172154Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.budrik.multi_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I want you to kill 5000 minotaurs - no matter where - for me and all the dwarfs of Kazordoon! Are you willing to do that?", "translated": "Je veux que vous tuiez 5 000 minotaures - n'importe où - pour moi et tous les nains de Kazordoon ! Êtes-vous prêt à faire cela ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:14:34.173051Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.budrik.multi_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Funny that you are asking me for a mission! There is indeed something you can do for me. Ever heard about The Horned Fox? Anyway, yesterday his gang has stolen my mining helmet during a raid. ...", "translated": "C'est drôle que tu me demandes une mission ! Il y a effectivement quelque chose que vous pouvez faire pour moi. Avez-vous déjà entendu parler du Horned Fox ? Quoi qu'il en soit, hier, sa bande m'a volé mon casque de mineur lors d'un raid. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:14:34.175693Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.budrik.say_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "We presume the hideout of The Horned Fox is somewhere in the south-west near the coast, good luck finding my mining helmet!", "translated": "Nous supposons que la cachette du Horned Fox se trouve quelque part au sud-ouest, près de la côte, bonne chance pour trouver mon casque de mineur !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:02.344053Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.budrik.say_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Well, I could need help with that damn Horned Fox and his gang, but I guess since you are rather experienced, killing minotaurs would bore you to death. I'll wait for someone else. But thanks!", "translated": "Eh bien, je pourrais avoir besoin d'aide avec ce foutu Horned Fox et sa bande, mais je suppose que comme vous êtes plutôt expérimenté, tuer des minotaures vous ennuierait à mort. J'attendrai quelqu'un d'autre. Mais merci !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:02.345259Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.budrik.say_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I knew you have the guts for that task! We presume the hideout of The Horned Fox somewhere in the south-west near the coast. Good luck!", "translated": "Je savais que tu avais le courage de faire cette tâche ! Nous présumons la cachette du Renard Horned quelque part au sud-ouest, près de la côte. Bonne chance!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:02.349206Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.budrik.stdmod_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The hideout of the Horned Fox is probably a dangerous if not lethal place for inexperienced adventurers. It is the source of all the {trouble} around here.", "translated": "La cachette du Horned Fox est probablement un endroit dangereux, voire mortel, pour les aventuriers inexpérimentés. C'est la source de tous les {trouble} ici."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:02.350412Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.budrik.stdmod_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "He is a minotaur who was kicked out of Mintwallin. He must have some kind of {hideout} nearby.", "translated": "C'est un minotaure qui a été expulsé de Mintwallin. Il doit avoir une sorte de {hideout} à proximité."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:36.140632Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bunny_bonecrusher.multi_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I need a courier to deliver a parcel to the watchtower in Femor Hills. You think you can handle that??", "translated": "J'ai besoin d'un coursier pour livrer un colis à la tour de guet de Femor Hills. Vous pensez que vous pouvez gérer ça ??"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:36.148434Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.bunny_bonecrusher.stdmod_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Our family has been serving the Carlin army since countless generations!", "translated": "Notre famille sert l'armée Carlin depuis d'innombrables générations !"}
