{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:52.573656Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.greet_msg_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Greetings, |PLAYERNAME|! You must have come around quite a bit. I'm always interested in learning new things about Zao.", "translated": "Salutations, |PLAYERNAME| ! Vous avez dû revenir un peu. Je suis toujours intéressé à apprendre de nouvelles choses sur Zao."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:52.575759Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I think in the past, the lizardmen of this country might have worshipped a snake god or goddess just like their brethren in Tiquanda if we can believe the reports from this area. The dragons replaced the snake worship at some point of history. ...", "translated": "Je pense que dans le passé, les hommes-lézards de ce pays auraient pu vénérer un dieu ou une déesse serpent, tout comme leurs frères de Tiquanda, si l'on en croit les rapports de cette région. Les dragons ont remplacé le culte du serpent à un moment donné de l’histoire. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:52.579932Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "His name was Zao and his deeds and exploits are immortalised in lizard folklore. Some of the earliest records in the tomes suggest a slightly different story though. ...", "translated": "Son nom était Zao et ses actes et exploits sont immortalisés dans le folklore des lézards. Certains des premiers enregistrements des tomes suggèrent cependant une histoire légèrement différente. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:52.580782Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_16", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Many records talk about an early lizard dynasty, but I doubt that Zao was a single person born into that dynasty. ...", "translated": "De nombreux documents parlent d'une première dynastie de lézards, mais je doute que Zao soit une personne célibataire née dans cette dynastie. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:52.581764Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_17", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "My guess is that several members of this dynasty are responsible for or connected to the feats that were attributed to the mythical 'Zao'. ...", "translated": "Je suppose que plusieurs membres de cette dynastie sont responsables ou liés aux exploits attribués au mythique 'Zao'. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:52.583066Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_18", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The improbable lifespan of 'Zao' can thus be explained with the time the Zao dynasty reigned. On the other hand, we all know larger-than-life heroes did exist and some of them had an extremely long lifespan. ...", "translated": "La durée de vie improbable de 'Zao' s’explique ainsi avec le règne de la dynastie Zao. D’un autre côté, nous savons tous que des héros plus grands que nature existaient et que certains d’entre eux avaient une durée de vie extrêmement longue. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:52.584288Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_19", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Most likely, he also had children which could explain the mentioning of a Zao family. I think even the lizardmen don't know for sure what happened in such distant past and so this might be one of those riddles that will never be solved. ...", "translated": "Très probablement, il avait aussi des enfants, ce qui pourrait expliquer la mention d'une famille Zao. Je pense que même les hommes-lézards ne savent pas avec certitude ce qui s'est passé dans un passé si lointain et cela pourrait donc être l'une de ces énigmes qui ne seront jamais résolues. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:15:52.586444Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "It seems that the origin of the Zao dynasty was somewhere in the Dragonblaze Peaks, or rather under them. Legends tell of a large fortress, once erected up the highest peak, but now buried deep underground. Who knows, maybe you'll find answers there?", "translated": "Il semble que l’origine de la dynastie Zao se situe quelque part dans les Pics Dragonblaze, ou plutôt sous eux. Les légendes parlent d'une grande forteresse, autrefois érigée sur le plus haut sommet, mais maintenant enfouie profondément sous terre. Qui sait, peut-être y trouverez-vous des réponses ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:16:11.718135Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_23", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "In the parts of the original text that I was able to reconstruct with the help of some alchemy, there were some references to lizard spawns that were sighted in the Tiquanda area and linked to the snake god. ...", "translated": "Dans les parties du texte original que j'ai pu reconstruire à l'aide d'un peu d'alchimie, il y avait des références à des œufs de lézards observés dans la zone Tiquanda et liés au dieu serpent. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:16:11.730996Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_36", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Anyway, you know what else was mentioned in this book? A path down to a hidden cave system below the Muggy Plains. ...", "translated": "Quoi qu’il en soit, savez-vous quoi d’autre a été mentionné dans ce livre ? Un chemin menant à un système de grottes cachées sous le Muggy Plains. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:16:31.057217Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_49", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Have you ever seen the towers of the large lizard city south-east of Zao? It's the last one south of the mountains and who knows how long they are able to hold it. ...", "translated": "Avez-vous déjà vu les tours de la grande cité des lézards au sud-est de Zao ? C'est le dernier au sud des montagnes et qui sait combien de temps ils pourront le tenir. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:16:31.063901Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_52", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I discovered an interesting recipe in this Tome of Knowledge. Maybe you've seen the large rice terraces in Muggy Plains - that is how the lizardmen apparently call that region. ...", "translated": "J'ai découvert une recette intéressante dans ce Tome de Knowledge. Peut-être avez-vous vu les grandes rizières en terrasses de Muggy Plains - c'est ainsi que les hommes-lézards appellent apparemment cette région. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:16:49.273998Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_58", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Did you know that most of the minotaurs you might have met by now do not originally come from Zao? The original minotaur race stood no chance against the united force of dragons and lizards. ...", "translated": "Saviez-vous que la plupart des minotaures que vous avez peut-être rencontrés ne sont pas originaires de Zao ? La race originelle des minotaures n’avait aucune chance face à la force unie des dragons et des lézards. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:16:49.276485Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_60", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The Mooh'Tah masters actually found the continent Zao and started to look for their lost brothers, but it doesn't say whether they actually found any survivors. ...", "translated": "Les maîtres Mooh'Tah ont effectivement trouvé le continent Zao et ont commencé à rechercher leurs frères perdus, mais cela ne dit pas s'ils ont réellement trouvé des survivants. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:16:49.278905Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_63", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Did you know that the lizardmen were among the first races roaming this continent? They were waging war against the orcs, minotaurs and humans on Zao and for a long time it seemed that the forces were even. ...", "translated": "Saviez-vous que les hommes-lézards étaient parmi les premières races à parcourir ce continent ? Ils menaient la guerre contre les orcs, les minotaures et les humains sur Zao et pendant longtemps, il semblait que les forces étaient égales. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:16:49.282727Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.multi_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Dragons are of great symbolism for this land. Even before the dragons came here and took control over Zao, the lizards worshipped the dragons as strong mythical beasts. ...", "translated": "Dragons sont d'un grand symbolisme pour cette terre. Même avant que les dragons ne viennent ici et prennent le contrôle de Zao, les lézards vénéraient les dragons comme de puissantes bêtes mythiques. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:16:49.284850Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.say_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Oh! That sounds fascinating. Have you found a Tome of Knowledge for me to read?", "translated": "Oh! Cela semble fascinant. Avez-vous trouvé un tome de Knowledge à lire ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:17:06.969178Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.say_17", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I've learnt something interesting about the Zao {steppe}.", "translated": "J'ai appris quelque chose d'intéressant sur le Zao {steppe}."}
