{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:17:06.971473Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.say_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "This book actually IS about Zao. Not about the continent, but about the mythical {founder} of the lizard dynasty.", "translated": "Ce livre parle en fait de Zao. Pas sur le continent, mais sur le mythique {founder} de la dynastie des lézards."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:17:06.972829Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.say_22", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The last tome contained a lot of information about status symbols and insignia - such as {thrones} - and reveals some of the power structures in Zao.", "translated": "Le dernier tome contenait de nombreuses informations sur les symboles et insignes de statut – tels que {thrones} – et révélait certaines des structures de pouvoir de Zao."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:17:06.977285Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cael.say_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Oh! That sounds fascinating. Have you found a new Tome of Knowledge for me to read?", "translated": "Oh! Cela semble fascinant. Avez-vous trouvé un nouveau tome de Knowledge à lire ?"}
