{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:18:33.952057Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_gulliver.stdmod_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Ah, you may not have heard of me. I am Captain Gulliver, the first Oramondian for a hundred years to have sailed through the mist to your strange lands.", "translated": "Ah, vous n'avez peut-être pas entendu parler de moi. Je suis le capitaine Gulliver, le premier Oramondien depuis cent ans à avoir navigué à travers la brume vers vos terres étranges."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:18:33.954024Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_gulliver.stdmod_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The 'Sea Goddess' is the most beautiful in Oramond, a whole new model of ship, elegant, sure and swift. There's no weather she can't take!", "translated": "Le 'Sea Goddess' est le plus beau des Oramond, un tout nouveau modèle de navire, élégant, sûr et rapide. Il n'y a aucune météo qu'elle ne puisse supporter !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:18:52.174621Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_gulliver.stdmod_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Ah, your lands are quite a sight! I have only visited Thais so far, but I think of navigating to more cities, when the time - and public demand - comes.", "translated": "Ah, vos terres sont tout un spectacle ! Je n'ai visité que Thais jusqu'à présent, mais je pense naviguer vers d'autres villes, le moment venu - et la demande du public -."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:18:52.185463Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_haba.stdmod_12", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >102 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Yee, I've been chasing that monster for over 20 years now. I promise I'll bring it down!", "translated": "Oui, je poursuis ce monstre depuis plus de 20 ans maintenant. Je promets que je vais le faire tomber !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:19:10.871591Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_haba.stdmod_18", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >82 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "On the high seas there is no queen. At least I didn't see her yet. Hararar!", "translated": "En haute mer, il n’y a pas de reine. Au moins, je ne l'ai pas encore vue. Hararar!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:19:10.874690Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_haba.stdmod_23", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I know Marvik in Thais. He once helped me with a furuncle I had on my ...ahh, doesn't matter. He's a nice gran'pa, though!", "translated": "Je connais Marvik à Thais. Une fois, il m'a aidé avec un furoncle que j'avais sur mon... ahh, ça n'a pas d'importance. Mais c'est un gentil grand-père !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:19:10.877916Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_haba.stdmod_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >116 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Most o' my friends are dead the others don't like me anymore......well, seems there aren't many left.", "translated": "La plupart de mes amis sont morts, les autres ne m'aiment plus... eh bien, il semble qu'il n'en reste plus beaucoup."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:19:28.934212Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_haba_open_sea.say_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Already got enough, huh? I kind o' expected that, landlubber! Let's head for Svargrond! Ready?", "translated": "Vous en avez déjà assez, hein ? Je m'attendais à ça, terrien ! Direction Svargrond ! Prêt?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:19:48.426561Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_haba_open_sea.say_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Y' already wanna give up?? I should've known. I bring ya back to Svargrond, 'kay?", "translated": "Tu veux déjà abandonner ?? J'aurais dû le savoir. Je te ramène à Svargrond, d'accord ?"}
