{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:20:32.365318Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_seagull.stdmod_27", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I'm not sailing there. This route is afflicted by a ghost ship! However I've heard that Captain Fearless from Venore sails there.", "translated": "Je ne navigue pas là-bas. Cet itinéraire est affligé d'un navire fantôme ! Cependant, j'ai entendu dire que le capitaine Fearless de Venore y naviguait."}
