{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:21:26.550030Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.caramellia.stdmod_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "My father wanted me to marry a wealthy Venorean. He understood so little about love and the ways of the heart.", "translated": "Mon père voulait que j'épouse un riche Venoréen. Il comprenait si peu de choses sur l’amour et les voies du cœur."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:21:26.551102Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.caramellia.stdmod_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >110 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "All is lost. With {Winfred} dead, my love has died and I'm only an empty shell without hope or purpose.", "translated": "Tout est perdu. Avec {Winfred} mort, mon amour est mort et je ne suis qu'une coquille vide sans espoir ni but."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:21:26.551927Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.caramellia.stdmod_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "We put all our hope in this far away colony. Sadly, we never made it there and I will never know what our life would have been like in Port Hope.", "translated": "Nous mettons tous nos espoirs dans cette colonie lointaine. Malheureusement, nous n’y sommes jamais arrivés et je ne saurai jamais à quoi aurait ressemblé notre vie en Port Hope."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:21:26.554261Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.caramellia.stdmod_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The bustling streets of Thais are all but a faint memory to me.", "translated": "Les rues animées de Thais ne sont pour moi qu’un vague souvenir."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:21:26.555155Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.caramellia.stdmod_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Carlin is a lovely and green city as far as I remember.", "translated": "Carlin est une ville charmante et verte d'après mes souvenirs."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:21:45.997527Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.carlos.greet_msg_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >122 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Hello again, |PLAYERNAME|! What are you still doing here? You should head over the bridge to Rookgaard village now!", "translated": "Re-bonjour, |PLAYERNAME| ! Que fais-tu encore ici ? Vous devriez traverser le pont jusqu'au village Rookgaard maintenant !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:21:46.003095Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.carlos.greet_msg_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hey there, |PLAYERNAME|! Well, that's how trading with NPCs like me works. I think you are ready now to cross the bridge to Rookgaard! Take care!", "translated": "Salut, |PLAYERNAME| ! Eh bien, c’est ainsi que fonctionne le commerce avec des PNJ comme moi. Je pense que vous êtes maintenant prêt à traverser le pont vers Rookgaard ! Prends soin de toi!"}
