{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:12.771995Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cedrik.stdmod_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "There are five blessings available in five sacred places: the {spiritual} shielding, the spark of the {phoenix}, the {embrace} of Tibia, the fire of the {suns} and the wisdom of {solitude}. Additionally, you can receive the {twist of fate} here.", "translated": "Il y a cinq bénédictions disponibles dans cinq lieux sacrés : le bouclier {spiritual}, l'étincelle du {phoenix}, le {embrace} de Tibia, le feu du {suns} et la sagesse du {solitude}. De plus, vous pouvez recevoir le {twist of fate} ici."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:12.772700Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cedrik.stdmod_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I see you received the spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.", "translated": "Je vois que vous avez reçu la protection spirituelle dans le temple de Whiteflower au sud de Thais."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:12.773246Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cedrik.stdmod_16", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can sense that the druids north of Carlin have provided you with the Embrace of Tibia.", "translated": "Je peux sentir que les druides au nord de Carlin vous ont fourni l'Étreinte de Tibia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:12.773908Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cedrik.stdmod_17", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can see you received the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.", "translated": "Je vois que vous avez reçu la bénédiction des deux soleils dans la tour solaire près de Ab'Dendriel."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:12.774688Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cedrik.stdmod_18", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can sense that the spark of the phoenix already was given to you by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.", "translated": "Je peux sentir que l'étincelle du phénix vous a déjà été donnée par les prêtres nains de la terre et du feu en Kazordoon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:12.775548Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cedrik.stdmod_19", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I can sense you already talked to the hermit Eremo on the isle of Cormaya and received this blessing.", "translated": "Je sens que vous avez déjà parlé à l'ermite Eremo sur l'île de Cormaya et que vous avez reçu cette bénédiction."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:12.777031Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cedrik.stdmod_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You can ask for the blessing of spiritual shielding in the whiteflower temple south of Thais.", "translated": "Vous pouvez demander la bénédiction du bouclier spirituel dans le temple de la fleur blanche au sud de Thais."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:12.777620Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cedrik.stdmod_21", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The druids north of Carlin will provide you with the embrace of Tibia.", "translated": "Les druides au nord de Carlin vous offriront l’étreinte de Tibia."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:25.013803Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cedrik.stdmod_22", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You can ask for the blessing of the two suns in the suntower near Ab'Dendriel.", "translated": "Vous pouvez demander la bénédiction des deux soleils dans la tour solaire près de Ab'Dendriel."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:25.014844Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cedrik.stdmod_23", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The spark of the phoenix is given by the dwarven priests of earth and fire in Kazordoon.", "translated": "L'étincelle du phénix est donnée par les prêtres nains de la terre et du feu en Kazordoon."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:25.022007Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ceiron.multi_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I hope that I am not asking too much of you with this task. I heard of a flower which is currently unique in Tibia and can survive at only one place. ...", "translated": "J'espère que je ne vous en demande pas trop avec cette tâche. J'ai entendu parler d'une fleur qui est actuellement unique en Tibia et qui ne peut survivre qu'à un seul endroit. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:40.804601Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ceiron.multi_19", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >185 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "In the mountains between Ankrahmun and Tiquanda are two hydra lairs. The nothern one has many waterfalls whereas the southern one has just tiny water trickles. ...", "translated": "Dans les montagnes entre Ankrahmun et Tiquanda se trouvent deux repaires d'hydres. Celui du nord a de nombreuses cascades tandis que celui du sud n'a que de minuscules filets d'eau. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:40.806054Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ceiron.multi_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}, {"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >114 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "However, these trickles are said to contain water as pure and clean as nowhere else in Tibia. ...", "translated": "Cependant, on dit que ces filets contiennent de l’eau aussi pure et propre que nulle part ailleurs dans Tibia. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:22:40.811810Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ceiron.multi_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Unfortunately, my intrusion was discovered and I had to run for my life. During my escape, I lost my favourite wolf tooth chain.", "translated": "Malheureusement, mon intrusion a été découverte et j'ai dû fuir pour sauver ma vie. Lors de mon évasion, j'ai perdu ma chaîne en dents de loup préférée."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:23:10.579403Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.ceiron.say_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Right, I will keep my promise. Faolan roams Tibia freely, but her favourite sleeping cave is on Cormaya. I will now enchant you so you will be able to speak the wolf language.", "translated": "C'est vrai, je tiendrai ma promesse. Faolan parcourt librement Tibia, mais sa grotte endormie préférée se trouve sur Cormaya. Je vais maintenant vous enchanter pour que vous puissiez parler la langue du loup."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T14:23:41.049071Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.charles.multi_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Few ship captains would sail this route. But if you want to take the risk, I can bring you to Thais, Edron, Liberty Bay or Yalahar for less gold than usual. Interested?", "translated": "Peu de capitaines de navires emprunteraient cette route. Mais si vous voulez prendre le risque, je peux vous amener à Thais, Edron, Liberty Bay ou Yalahar pour moins d'or que d'habitude. Intéressé?"}
