{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:19:30.667654Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.captain_waverider_island.stdmod_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Do you seek a passage back to Liberty Bay for |TRAVELCOST|?", "translated": "Cherchez-vous un passage vers Liberty Bay pour |TRAVELCOST| ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:12.224976Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chavis.say_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "If you can find some of the nutritious, juicy {roots} in the outskirts of Rathleton, bring them here. We will gladly take bundles of five roots each, and hey - helping us, helps you in the long term, trust me.", "translated": "Si vous pouvez trouver du {roots} nutritif et juteux à la périphérie de Rathleton, apportez-le ici. Nous prendrons volontiers des paquets de cinq racines chacun, et hé - nous aider, vous aide à long terme, croyez-moi."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:27.102815Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Just recently we were able to secretly help our elven friends to exposure an agitator sent by Carlin to poison our connections with them. The elves' reaction wasswift and without compromise ...", "translated": "Tout récemment, nous avons pu secrètement aider nos amis elfes à dénoncer un agitateur envoyé par Carlin pour empoisonner nos relations avec eux. La réaction des elfes fut rapide et sans compromis..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:27.104744Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_12", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "These papers can tell us much about Carlin's plans in the North. We need you to enter 'Hellgate' and to retrieve the papers for us ...", "translated": "Ces documents peuvent nous en dire beaucoup sur les projets de Carlin dans le Nord. Nous avons besoin que vous saisissiez 'Hellgate' et que vous récupériez les papiers pour nous..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:32.709456Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You will continue these investigations at the point where the information that the lost agent has sent us ends. Some of the traders in Port Hope must have connections to persons who are interested in sabotaging our efforts in Tiquanda ...", "translated": "Vous poursuivrez ces investigations là où se terminent les informations que l'agent perdu nous a envoyées. Certains commerçants de Port Hope doivent avoir des liens avec des personnes intéressées à saboter nos efforts en Tiquanda..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:32.711206Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_16", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >92 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Search their personal belongings to find some sort of evidence that we could need!", "translated": "Fouillez leurs effets personnels pour trouver des preuves dont nous pourrions avoir besoin !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:39.216969Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "A mad dwarven technomancer that listens to the name of Blowbeard sent us a blackmailing letter. He demands to deliver all of Thais's gold to him. Else he will destroy the city with an artificial earthquake caused by one of his machines! ...", "translated": "Un technomancien nain fou qui écoute le nom de Blowbeard nous a envoyé une lettre de chantage. Il exige de lui livrer tout l'or de Thais. Sinon, il détruira la ville avec un tremblement de terre artificiel provoqué par l'une de ses machines ! ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:39.218043Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "As he is already missing since decades it is unlikely that he is still alive. Nevertheless, we want you to find out something about the whereabouts of our agent in the ruins in the Green Claw Swamp, north west of Venore ...", "translated": "Comme il est porté disparu depuis des décennies, il est peu probable qu'il soit encore en vie. Néanmoins, nous souhaitons que vous découvriez où se trouve notre agent dans les ruines du marais de la Griffe Verte, au nord-ouest de Venore..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:39.220536Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_23", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >173 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "As a small incentive I think its worthy to mention that he was wearing a quite impressive armor. You may keep it for yourself if you stumble across it.", "translated": "Comme petit encouragement, je pense qu'il vaut la peine de mentionner qu'il portait une armure assez impressionnante. Vous pourrez le garder pour vous si vous tombez dessus."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:45.453306Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_24", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Your first task is to deliver a warning. Illegally, the Venoreans are crafting more ships than the Thaian authorities have allowed them ...", "translated": "Votre première tâche consiste à émettre un avertissement. Illégalement, les Vénoréens fabriquent plus de navires que ce que les autorités thaïlandaises leur autorisent..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:45.454524Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_25", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >112 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Our sources have told us that those ships often end up in the hands of pirates or smugglers ...", "translated": "Nos sources nous ont appris que ces navires finissent souvent entre les mains de pirates ou de contrebandiers..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:45.455358Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_26", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "An official note would strain the relationship between Thais and Venore too much as this would mean that we had to admit officially that we know about those activities ...", "translated": "Une note officielle mettrait trop à rude épreuve la relation entre Thais et Venore car cela signifierait que nous devrions admettre officiellement que nous sommes au courant de ces activités..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:45.456322Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_27", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Still, we can't allow them to continue like this. It will be your task to let them know that we do not tolerate such behaviour. Get a fire bug from Liberty Bay and set their shipyard on fire ...", "translated": "Pourtant, nous ne pouvons pas leur permettre de continuer ainsi. Il vous appartiendra de leur faire savoir que nous ne tolérons pas un tel comportement. Obtenez un bug de feu de Liberty Bay et mettez le feu à leur chantier naval..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:54.064768Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "We need you to find his base in Kazordoon and to kill him before he can use his infernal machine. Bring us his beard as proof of your success.", "translated": "Nous avons besoin que vous trouviez sa base à Kazordoon et que vous le tuiez avant qu'il puisse utiliser sa machine infernale. Apportez-nous sa barbe comme preuve de votre réussite."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:54.067228Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_32", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "You will swear allegiance to Thais alone and abandon the service of any other city. So is it really your wish to become one of our field agents?", "translated": "Vous prêterez allégeance à Thais seul et abandonnerez le service de toute autre ville. Alors, vous souhaitez vraiment devenir l’un de nos agents de terrain ?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:59.873864Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The women of Carlin have the northern city Svargrond in the firm grip of her manicured hands. At the moment, there is little we can do about it but there is one thing that plays into our hands ...", "translated": "Les femmes de Carlin tiennent fermement la ville du nord de Svargrond dans leurs mains manucurées. Pour le moment, nous ne pouvons pas faire grand-chose à ce sujet, mais il y a une chose qui fait le jeu de nos mains..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:59.874675Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_5", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The barbarians have surely at least heard about the fact that alcohol is outlawed in Carlin ...", "translated": "Les barbares ont sûrement au moins entendu parler du fait que l'alcool est interdit en Carlin..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:20:59.876500Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_7", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "It's bad enough that Carlin got a solid foothold in the far North but now the Venoreans also try to move in. They try to gain influence on the barbarian raiders by bribing their leaders or making them great promises ...", "translated": "C'est déjà assez dommage que Carlin ait pris pied solidement dans l'extrême Nord, mais maintenant les Vénoréens tentent également de s'y installer. Ils tentent d'influencer les pillards barbares en soudoyant leurs dirigeants ou en leur faisant de grandes promesses..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:21:06.865109Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.multi_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Here is a signet ring that the Venorean emissaries use to wear. 'Lose' the ring in the north-western corner of the highest level of the tower. They will surely find it there.", "translated": "Voici une chevalière que portaient les émissaires véniriens. 'Lose' l'anneau dans le coin nord-ouest du niveau le plus élevé de la tour. Ils le trouveront sûrement là-bas."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:21:12.705910Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.say_14", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >96 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "We need those intelligence reports, do whatever you need to do agent!", "translated": "Nous avons besoin de ces rapports de renseignement, faites tout ce que vous devez faire, agent !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:21:12.706717Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.say_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Now that Venore is of nearly no importance anymore, there is only Carlin left to deal with.", "translated": "Maintenant que Venore n’a presque plus d’importance, il ne reste plus que Carlin à gérer."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:21:12.707777Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.say_16", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I already heard that our little trick worked quite well. Several officials of Carlin are already on their way to repair the damage done to their diplomatic efforts. It will not only cost them much money but also quite some time.", "translated": "J'ai déjà entendu dire que notre petite astuce fonctionnait plutôt bien. Plusieurs responsables de Carlin sont déjà en route pour réparer les dégâts causés à leurs efforts diplomatiques. Cela leur coûtera non seulement beaucoup d’argent, mais aussi beaucoup de temps."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:21:38.093189Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chester_kahs.say_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "I think they understood the warning the way it was meant. If not, you will have to visit Venore soon again. But for now it's settled.", "translated": "Je pense qu’ils ont compris l’avertissement tel qu’il était prévu. Sinon, vous devrez bientôt visiter à nouveau Venore. Mais pour l'instant c'est réglé."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:21:50.015405Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chief_grarkharok.say_1", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Hahaha! Grarkharok take cloak from pretty girl. Then ... girl is swan. Grarkharok wants eat but flies away. Grarkharok not understand. Not need cloak, too many feathers. Give cloak to To ... Ta ... Tereban in Edron. Getting shiny coins and meat.", "translated": "Hahaha ! Grarkharok prend le manteau de la jolie fille. Alors... la fille est un cygne. Grarkharok veut manger mais s'envole. Grarkharok ne comprend pas. Pas besoin de cape, trop de plumes. Donnez la cape à To ... Ta ... Tereban à Edron. Obtenir des pièces brillantes et de la viande."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:21:50.016204Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chief_grarkharok.say_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >93 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "You no have tasty snake! Bring tasty snake!!! Grarkharok hungry!!", "translated": "Vous n'avez pas de serpent savoureux ! Apportez un serpent savoureux !!! Grarkharok a faim !!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:21:55.874864Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chief_grarkharok.say_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "fr_punctuation_spacing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "FR: Brak spacji przed interpunkcją (2 przypadków)", "count": 2}], "en": "Huh?? No understand!", "translated": "Hein?? No understand!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:22:07.795674Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chief_grarkharok.say_8", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >92 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "You no have dead frog! Bring dead frog!!! Grarkharok hungry!!", "translated": "Vous n'avez pas de grenouille morte ! Apportez une grenouille morte !!! Grarkharok a faim !!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:22:15.272551Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chief_grarkharok.stdmod_12", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >86 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "You have what want! Go go, find lady so be Grarkharok tribe!!", "translated": "Vous avez ce que vous voulez ! Allez, trouvez dame, alors soyez la tribu Grarkharok !!"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:22:21.775860Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chief_grarkharok.stdmod_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >82 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Grarkharok like BOOM, BOOM sound! Go mountain, push rock and BOOM!", "translated": "Grarkharok comme BOOM, BOOM sonne ! Allez en montagne, poussez le rocher et BOUM !"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:22:31.493391Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chondur.multi_10", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Secondly, the high ape magicians of Banuta use banana staves. I would love to learn more about these staves, so please bring me 5 of them also. ...", "translated": "Deuxièmement, les magiciens grands singes de Banuta utilisent des bâtons de banane. J'aimerais en savoir plus sur ces portées, alors s'il vous plaît, apportez-m'en 5 également. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:22:37.598257Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chondur.multi_2", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >98 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Bring me one fresh dead chicken, one fresh dead rat and one fresh dead black sheep, in that order.", "translated": "Apportez-moi un poulet frais mort, un rat frais mort et un mouton noir frais mort, dans cet ordre."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:22:43.987074Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chondur.multi_4", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "HIGH", "issues": [{"type": "partial_translation_mix", "severity": "HIGH", "message": "Tłumaczenie to mix EN/lang (>70% EN): 'Aaaaaaaaahhmmmm Mmmaaaaaaaaaa Kaaaaaamaaaa ...' (EN: 'Aaaaaaaaaahhmmmm Mmmaaaaaaaaaa Kaaaaaamaaaa ...')"}], "en": "Aaaaaaaaaahhmmmm Mmmaaaaaaaaaa Kaaaaaamaaaa ...", "translated": "Aaaaaaaaahhmmmm Mmmaaaaaaaaaa Kaaaaaamaaaa ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:22:48.032279Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chondur.multi_9", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "The dworcs of Tiquanda like to wear certain tribal masks which I would like to take a look at. Please bring me 5 of these masks. ...", "translated": "Les habitants de Tiquanda aiment porter certains masques tribaux sur lesquels j'aimerais jeter un œil. S'il vous plaît, apportez-moi 5 de ces masques. ..."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:23:05.768979Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.chondur.say_26", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Ten prayers for a blessed stake? Don't tell me they made you travel whole Tibia for it! Listen, child, if you bring me a wooden stake, I'll bless it for you. <chuckles>", "translated": "Dix prières pour un pieu béni ? Ne me dis pas qu'ils t'ont fait voyager tout Tibia pour ça ! Écoute, mon enfant, si tu m'apportes un pieu en bois, je le bénirai pour toi. <rires>"}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:23:55.671044Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cipfried.stdmod_13", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Only a few people live in our village, most of them are {merchants}. You can either ask them for a {trade} or about various other topics, like the names of other citizens, their {job} or Tibia in general.", "translated": "Seules quelques personnes vivent dans notre village, la plupart sont des {merchants}. Vous pouvez leur demander soit un {trade}, soit sur divers autres sujets, comme les noms d'autres citoyens, leur {job} ou Tibia en général."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:24:02.835286Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cipfried.stdmod_19", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "There are four vocations in Tibia: {knight}, {sorcerer}, {paladin} or {druid}. Each vocation has its unique special abilities.", "translated": "Il y a quatre vocations en Tibia : {knight}, {sorcerer}, {paladin} ou {druid}. Chaque vocation a ses capacités spéciales uniques."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:24:09.836624Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cipfried.stdmod_20", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Knights are close combat fighters. They usually wield melee weapons such as swords, axes or clubs.", "translated": "Les chevaliers sont des combattants au corps à corps. Ils utilisent généralement des armes de mêlée telles que des épées, des haches ou des massues."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:24:09.837590Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cipfried.stdmod_21", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Druids are nature magicians. Their speciality is casting ice and earth magic, as well as providing healing for others.", "translated": "Les druides sont des magiciens de la nature. Leur spécialité est de lancer la magie de la glace et de la terre, ainsi que de soigner les autres."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:24:09.838589Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cipfried.stdmod_22", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Paladins are well-trained distance fighters and can cast holy magic. You will usually see them wearing bows or crossbows.", "translated": "Les paladins sont des combattants à distance bien entraînés et peuvent lancer de la magie sacrée. Vous les verrez généralement porter des arcs ou des arbalètes."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:24:09.839309Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cipfried.stdmod_23", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Sorcerers are elemental magicians. They have mastered fire, energy and death magic.", "translated": "Les sorciers sont des magiciens élémentaires. Ils maîtrisent la magie du feu, de l’énergie et de la mort."}
{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:24:22.146476Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cipfried.stdmod_3", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "contains_tibia_proper_noun", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst zawiera nazwę własną Tibia"}], "en": "Welcome to the temple of Rookgaard!", "translated": "Bienvenue dans le temple de Rookgaard !"}
