{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:24:59.723808Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.cipfried.stdmod_6", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >100 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "Me? Oh, I'm just a humble {monk}. Ask me if you need {help} or {healing}.", "translated": "Moi? Oh, je ne suis qu'un humble {monk}. Demandez-moi si vous avez besoin de {help} ou de {healing}."}
