{"timestamp": "2026-02-25T22:26:08.767609Z", "lang": "fr", "category": "npc.json", "key": "npc.commander_stone.say_15", "source": "google_translate", "severity": "LOW", "issues": [{"type": "diacritics_missing", "severity": "LOW", "message": "Tekst >224 znaków bez oczekiwanych diakrytyków dla fr"}], "en": "The wigglers have become a pest that threaten our resources and supplies. Kill 10 wigglers in the caves like the mushroon gardens or the truffles ground. {Report} back to me when you are done. ", "translated": "Les wiggles sont devenus un ravageur qui menace nos ressources et nos approvisionnements. Tuez 10 wiggles dans les grottes comme les jardins de champignons ou le terrain aux truffes. {Report} reviens-moi quand tu auras fini. "}
